      "q": "In an electromagnetic system, a quantity defined as the ratio of electric dipole moment and magnetic dipole moment has dimension of $\\left[\\mathrm{M}^{\\mathrm{P}} \\mathrm{L}^{\\mathrm{Q}} \\mathrm{T}^R A^{\\mathrm{S}}\\right]$. The value of P and Q are :",
      "qHtml": "<p>In an electromagnetic system, a quantity defined as the ratio of electric dipole moment and magnetic dipole moment has dimension of $\\left[\\mathrm{M}^{\\mathrm{P}} \\mathrm{L}^{\\mathrm{Q}} \\mathrm{T}^R A^{\\mathrm{S}}\\right]$. The value of P and Q are :</p>",
