      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. In general, one vernier scale division is smaller than one main scale division but in some modified cases it may be not correct. Also least count is given by one main scale division divided by number of vernier scale division for normal vernier calliper.\n\nHence, option 2 is correct.",
