      "qHtml": "Match List <b>I</b> with List <b>II</b><br><br>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th colspan=\"2\"> LIST I </th>\n    <th colspan=\"2\"> LIST II </th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>A.</td>\n    <td>Angular momentum</td>\n    <td>I.</td>\n    <td>$\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{2} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2}\\right]$</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>B.</td>\n    <td>Torque</td>\n    <td>II.</td>\n    <td>$\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{-2} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2}\\right]$</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>C.</td>\n    <td>Stress</td>\n    <td>III</td>\n    <td>$\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{2} \\mathrm{~T}^{-1}\\right]$</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>D.</td>\n    <td>Pressure gradient</td>\n    <td>IV.</td>\n    <td>$\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{-1} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2}\\right]$</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><br>\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:",
