      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 31st January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $\\vec{L}=\\vec{r} \\times \\vec{p} \\Rightarrow[\\mathrm{L}]=\\left[\\mathrm{M}^{0} \\mathrm{~L}^{1} \\mathrm{~T}^{0}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{M}^{1} \\mathrm{~L}^{1} \\mathrm{~T}^{-1}\\right]$\n\n$$\n=\\left[\\mathrm{M}^{1} \\mathrm{~L}^{2} \\mathrm{~T}^{-1}\\right]\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec{\\tau}=\\vec{r} \\times \\vec{F} \\Rightarrow[\\tau] & =\\left[\\mathrm{L}^{1}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{MLT}^{-2}\\right] \\\\\\\\\n& =\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{2} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2}\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nStress $\\equiv$ Pressure $=\\frac{F}{A} \\Rightarrow[$ Stress $]=\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{-1} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2}\\right]$\n\nPressure Gradient $=\\frac{d P}{d x} \\Rightarrow[$ Pressure Gradient $]$\n\n$$\n=\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{-2} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2}\\right]\n$$",
