      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 27th August Evening Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2021 (Online) 27th August Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 69 English Explanation]\n\nH = $${1 \\over 2}$$gt 2\n\n$${{9.8 \\times 2} \\over {9.8}}$$ = t 2\n\nt = $$\\sqrt 2 $$ sec\n\n$$\\Delta$$t : time interval between drops\n\nh = $${1 \\over 2}$$g($$\\sqrt 2 $$ $$-$$ 2$$\\Delta$$t) 2\n\n$$\\Delta$$t = $${1 \\over {\\sqrt 2 }}$$\n\nh = $${1 \\over 2}$$g$${\\left( {\\sqrt 2 - {1 \\over {\\sqrt 2 }}} \\right)^2} = {1 \\over 2} \\times 9.8 \\times {1 \\over 2} = {{9.8} \\over 4} = 2.45$$ m\n\nH $$-$$ h = 9.8 $$-$$ 2.45\n\n= 7.35 m",
