      "a": 2,
      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 25th February Evening Shift. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2021 (Online) 25th February Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 85 English Explanation]\n\nFor particle (1)\n\n$$20 + h = 10t + {1 \\over 2}g{t^2}$$ ...... (i)\n\nFor particle (2)\n\n$$h = {1 \\over 2}g{t^2}$$ ..... (ii)\n\nput equation (ii) in equation (i)\n\n$$20 + {1 \\over 2}g{t^2} = 10t + {1 \\over 2}g{t^2}$$\n\nt = 2 sec.\n\nPut in equation (ii)\n\n$$h = {1 \\over 2}g{t^2}$$\n\n$$ = {1 \\over 2} \\times 10 \\times {2^2}$$\n\nh = 20 m\n\nThe height of the building $$ = 25 + 20$$ = 45 m",
