      "qHtml": "The velocity-time graphs of a car and a scooter are shown in the figure. (i) The difference between the distance travelled by the car and the scooter in $$15$$ $$s$$ and (ii) the time at which the car will catch up with the scooter are, respectively.\n<br><br><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l7u6u2wa/df7b24fc-6459-4b2a-a235-cdfea3521dd7/606128a0-3015-11ed-ab58-4f43f7f8c851/file-1l7u6u2wb.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2018 (Online) 15th April Morning Slot Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 104 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
