      "q": "At $t=0$, a body of mass 100 g starts moving under the influence of a force $(5 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+10 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}) \\mathrm{N} \\cdot$ After 2 s its position is $(2 x \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+5 y \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}) \\mathrm{m}$. The ratio $x: y$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .",
      "qHtml": "<p>At $t=0$, a body of mass 100 g starts moving under the influence of a force $(5 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+10 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}) \\mathrm{N} \\cdot$ After 2 s its position is $(2 x \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+5 y \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}) \\mathrm{m}$. The ratio $x: y$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .</p>",
