      "qHtml": "<p>Two projectiles are fired from ground with same initial speeds from same point at angles $\\left(45^{\\circ}+\\right.$ $\\alpha)$ and $\\left(45^{\\circ}-\\alpha\\right)$ with horizontal direction. The ratio of their times of flights is</p>",
