      "q": "A river is flowing from west to east direction with speed of $9 \\mathrm{~km} \\mathrm{~h}^{-1}$. If a boat capable of moving at a maximum speed of $27 \\mathrm{~km} \\mathrm{~h}^{-1}$ in still water, crosses the river in half a minute, while moving with maximum speed at an angle of $150^{\\circ}$ to direction of river flow, then the width of the river is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>A river is flowing from west to east direction with speed of $9 \\mathrm{~km} \\mathrm{~h}^{-1}$. If a boat capable of moving at a maximum speed of $27 \\mathrm{~km} \\mathrm{~h}^{-1}$ in still water, crosses the river in half a minute, while moving with maximum speed at an angle of $150^{\\circ}$ to direction of river flow, then the width of the river is :</p>",
