      "qHtml": "A vehicle travels $4 \\mathrm{~km}$ with speed of $3 \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{h}$ and another $4 \\mathrm{~km}$ with speed of $5 \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{h}$, then its average speed is",
