      "a": 2,
      "s": "JEE Main 2022 (Online) 27th July Evening Shift. Correct option: C. S = 4 cm\n\n$$v{'_4} = {v \\over 3}$$, a = constant\n\n$${v_{4 + x}} = 0$$\n\n$$\\left( {{v^2} - {{{v^2}} \\over a}} \\right) = 2a(4)$$\n\n$$({v^2} - 0) = 2a(4 + x)$$\n\n$${4 \\over {4 + x}} = {8 \\over 9}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow x = 0.5$$ m",
      "source": "JEE Main 2022 (Online) 27th July Evening Shift | Motion in Two Dimensions | 1l6kmlo5h",
