      "q": "A 4 kg mass moves under the influence of a force $\\vec{F}=\\left(4 t^3 \\hat{i}-3 t \\hat{j}\\right) \\mathrm{N}$ where $t$ is the time in second. If mass starts from origin at $t=0$, the velocity and position after $t=2 \\mathrm{~s}$ will be:",
      "qHtml": "<p>A 4 kg mass moves under the influence of a force $\\vec{F}=\\left(4 t^3 \\hat{i}-3 t \\hat{j}\\right) \\mathrm{N}$ where $t$ is the time in second. If mass starts from origin at $t=0$, the velocity and position after $t=2 \\mathrm{~s}$ will be:</p>",
