      "qHtml": "<p>A block 'A' takes 2 s to slide down a frictionless incline of 30$$^\\circ$$ and length 'l', kept inside a lift going up with uniform velocity 'v'. If the incline is changed to 45$$^\\circ$$, the time taken by the block, to slide down the incline, will be approximately :</p>",
