      "s": "JEE Main 2022 (Online) 29th June Evening Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2022 (Online) 29th June Evening Shift Physics - Laws of Motion Question 84 English Explanation]\n\n$${f_{{r_{\\max }}}} = \\mu N$$\n\n$$ = 0.02 \\times 400$$\n\n= 8 N\n\nLet the acceleration is a as shown then.\n\n$$40 - T = 4a$$\n\n$$T - 8 = 40a$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow a = {{32} \\over {44}} = {8 \\over {11}}$$ m/s 2",
