      "s": "JEE Main 2015 (Offline). Correct option: A. [Diagram: JEE Main 2015 (Offline) Physics - Laws of Motion Question 130 English Explanation 1]\n\nAssuming both the blocks are stationary\n\nFrom the F.B.D of both the blocks we can find,\n\n$$N=F$$\n\nf 1 = 20 N\n\nf 2 = 100 + 20 = 120 N\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2015 (Offline) Physics - Laws of Motion Question 130 English Explanation 2]\n\nConsidering those two blocks as one system and due to equilibrium $$f=120N$$",
