      "q": "Potential energy ( $V$ ) versus distance ( $x$ ) is given by the graph. Rank various regions as per the magnitudes of the force ( $F$ ) acting on a particle from high to low.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Morning Shift Physics - Work Power & Energy Question 12 English]",
