      "s": "JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot. Correct option: B. $$P = Fv$$\n\n$$P = m{{dv} \\over {dt}}v$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $$vdv = {P \\over m}dt$$\n\nIntegrating both sides, we get\n\n$${V^2} = k't$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ V = k\"$$\\sqrt t $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $${{ds} \\over {dt}}$$ = k\"$$\\sqrt t $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $$\\int {ds} = \\int {k''\\sqrt t } dt$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ s $$ \\propto $$ t 3/2",
