      "s": "JEE Main 2016 (Online) 10th April Morning Slot. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2016 (Online) 10th April Morning Slot Physics - Work Power & Energy Question 120 English Explanation]\n\nHere u = 50 m/s , what t = 0\n\n$$\\alpha $$ = $${{\\Delta v} \\over {\\Delta t}}$$ = $${{50 - 0} \\over {0 - 10}}$$ = $$-$$5 m/s 2\n\nSpeed of the body at t = 2 s\n\nv = u + at\n\n= 50 + ($$-$$ 5) $$ \\times $$ 2\n\n= 40 m/s\n\nFrom work energy theorem,\n\n$$\\Delta $$w = $${1 \\over 2}m{v^2} - {1 \\over 2}m{u^2}$$\n\n= $${1 \\over 2}$$ m(v 2 $$-$$u 2 )\n\n= $${1 \\over 2}$$ $$ \\times $$ 10 $$ \\times $$ (40 2 $$-$$ 50 2 )\n\n= 5 $$ \\times $$ ($$-$$10)(90)\n\n= $$-$$ 4500 J",
