      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p>Statement I : An elevator can go up or down with uniform speed when its weight is balanced with the tension of its cable.</p>\n<p>Statement II : Force exerted by the floor of an elevator on the foot of a person standing on it  is more than his/her weight when the elevator goes down with increasing speed.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
