      "q": "The moment of inertia of a square loop made of four uniform solid cylinders, each having radius $R$ and length $L(\\mathrm{R}<\\mathrm{L})$ about an axis passing through the mid points of opposite sides, is (Take the mass of the entire loop as $M$ ) :",
      "qHtml": "<p>The moment of inertia of a square loop made of four uniform solid cylinders, each having radius $R$ and length $L(\\mathrm{R}<\\mathrm{L})$ about an axis passing through the mid points of opposite sides, is (Take the mass of the entire loop as $M$ ) :</p>",
