      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Gravitation Question 12 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{P}}+\\mathrm{k}_{\\mathrm{P}}=\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{o}}+\\mathrm{k}_0 \\\\\n& -\\frac{\\mathrm{GMm}}{4 \\mathrm{R}}+\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{mV}_{\\mathrm{P}}^2=0 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~V}_{\\mathrm{P}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{GM}}{2 \\mathrm{R}}}\n\\end{aligned}\\\\\n&\\text { Choice } 1\n\\end{aligned}$$",
