      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{T}^2 \\propto \\mathrm{r}^3 \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{T}_1^2}{\\mathrm{r}_1^3}=\\frac{\\mathrm{T}_2^2}{\\mathrm{r}_2^3} \\\\\n& \\frac{(200)^2}{\\mathrm{r}^3}=\\frac{\\mathrm{T}_2^2}{\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{r}}{4}\\right)^3} \\\\\n& \\frac{200 \\times 200}{4 \\times 4 \\times 4}=\\mathrm{T}_2^2 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~T}_2=\\frac{200}{4 \\times 2} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~T}_2=25 \\text { days }\n\\end{aligned}$$",
