      "qHtml": "In an experiment, brass and steel wires of length 1 m each with areas of cross section 1mm<sup>2</sup>\n are used. The\nwires are connected in series and one end of the combined wire is connected to a rigid support and other end\nis subjected to elongation. The stress required to produce a net elongation of 0.2 mm is,\n[Given, the Young's Modulus for steel and brass are, respectively, 120 × 10<sup>9</sup>\n N/m<sup>2</sup>\n and 60 × 10<sup>9</sup>\n N/m<sup>2</sup>]",
