      "qHtml": "A steel wire having a radius of 2.0 mm,\ncarrying a load of 4 kg, is hanging from a\nceiling. Given that g = 3.1 p ms<sup>–2</sup>, what will be\nthe tensile stress that would be developed in the\nwire ?",
