      "q": "A 400 g solid cube having an edge of length 10 cm floats in water. How much volume of the cube is outside the water?\n(Given: density of water = 1000 kg m -3 )",
      "qHtml": "<p>A 400 g solid cube having an edge of length 10 cm floats in water. How much volume of the cube is outside the water?</p><p>(Given: density of water = 1000 kg m<sup>-3</sup>)</p>",
