      "qHtml": "<p>A massless spring gets elongated by amount $x_1$ under a tension of 5 N . Its elongation is $x_2$ under the tension of 7 N . For the elongation of $\\left(5 x_1-2 x_2\\right)$, the tension in the spring will be,</p>",
