      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 10th April Evening Slot. Correct option: C. Using Bernoullie’s equation $${v_2} = \\sqrt {v_1^2 + 2gh} $$\n\nEquation of continuity\n\nA 1 V 1 = A 2 V 2\n\n(1 cm 3 )(1m/s) = $$\\left( {{A_2}} \\right)\\left( {\\sqrt {{{\\left( 1 \\right)}^2} + 2 \\times 10 \\times {{15} \\over {100}}} } \\right)$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {A_2}\\left( {\\ln c{m^2}} \\right) = {1 \\over 2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {A_2} = 5 \\times {10^{ - 5}}{m^2}$$",
