      "qHtml": "A jar is filled with two non-mixing liquids $$1$$ and $$2$$ having densities $${\\rho _1}$$  and $${\\rho _2}$$ respectively. A solid ball, made of a material of density $${\\rho _3}$$, is dropped in the jar. It comes to equilibrium in the position shown in the figure. Which of the following is true for $${\\rho _1}$$ , $${\\rho _1}$$ and $${\\rho _3}$$ ?\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/xESx4eROk7ziFNEhE/kwwZFQqY94LmQ2zp1saZIEqnCfKdK/kyNpqYgwXAQBvClXS2ThMS/image.png\" alt=\"AIEEE 2008 Physics - Properties of Matter Question 298 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
