      "q": "When the temperature of a metal wire is\nincreased from 0 o C to 10 o C, its length\nincreases by 0.02%. The percentage change in\nits mass density will be closest to :",
      "qHtml": "When the temperature of a metal wire is\nincreased from 0<sup>o</sup>C to 10<sup>o</sup>C, its length\nincreases by 0.02%. The percentage change in\nits mass density will be closest to :",
