      "qHtml": "<p>The mean free path of a molecule of diameter $5 \\times 10^{-10}$ m at the temperature $41^{\\circ}$C and pressure $1.38 \\times 10^5$ Pa, is given as ________ m.  (Given $k_B = 1.38 \\times 10^{-23}$ J/K).</p>",
