      "q": "Given below are two statements: one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R\n\nAssertion A : If the average kinetic energy of $\\mathrm{H}_2$ and $\\mathrm{O}_2$ molecules, kept in two different sized containers are same, then their temperatures will be same.\n\nReason R : The r.m.s speed of $\\mathrm{H}_2$ and $\\mathrm{O}_2$ molecules are same at same temperature.\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements: one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R</p>\n<p><b>Assertion A :</b> If the average kinetic energy of $\\mathrm{H}_2$ and $\\mathrm{O}_2$ molecules, kept in two different sized containers are same, then their temperatures will be same.</p>\n<p><b>Reason R :</b> The r.m.s speed of $\\mathrm{H}_2$ and $\\mathrm{O}_2$ molecules are same at same temperature.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
