      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& (\\mathrm{KE})_{\\text {Transsational }}=\\left[\\frac{3}{2} \\mathrm{KT}\\right] \\times \\text { no. of molecule } \\\\\n& \\text { No. of molecule }=\\left[\\frac{50}{44} \\times 6.023 \\times 10^{23}\\right] \\\\\n& (\\mathrm{KE})_{\\text {Transsational }}=4108.644 \\mathrm{~J}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
