      "qHtml": "<p>A gas is kept in a container having walls which are thermally non-conducting. Initially the gas has a volume of $800 \\mathrm{~cm}^3$ and temperature $27^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$. The change in temperature when the gas is adiabatically compressed to $200 \\mathrm{~cm}^3$ is:</p>\n<p>(Take $\\gamma=1.5 ; \\gamma$ is the ratio of specific heats at constant pressure and at constant volume)</p>",
