      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 27th July Evening Shift. Correct option: B. Since, each vibrational mode, corresponds to two degrees of freedom, hence, f = 3 (trans.) + 3 (rot.) + 4 $$ \\times $$ 2 (vib.) = 14\n\n& $$\\gamma = 1 + {2 \\over f}$$\n\n$$\\gamma = 1 + {2 \\over {14}} = {8 \\over 7}$$\n\n$$W = {{nR\\Delta T} \\over {\\gamma - 1}} = - 582$$\n\nAs W < 0. work is done on the gas.",
