      "qHtml": "In the reported figure, there is a cyclic process ABCDA on a sample of 1 mol of a diatomic gas. The temperature of the gas during the process A $$\\to$$ B and C $$\\to$$ D are T<sub>1</sub> and T<sub>2</sub> (T<sub>1</sub> &gt; T<sub>2</sub>) respectively.<br><br><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ks0kxlzg/f990e5d7-ee40-4aee-831b-17ade461523b/c031acc0-f6d5-11eb-b326-31a7780220e7/file-1ks0kxlzh.jpg\" alt=\"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 27th July Morning Shift Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 266 English\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>Choose the correct option out of the following for work done if processes BC and DA are adiabatic.",
