        "T<sub>2</sub> = (T<sub>1</sub><sup>2</sup>T<sub>4</sub>)<sup>1/3</sup>;&nbsp;&nbsp;T<sub>3</sub> = (T<sub>1</sub>T<sub>4</sub><sup>2</sup>)<sup>1/3</sup>"
