      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th January Evening Slot. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th January Evening Slot Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 400 English Explanation]\n\nHere, Q 1 = W 1 + Q 2\n\nand Q 2 = W 2 + Q 3\n\nGiven that,\n\nW 1 = W 2\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ Q 1 $$-$$ Q 2 = Q 2 $$-$$ Q 3\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ nC v (T 1 $$-$$ T 2 ) = nC v (T 2 $$-$$ T 3 )\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ T 1 $$-$$ T 2 = T 2 $$-$$ T 3\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ T 2 = $${{{T_1} + {T_3}} \\over 2}$$\n\n= $${{600 + 400} \\over 2}$$\n\n= 500 K",
      "source": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th January Evening Slot | Thermodynamics | phx9mpdrL9aIsIyBmz0DO",
