      "qHtml": "<p>A simple pendulum of string length 30 cm performs 20 oscillations in 10 s . The length of the string required for the pendulum to perform 40 oscillations in the same time duration is</p>\n<p>$\\_\\_\\_\\_$ cm . [Assume that the mass of the pendulum remains same.]</p>",
