      "qHtml": "<p>Two bodies A and B of equal mass are suspended from two massless springs of spring constant k<sub>1</sub> and k<sub>2</sub>, respectively. If the bodies oscillate vertically such that their amplitudes are equal, the ratio of the maximum velocity of A to the maximum velocity of B is</p>",
