      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements. One is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).</p>\n<p>Assertion (A) : A simple pendulum is taken to a planet of mass and radius, 4 times and 2 times, respectively, than the Earth. The time period of the pendulum remains same on earth and the planet.</p>\n<p>Reason (R) : The mass of the pendulum remains unchanged at Earth and the other planet.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
