      "qHtml": "A mass of 5 kg is connected to a spring. The potential energy curve of the simple harmonic motion executed by the system is shown in the figure. A simple pendulum of length 4 m has the same period of oscillation as the spring system. What is the value of acceleration due to gravity on the planet where these experiments are performed?<br><br> <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1kx8w5frm/8109e716-8ff0-4a6e-8b6f-208996d4889a/f85fc810-5e64-11ec-9b01-470ecfc8fa7d/file-1kx8w5frn.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 1st September Evening Shift Physics - Simple Harmonic Motion Question 81 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
