      "q": "A particle moves with simple harmonic motion in a straight line. In first $$\\tau s,$$ after starting from rest it travels a distance $$a,$$ and in next $$\\tau s$$ it travels $$2a,$$ in same direction, then:",
      "qHtml": "A particle moves with simple harmonic motion in a straight line. In first $$\\tau s,$$ after starting from rest it travels a distance $$a,$$ and in next $$\\tau s$$ it travels $$2a,$$ in same direction, then:",
