      "q": "A point source is kept at the center of a spherically enclosed detector. If the volume of the detector increased by 8 times, the intensity will",
      "qHtml": "<p>A point source is kept at the center of a spherically enclosed detector. If the volume of the detector increased by 8 times, the intensity will</p>",
