      "q": "Two harmonic waves moving in the same direction superimpose to form a wave $x=\\mathrm{a} \\cos (1.5 \\mathrm{t}) \\cos (50.5 \\mathrm{t})$ where t is in seconds. Find the period with which they beat. (close to nearest integer)",
      "qHtml": "<p>Two harmonic waves moving in the same direction superimpose to form a wave $x=\\mathrm{a} \\cos (1.5 \\mathrm{t}) \\cos (50.5 \\mathrm{t})$ where t is in seconds. Find the period with which they beat. (close to nearest integer)</p>",
