      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift Physics - Waves Question 11 English Explanation 1]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\lambda_1=4 \\ell\\\\\n&\\mathrm{f}_1=\\frac{\\mathrm{v}}{4 \\ell}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift Physics - Waves Question 11 English Explanation 2]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\lambda_2=\\frac{16 \\ell}{5} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{f}_2=\\frac{5 \\mathrm{~V}}{16 \\ell} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{f}}{\\mathrm{f}}=\\frac{\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{\\ell}\\left(\\frac{1}{16}\\right)}{\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{4 \\ell}} \\times 100=25 \\%\n\\end{aligned}$$",
