      "qHtml": "A sinusoidal wave of wavelength 7.5 cm travels a distance of 1.2 cm along the $x$-direction in 0.3 sec . The crest P is at $x=0$ at $\\mathrm{t}=0 \\mathrm{sec}$ and maximum displacement of the wave is 2 cm . Which equation correctly represents this wave?",
