      "q": "Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason $\\mathbf{R}$\n\nAssertion A: A sound wave has higher speed in solids than gases.\n\nReason R: Gases have higher value of Bulk modulus than solids.\n\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason $\\mathbf{R}$</p>\n<p>Assertion A: A sound wave has higher speed in solids than gases.</p>\n<p>Reason R: Gases have higher value of Bulk modulus than solids.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
