      "q": "The equation of a transverse wave travelling along a string is $y(x, t)=4.0 \\sin \\left[20 \\times 10^{-3} x+600 t\\right] \\mathrm{mm}$, where $x$ is in mm and $t$ is in second. The velocity of the wave is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>The equation of a transverse wave travelling along a string is $y(x, t)=4.0 \\sin \\left[20 \\times 10^{-3} x+600 t\\right] \\mathrm{mm}$, where $x$ is in mm and $t$ is in second. The velocity of the wave is :</p>",
