      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2020 (Online) 5th September Evening Slot. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2020 (Online) 5th September Evening Slot Physics - Waves Question 85 English Explanation]\n\nf 1 = frequency heard by wall\n\n= $$\\left( {{{{v_s} - 0} \\over {{v_s} - {v_c}}}} \\right){f_0}$$ = $${{{{v_s}} \\over {{v_s} - {v_c}}} \\times 440}$$\n\nf 2 = frequency heard by driver after reflection from wall\n\n= $$\\left( {{{{v_s} + {v_c}} \\over {{v_s} - 0}}} \\right){f_1}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 480 = $$\\left( {{{{v_s} + {v_c}} \\over {{v_s}}}} \\right){f_1}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 480 = $$\\left( {{{{v_s} + {v_c}} \\over {{v_s}}}} \\right)\\left( {{{{v_s}} \\over {{v_s} - {v_c}}}} \\right) \\times 440$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 480 = $$\\left( {{{{v_s} + {v_c}} \\over {{v_s} - {v_c}}}} \\right) \\times 440$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 480 = $$\\left( {{{345 + {v_c}} \\over {345 - {v_c}}}} \\right) \\times 440$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 12 = $$\\left( {{{345 + {v_c}} \\over {345 - {v_c}}}} \\right) \\times 11$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 11 × 345 + 11v c = 12 × 345 – 12v c\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ v c = $${{345} \\over {23}}$$ m/s = $${{345} \\over {23}} \\times {{18} \\over 5}$$ = 54 km/hr",
      "source": "JEE Main 2020 (Online) 5th September Evening Slot | Waves and Sound | jxwkx4ONjuEghsZq9tjgy2xukfl34vez",
      "pyq": true,
      "exactPaperText": true,
