      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th April Evening Slot. Correct option: C. Sound level = 10$${\\log _{10}}\\left( {{I \\over {{I_0}}}} \\right)$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 120 = 10$${\\log _{10}}\\left( {{I \\over {{{10}^{ - 12}}}}} \\right)$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 12 = $${\\log _{10}}\\left( {{I \\over {{{10}^{ - 12}}}}} \\right)$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 10 12 = $${{I \\over {{{10}^{ - 12}}}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ I = 1 W/m 2\n\nAlso we know,\n\nI = $${P \\over {4\\pi {r^2}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 1 = $${2 \\over {4\\pi {r^2}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ r = 40 cm",
