      "s": "JEE Main 2018 (Online) 16th April Morning Slot. Correct option: B. Given, End correction (e) = 1 cm\n\nFor first resonance,\n\n$${\\lambda \\over 4} = {l_1} + e$$ = 10 + 1 = 11 cm\n\nFor second resonance,\n\n$${3\\lambda \\over 4} = {l_2} + e$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $${l_2}$$ = 3 $$ \\times $$ 11 - 1 = 32 cm",
