      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Main 2018 (Online) 15th April Morning Slot. Correct option: D. The tuning fork vibrates with frequency 256 Hz and give one beat per second So, the organ pipe will have frequency (256 $$ \\pm $$ 1) Hr.\n\nFor open organ pipe,\n\nFrequency n = $${{N\\upsilon } \\over {2\\ell }}$$\n\nHere n = 255 Hz\n\nN = 3\n\n$$\\upsilon $$ = 340 m/s\n\n$$\\therefore\\,\\,\\,\\,$$ 255 = $${{3 \\times 340} \\over {2 \\times \\ell }}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$$$\\,\\,\\,\\,$$ $$\\ell $$ = $${{3 \\times 340} \\over {2 \\times 255}} = 2\\,m$$\n\n$$\\therefore\\,\\,\\,\\,$$ $$\\ell $$ = 2m or 200 cm",
