      "q": "Two charges $7 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ and $-2 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ are placed at $(-9,0,0) \\mathrm{cm}$ and $(9,0,0) \\mathrm{cm}$ respectively in an external field $E=\\frac{\\mathrm{A}}{r^2} \\hat{r}$, where $A=9 \\times 10^5 \\mathrm{~N} / \\mathrm{C} . \\mathrm{m}^2$. Considering the potential at infinity is 0 , the electrostatic energy of the configuration is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ J.",
      "qHtml": "<p>Two charges $7 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ and $-2 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ are placed at $(-9,0,0) \\mathrm{cm}$ and $(9,0,0) \\mathrm{cm}$ respectively in an external field $E=\\frac{\\mathrm{A}}{r^2} \\hat{r}$, where $A=9 \\times 10^5 \\mathrm{~N} / \\mathrm{C} . \\mathrm{m}^2$. Considering the potential at infinity is 0 , the electrostatic energy of the configuration is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ J.</p>",
