      "qHtml": "<p>Two metal spheres of radius <b>R</b> and <b>3R</b> have same surface charge density <b>&sigma;</b>. If they are brought in contact and then separated, the surface charge density on smaller and bigger sphere becomes <b>&sigma;<sub>1</sub></b> and <b>&sigma;<sub>2</sub></b>, respectively. The ratio <b>$ \\frac{\\sigma_1}{\\sigma_2} $</b> is</p>",
