      "q": "Two infinite identical charged sheets and a charged spherical body of charge density ' $\\rho$ ' are arranged as shown in figure. Then the correct relation between the electrical fields at $\\mathrm{A}, \\mathrm{B}, \\mathrm{C}$ and D points is:\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 28 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>Two infinite identical charged sheets and a charged spherical body of charge density ' $\\rho$ ' are arranged as shown in figure. Then the correct relation between the electrical fields at $\\mathrm{A}, \\mathrm{B}, \\mathrm{C}$ and D points is:</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m9hxi26d/3f3de91e-88f0-47fb-b6e5-7064d496f502/b08e8b50-19a7-11f0-ae75-a7596cbc7562/file-jaoe38c1m9hxi26e.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 28 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
