      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 41 English Explanation]\n\nLet $E_p=0$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\therefore \\frac{k q}{x^2}=\\frac{k 9 q}{(d-x)^2} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{d-x}{x}=3 \\Rightarrow x=\\frac{d}{4}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$\\therefore$ co-ordinate of P is $\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{4}, 0,0\\right)$",
