      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{U}_1=\\frac{4 \\mathrm{Kq}_0^2}{\\mathrm{a}}+\\frac{2 \\mathrm{Kq}_0^2}{\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{a}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{Kq}_0^2}{\\mathrm{a}}(4+\\sqrt{2}) \\\\\n& \\mathrm{U}_2=\\frac{\\mathrm{Kq}_0^2}{\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{a}}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)}(4+\\sqrt{2})=\\frac{\\mathrm{Kq}_0^2}{\\mathrm{a}}(4 \\sqrt{2}+2) \\\\\n& \\mathrm{U}_2-\\mathrm{U}_1=\\frac{\\mathrm{Kq}_0^2}{\\mathrm{a}}(3 \\sqrt{2}-2)\n\\end{aligned}$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift | Electrostatics | m6v43dk4",
