      "q": "Two charges $7 \\mu \\mathrm{c}$ and $-4 \\mu \\mathrm{c}$ are placed at $(-7 \\mathrm{~cm}, 0,0)$ and $(7 \\mathrm{~cm}, 0,0)$ respectively. Given, $\\epsilon_0=8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\mathrm{C}^2 \\mathrm{~N}^{-1} \\mathrm{~m}^{-2}$, the electrostatic potential energy of the charge configuration is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Two charges $7 \\mu \\mathrm{c}$ and $-4 \\mu \\mathrm{c}$ are placed at $(-7 \\mathrm{~cm}, 0,0)$ and $(7 \\mathrm{~cm}, 0,0)$ respectively. Given, $\\epsilon_0=8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\mathrm{C}^2 \\mathrm{~N}^{-1} \\mathrm{~m}^{-2}$, the electrostatic potential energy of the charge configuration is :</p>",
