      "qHtml": "<p>Under steady state condition the potential difference across the capacitor in the circuit is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ V.</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift Physics - Capacitor Question 2 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
