      "qHtml": "<p>Three parallel plate capacitors $C_1, C_2$ and $C_3$ each of capacitance $5 \\mu \\mathrm{~F}$ are connected as shown in figure. The effective capacitance between points $A$ and $B$, when the space between the parallel plates of $C_1$ capacitor is filled with a dielectric medium having dielectric constant of 4, is :</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m9gju2vs/7ff5dc4e-0fbf-4b59-bd63-0c7eb1f25baf/765ab980-18e5-11f0-a103-9bd1ffe79f48/file-jaoe38c1m9gju2vt.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Capacitor Question 16 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
