      "qHtml": "<p>For the two cells having same EMF $E$ and internal resistance $r$, the current passing through the external resistor $6 \\Omega$ is same when both the cells are connected either in parallel or in series. The value of internal resistance $r$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ $\\Omega$.</p>",
