      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift Physics - Current Electricity Question 45 English Explanation 1]\n\nWe know, $$R = \\int {{l \\over A} \\Rightarrow R \\propto l} $$\n\nAs sliding contact of a potentiometer is in the middle of the potentiometer wire.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift Physics - Current Electricity Question 45 English Explanation 2]\n\n$\\therefore$ $${R_{eq}} = 0.5 + {{0.5 \\times 2} \\over {0.5 + 2}} = 0.5 + {1 \\over {2.5}}$$\n\n$$ = {1 \\over 2} + {2 \\over 5} = {{5 + 4} \\over {10}} = {9 \\over {10}} = 0.9\\Omega $$\n\nHence, $$I = {v \\over {{R_{eq}}}} = {{0.9v} \\over {0.9\\Omega }} \\Rightarrow I = 1A$$",
