      "qHtml": "The $\\mathrm{H}$ amount of thermal energy is developed by a resistor in $10 \\mathrm{~s}$ when a current of $4 \\mathrm{~A}$ is passed through it. If the current is increased to $16 \\mathrm{~A}$, the thermal energy developed by the resistor in $10 \\mathrm{~s}$ will be :",
