      "q": "An infinitely long straight wire carrying current $I$ is bent in a planar shape as shown in the diagram. The radius of the circular part is $r$. The magnetic field at the centre $O$ of the circular loop is :\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift Physics - Magnetic Effect of Current Question 19 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>An infinitely long straight wire carrying current $I$ is bent in a planar shape as shown in the diagram. The radius of the circular part is $r$. The magnetic field at the centre $O$ of the circular loop is :</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml7sh3h2/ba7c1195-e6d3-4bfb-9fbe-513b426b2156/ca281760-01a6-11f1-a189-2d3796da7674/file-6y3zli1ml7sh3h3.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift Physics - Magnetic Effect of Current Question 19 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
