      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift Physics - Magnetic Effect of Current Question 32 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{B}_{\\text {in }}=\\frac{\\mu_0(\\overline{\\mathrm{~J}} \\times \\overline{\\mathrm{r}})}{2} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~B}_{\\text {in }} \\propto \\mathrm{r} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~B}_{\\text {out }}=\\frac{\\mu_0 \\mathrm{I}}{2 \\pi \\mathrm{r}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~B}_{\\text {net }} \\propto \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{r}}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift | Magnetic Effects of Current | m6v43dfw",
