      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 31st January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 31st January Morning Shift Physics - Magnetic Effect of Current Question 64 English Explanation]\n\nNote : Direction of magnetic field is in $$+\\hat{k}$$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{F}}=\\mathrm{i} \\vec{\\ell} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{B}} \\\\\n& \\ell=2 \\mathrm{R} \\\\\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{F}}=-2 \\mathrm{iRB} \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
