      "a": 0,
      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 29th January Evening Shift. Correct option: A. By given information\n\n$$32 = 4 \\times {{{\\mu _0}i} \\over {2r}}$$ ..... (i)\n\nAlso, $$r' = 4r$$ ...... (ii)\n\nand $$B' = 1 \\times {{{\\mu _0}i} \\over {2r'}}$$ .... (iii)\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow B' = {{{\\mu _0}i} \\over {2(4r)}} = {{{\\mu _0}i} \\over {8r}} = {1 \\over 8} \\times 16 = 2\\,T$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 29th January Evening Shift | Magnetic Effects of Current | 1ldsanxdr",
