      "q": "Given below are two statements:\n\nStatement I : An AC circuit undergoes electrical resonance if it contains either a capacitor or an inductor.\n\nStatement II : An AC circuit containing a pure capacitor or a pure inductor consumes high power due to its non-zero power factor.\n\nIn the light of above statements, choose the correct answer form the options given below:",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p>\n<p>Statement I : An AC circuit undergoes electrical resonance if it contains either a capacitor or an inductor.</p>\n<p>Statement II : An AC circuit containing a pure capacitor or a pure inductor consumes high power due to its non-zero power factor.</p>\n<p>In the light of above statements, choose the correct answer form the options given below:</p>",
