      "q": "Given below are two statements:\n\nStatement I : Maximum power is dissipated in a circuit containing an inductor, a capacitor and a resistor connected in series with an AC source, when resonance occurs\n\nStatement II : Maximum power is dissipated in a circuit containing pure resistor due to zero phase difference between current and voltage.\n\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p>\n<p>Statement I : Maximum power is dissipated in a circuit containing an inductor, a capacitor and a resistor connected in series with an AC source, when resonance occurs</p>\n<p>Statement II : Maximum power is dissipated in a circuit containing pure resistor due to zero phase difference between current and voltage.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
