      "q": "For the series LCR circuit connected with $220 \\mathrm{~V}, 50 \\mathrm{~Hz}$ a.c source as shown in the figure, the power factor is $\\frac{\\alpha}{10}$. The value of $\\alpha$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 6 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>For the series LCR circuit connected with $220 \\mathrm{~V}, 50 \\mathrm{~Hz}$ a.c source as shown in the figure, the power factor is $\\frac{\\alpha}{10}$. The value of $\\alpha$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml9byke4/d6ac35f8-26aa-4877-a6b6-bc5a4bc63ca1/c6158fc0-027f-11f1-8e98-edf480d810c9/file-6y3zli1ml9byke5.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 6 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
