      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\phi_1=\\mathrm{L}_1 \\mathrm{I}_1+\\mathrm{M}_{12} \\mathrm{I}_2 \\\\\n& \\varepsilon_1=-\\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\phi_1}{\\mathrm{dt}}=-\\mathrm{L}_1 \\frac{\\mathrm{dI}_1}{\\mathrm{dt}}-\\mathrm{M}_{12} \\frac{\\mathrm{dI}}{\\mathrm{dt}}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift | Electromagnetic Induction | m6qkyxgd",
