      "q": "An electric bulb rated as $100 \\mathrm{~W}-220 \\mathrm{~V}$ is connected to an ac source of rms voltage 220 V. The peak value of current through the bulb is :",
      "qHtml": "An electric bulb rated as $100 \\mathrm{~W}-220 \\mathrm{~V}$ is connected to an ac source of rms voltage 220 V. The peak value of current through the bulb is :",
