      "qHtml": "<p>An alternating current is given by $\\mathrm{I}=\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{A}} \\sin \\omega \\mathrm{t}+\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\cos \\omega \\mathrm{t}$. The r.m.s current will be</p>",
