      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 26th August Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $$U = {1 \\over 2}L{i^2} = 64 \\Rightarrow L = 2$$\n\n$${i^2}R = 640$$\n\n$$R = {{640} \\over {{{(8)}^2}}} = 10$$\n\n$$\\tau = {L \\over R} = {1 \\over 5} = 0.2$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 26th August Morning Shift | Alternating Current | 1ktabt77x",
