      "qHtml": "<p>A coil of area A and N turns is rotating with angular velocity $\\omega$ in a uniform magnetic field $\\vec{B}$ about an axis perpendicular to $\\vec{B}$. Magnetic flux $\\varphi$ and induced emf $\\varepsilon$ across it, at an instant when $\\vec{B}$ is parallel to the plane of coil, are :</p>",
