      "q": "The electric current in the circuit is given as $i=i_{\\mathrm{o}}(t / T)$. The r.m.s current for the period $t=0$ to $t=T$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .",
      "qHtml": "<p>The electric current in the circuit is given as $i=i_{\\mathrm{o}}(t / T)$. The r.m.s current for the period $t=0$ to $t=T$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .</p></p></p>",
