      "q": "Match List I with List II\n\nLIST I\n\nLIST II\n\nA.\nPurely capacitive circuit\nI.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 1]\n\nB.\nPurely inductive circuit\nII.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 2]\n\nC.\nLCR series at resonance\nIII.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 3]\n\nD.\nLCR series circuit\nIV.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 4]\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:",
      "qHtml": "<p>Match List I with List II</p>\n<p>\n</p><table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST I</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST II<br></th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>A.</td>\n    <td>Purely capacitive circuit</td>\n    <td>I.</td>\n    <td><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lv1rn0j3/37dd9850-0d5d-48cb-9787-d4014e3ca100/31dc6700-fb99-11ee-aecf-73c37d9c3a58/file-1lv1rn0j4.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 1\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>B.\t</td>\n    <td>Purely inductive circuit</td>\n    <td>II.</td>\n    <td><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lv1rnk4f/c0609c0e-66d7-42bc-8816-e8d06770b758/40fec2f0-fb99-11ee-aecf-73c37d9c3a58/file-1lv1rnk4g.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 2\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>C.</td>\n    <td>LCR series at resonance</td>\n    <td>III.</td>\n    <td><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lv1ro09o/cfca7ff4-6e97-4c24-9b13-f2e6d3bd2860/4d77a9c0-fb99-11ee-aecf-73c37d9c3a58/file-1lv1ro09p.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 3\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>D.</td>\n    <td>LCR series circuit</td>\n    <td>IV.</td>\n    <td><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lv1rog56/94584823-e7b6-4a44-8719-620c9ea712ee/59bb01a0-fb99-11ee-aecf-73c37d9c3a58/file-1lv1rog57.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Alternating Current Question 31 English 4\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
