      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements. One is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).</p>\n<p>Assertion (A) : In Young's double slit experiment, the fringes produced by red light are closer as compared to those produced by blue light.</p>\n<p>Reason (R) : The fringe width is directly proportional to the wavelength of light.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
