      "q": "Refer the figure given below. $\\mu_1$ and $\\mu_2$ are refractive indices of air and lens material. The height of image will be _______ cm.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 14 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>Refer the figure given below. $\\mu_1$ and $\\mu_2$ are refractive indices of air and lens material. The height of image will be _______ cm.</p><p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mon16xdm/5fb2d2f6-1c1a-40f3-99b6-9a2ddd2ad633/49658da0-456d-11f1-a090-2f49797ebef7/file-6y3zli1mon16xdn.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 14 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
