      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements: one is labelled as <b>Assertion (A)</b> and the other is labelled as <b>Reason (R)</b>.</p><p><b>Assertion (A):</b> Refractive index of glass is higher than that of air.</p><p><b>Reason (R):</b> Optical density of a medium is directly proportionate to its mass density which results in a proportionate refractive index.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate answer</b> from the options given below:</p>",
