      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Evening Shift Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 68 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{m}=-3=-\\frac{\\mathrm{v}}{\\mathrm{u}} \\text { and } \\mathrm{v}-\\mathrm{u}=20 \\mathrm{~cm} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{f}=\\frac{\\mathrm{vu}}{\\mathrm{v}+\\mathrm{u}}=\\frac{(-30)(-10)}{-30-10} \\\\\n& \\therefore \\mathrm{R}=+15\n\\end{aligned}$$",
