      "q": "In a long glass tube, mixture of two liquids A and B with refractive indices 1.3 and 1.4 respectively, forms a convex refractive meniscus towards A . If an object placed at 13 cm from the vertex of the meniscus in A forms an image with a magnification of ${ }^{\\prime}-2^{\\prime}$ then the radius of curvature of meniscus is :",
