      "q": "One side of an equilateral prism is painted by a transparent material of refractive index $n_2$. The refractive index of prism is $1.6$. The minimum value of $n_2$ required for total internal reflection from painted face is ________.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 13 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>One side of an equilateral prism is painted by a transparent material of refractive index $n_2$. The refractive index of prism is $1.6$. The minimum value of $n_2$ required for total internal reflection from painted face is ________.</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mol5jozg/cc7e9b9b-bf08-4d45-b59d-9e6ca586a7c3/bfa647c0-4464-11f1-8548-dba52a2c0879/file-6y3zli1mol5jozh.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 13 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
