      "q": "As shown in the diagram, when the incident ray is parallel to base of the prism, the emergent ray grazes along the second surface.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 35 English]\nIf refractive index of the material of prism is $\\sqrt{2}$, the angle $\\theta$ of prism is.",
      "qHtml": "<p>As shown in the diagram, when the incident ray is parallel to base of the prism, the emergent ray grazes along the second surface.</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mm2fyji1/7b2462a0-3a08-45ae-aa99-080d8dfb5602/24bed290-1282-11f1-a738-79b73a106436/file-6y3zli1mm2fyji2.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 35 English\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If refractive index of the material of prism is $\\sqrt{2}$, the angle $\\theta$ of prism is.</p>",
