      "a": 0,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift. Correct option: A. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{hv}=\\phi+\\mathrm{KE}_{\\max } \\\\\n& \\mathrm{KE}_{\\max }=\\mathrm{eV}_0 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~V}_0=\\frac{\\mathrm{hv}-\\phi}{\\mathrm{e}}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n(A) $\\mathrm{V}_0 \\mathrm{v} / \\mathrm{s} \\mathrm{V}$ is linear correct\n\n(B) Slope\n\n$$\\mathrm{v}_0=\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{e}}\\right) \\mathrm{v}-\\frac{\\phi}{\\mathrm{e}} \\text { Wrong }$$\n\nSlope $\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{e}}$\n\n(C) Correct\n\n(D) Incorrect\n\n(E) Correct",
      "source": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift | Dual Nature of Matter | m6v42h0f",
      "pyq": true,
      "exactPaperText": true,
