      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift. Correct option: A. Lyman\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift Physics - Atoms and Nuclei Question 31 English Explanation 1]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{1}{\\lambda_1}=\\mathrm{R}\\left[\\frac{1}{1}-\\frac{1}{4}\\right]=\\frac{3 \\mathrm{R}}{4} \\\\\n& \\lambda_1=\\frac{4}{3 \\mathrm{R}}\\quad\\text{..... (1)}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nand Balmer\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift Physics - Atoms and Nuclei Question 31 English Explanation 2]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{1}{\\lambda_2}=\\mathrm{R}\\left[\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{9}\\right]=\\frac{5 \\mathrm{R}}{36} \\\\\n& \\lambda_2=\\frac{36}{5 \\mathrm{R}}\n\\end{aligned}\\\\\n&\\text { Then, } \\frac{\\lambda_1}{\\lambda_2}=\\frac{5}{27}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
