      "q": "Energy released when two deuterons $\\left({ }_1 \\mathrm{H}^2\\right)$ fuse to form a helium nucleus $\\left({ }_2 \\mathrm{He}^4\\right)$ is :\n(Given : Binding energy per nucleon of ${ }_1 \\mathrm{H}^2=1.1 \\mathrm{MeV}$ and binding energy per nucleon of ${ }_2 \\mathrm{He}^4=7.0 \\mathrm{MeV}$ )",
      "qHtml": "Energy released when two deuterons $\\left({ }_1 \\mathrm{H}^2\\right)$ fuse to form a helium nucleus $\\left({ }_2 \\mathrm{He}^4\\right)$ is :\n(Given : Binding energy per nucleon of ${ }_1 \\mathrm{H}^2=1.1 \\mathrm{MeV}$ and binding energy per nucleon of ${ }_2 \\mathrm{He}^4=7.0 \\mathrm{MeV}$ )",
