      "qHtml": "Consider the following statements :<br><br>A. Atoms of each element emit characteristics spectrum.<br><br>B. According to Bohr's Postulate, an electron in a hydrogen atom, revolves in a certain stationary orbit.<br><br>C. The density of nuclear matter depends on the size of the nucleus.<br><br>D. A free neutron is stable but a free proton decay is possible.<br><br>E. Radioactivity is an indication of the instability of nuclei.<br><br>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
