      "s": "JEE Main 2017 (Online) 8th April Morning Slot. Correct option: C. 1 H 2 + 1 H 2 $$ \\to $$ 2 He 4\n\nNo. of proton in one dueteron = 2\n\n$$\\therefore\\,\\,\\,$$ Total protons in two dueterons = 2 $$ \\times $$ 2 = 4\n\n$$\\therefore\\,\\,\\,$$ Binding energy of two dueteron\n\n= 1.1 $$ \\times $$ 4 = 4 : 4 MeV\n\nIn ( 2 He 4 ) no of protons = 4\n\n$$\\therefore\\,\\,\\,$$ Binding energy of ( 2 He 4 ) nuclei = 4 $$ \\times $$ 7 = 28 Mev\n\nEnergy released in this process = 28 $$-$$ 4.4 = 23.6 MeV",
