        "<p>Both (A) and (R) are correct but (R) is <b>not</b> the correct explanation of (A)</p>",
        "<p>(A) is not correct but (R) is correct</p>",
        "<p>Both (A) and (R) are correct and (R) <b>is</b> the correct explanation of (A)</p>"
