      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 31st January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{R}_1=\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_2}{2} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{R}_0\\left(\\mathrm{~A}_1\\right)^{1 / 3}=\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_0}{2}\\left(\\mathrm{~A}_2\\right)^{1 / 3} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~A}_1=\\frac{1}{8} \\mathrm{~A}_2 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~A}_1=\\frac{192}{8}=24\n\\end{aligned}$$",
