      "q": "Two p-n junction diodes $D_1$ and $D_2$ are connected as shown in figure. $A$ and $B$ are input signals and $C$ is the output. The given circuit will function as a ________.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 28th January Evening Shift Physics - Semiconductor Question 20 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>Two p-n junction diodes $D_1$ and $D_2$ are connected as shown in figure. $A$ and $B$ are input signals and $C$ is the output. The given circuit will function as a ________.</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml7y1w37/c56dbff5-3491-444e-9ba1-b9b61835cf6e/9a16f030-01bc-11f1-8b93-a5765c7fcaf0/file-6y3zli1ml7y1w38.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 28th January Evening Shift Physics - Semiconductor Question 20 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
