      "q": "In an experiment the values of two spring constants were measured as $k_1=(10 \\pm 0.2) \\mathrm{N} / \\mathrm{m}$ and $k_2=(20 \\pm 0.3) \\mathrm{N} / \\mathrm{m}$. If these springs are connected in parallel, then the percentage error in equivalent spring constant is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>In an experiment the values of two spring constants were measured as $k_1=(10 \\pm 0.2) \\mathrm{N} / \\mathrm{m}$ and $k_2=(20 \\pm 0.3) \\mathrm{N} / \\mathrm{m}$. If these springs are connected in parallel, then the percentage error in equivalent spring constant is :</p>",
