      "qHtml": "<p>The mass of iron converted into Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> by the action of 18 g of steam is:</p>\n<p>(Given: Molar mass of H, O and Fe are 1, 16 and 56 g mol<sup>−1</sup> respectively)</p>\n<p>Assume iron is present in excess:</p>",
