      "qHtml": "<p>Aqueous HCl reacts with MnO<sub>2</sub>(s) to form MnCl<sub>2</sub>(aq), Cl<sub>2</sub>(g), and H<sub>2</sub>O(l). What is the weight (in g) of Cl<sub>2</sub> liberated when 8.7 g of MnO<sub>2</sub>(s) is reacted with excess aqueous HCl solution? (Given Molar mass in g mol<sup>−1</sup> Mn = 55, Cl = 35.5, O = 16, H = 1)</p>",
