      "qHtml": "<p>14.0 g of calcium metal is allowed to react with excess HCl at 1.0 atm pressure and 273 K . Which of the following statements is incorrect?</p>\n<p>[Given : Molar mass in $\\mathrm{g} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}$ of $\\mathrm{Ca}-40, \\mathrm{Cl}-35.5, \\mathrm{H}-1$ ]</p>",
