      "qHtml": "In Dumas' method for estimation of nitrogen 0.4 g of an organic compound gave 60 mL of nitrogen collected at 300 K temperature and 715 mm Hg pressure. The percentage composition of nitrogen in the compound is\n(Given : Aqueous tension at $300 \\mathrm{~K}=15 \\mathrm{~mm} \\mathrm{Hg}$ )",
