      "qHtml": "<p>The elemental composition of a compound is $54.2 \\% \\mathrm{C}, 9.2 \\% \\mathrm{H}$ and $36.6 \\% \\mathrm{O}$.\nIf the molar mass of the compound is $132 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$, the molecular formula of the compound is :\n[Given : The relative atomic mass of $\\mathrm{C}: \\mathrm{H}: \\mathrm{O}=12: 1: 16$ ]</p>",
