      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& (\\text { moles })_{\\text {initial }}=\\frac{x \\times 10^{-3}}{44} \\\\\n& (\\text { moles })_{\\text {removal }}=\\frac{10^{21}}{6.02 \\times 10^{23}} \\\\\n& (\\text { moles })_{\\text {left }}=(\\text { moles })_{\\text {initial }}-(\\text { moles })_{\\text {removed }} \\\\\n& 2.8 \\times 10^{-3}=\\frac{x \\times 10^{-3}}{44}-\\frac{10^{21}}{6.02 \\times 10^{23}} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow x=196.2 \\mathrm{mg}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
