      "qHtml": "<p>Compound A contains 8.7% Hydrogen, 74% Carbon and 17.3% Nitrogen. The molecular formula of the compound is,</p>\n<p>Given : Atomic masses of C, H and N are 12, 1 and 14 amu respectively.</p>\n<p>The molar mass of the compound A is 162 g mol<sup>$$-$$1</sup>.</p>",
