      "s": "JEE Main 2022 (Online) 26th June Morning Shift. Correct option: C. 35% HCl by mass means in 100 gm HCl solution 35 gm HCl present.\n\nNow, volume of 100 gm HCl solution\n\n$$ = {{100} \\over {1.46}}$$ ml\n\n$$ = {{{{100} \\over {1.46}}} \\over {1000}}$$ l\n\nMoles of HCl $$ = {{35} \\over {36.5}}$$\n\nNow, molarity $$ = {{moles\\,of\\,solute} \\over {volume\\,of\\,solution\\,(in\\,L)}}$$\n\n$$ = {{{{35} \\over {36.5}}} \\over {{{{{100} \\over {1.46}}} \\over {1000}}}} = 14$$",
