      "q": "Identify the correct statements from the following :\n\nA. Heisenberg uncertainty principle is applicable to electrons.\n\nB. The size of $2 p_x$ orbital is less than the size of $3 p_x$ orbital.\n\nC. The energy of 2 s orbital of H atom is equal to the energy of 2 s orbital of Li .\n\nD. The electronic configuration of Cr is $[\\mathrm{Ar}] 3 \\mathrm{~d}^5 4 \\mathrm{~s}^1$\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:",
      "qHtml": "<p>Identify the correct statements from the following :</p>\n<p>A. Heisenberg uncertainty principle is applicable to electrons.</p>\n<p>B. The size of $2 p_x$ orbital is less than the size of $3 p_x$ orbital.</p>\n<p>C. The energy of 2 s orbital of H atom is equal to the energy of 2 s orbital of Li .</p>\n<p>D. The electronic configuration of Cr is $[\\mathrm{Ar}] 3 \\mathrm{~d}^5 4 \\mathrm{~s}^1$</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
