      "qHtml": "<p>The wavelength of photon 'A' is 400 nm. The frequency of photon 'B' is $10^{16} \\ \\text{s}^{-1}$. The wave number of photon 'C' is $10^4 \\ \\text{cm}^{-1}$. The correct order of energy of these photons is :</p>",
