      "q": "Given,\n\n(A) $\\mathrm{n}=5, \\mathrm{~m}_1=-1$\n\n(B) $\\mathrm{n}=3, \\mathrm{l}=2, \\mathrm{~m}_1=-1, \\mathrm{~m}_{\\mathrm{s}}=+\\frac{1}{2}$\n\nThe maximum number of electron(s) in an atom that can have the quantum numbers as given in (A) and (B) respectively are :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given,</p>\n<p>(A) $\\mathrm{n}=5, \\mathrm{~m}_1=-1$</p>\n<p>(B) $\\mathrm{n}=3, \\mathrm{l}=2, \\mathrm{~m}_1=-1, \\mathrm{~m}_{\\mathrm{s}}=+\\frac{1}{2}$</p>\n<p>The maximum number of electron(s) in an atom that can have the quantum numbers as given in (A) and (B) respectively are :</p>",
