      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift. Correct option: A. (A) Azimuthal quantum number ( $\\ell$ ) indicates the shape of orbital occupied by the electron\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift Chemistry - Structure of Atom Question 33 English Explanation]\n\n(C) The + and - sign in the wave function of $2 p_x$ orbital refer to the sign (Phase) of the wave function, not the charge\n\n(D) The wave function of $2 p_x$ orbital will be zero in yz plane (Nodal plane).",
