      "qHtml": "<p>Which of the following is/are not correct with respect to energy of atomic orbitals of hydrogen atom?</p><p><b>(A)</b> 1s &lt; 2p &lt; 3d &lt; 4s</p><p><b>(B)</b> 1s &lt; 2s = 2p &lt; 3s = 3p</p><p><b>(C)</b> 1s &lt; 2s &lt; 2p &lt; 3s &lt; 3p</p><p><b>(D)</b> 1s &lt; 2s &lt; 4s &lt; 3d</p><p>Choose the <b>correct</b> answer from the options given below :</p>",
