      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. In general on moving from left to right in a period ionization energy increases as $\\mathbf{Z}_{\\text {eff }}$ increases.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift Chemistry - Periodic Table & Periodicity Question 13 English Explanation]",
      "source": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift | Periodic Classification | ml8t8o3m",
