      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p>\n<p>Statement - I: Along the period, the chemical reactivity of the elements gradually increases from group 1 to group 18 .</p>\n<p>Statement - II: The nature of oxides formed by group 1 elements is basic while that of group 17 elements is acidic.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate from the options given below:</p>",
