      "qHtml": "<p>Two p-block elements X and Y form fluorides of the type $\\mathrm{EF}_3$. The fluoride compound $\\mathrm{XF}_3$ is a Lewis acid and $\\mathrm{YF}_3$ is a Lewis base. The hybridizations of the central atoms of $\\mathrm{XF}_3$ and $\\mathrm{YF}_3$ respectively are</p>",
