      "q": "Consider the following data.\n(i) $2\\text{Al(s)} + 6\\text{HCl(aq)} \\rightarrow \\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6\\text{(aq)} + 3\\text{H}_2\\text{(g)} + 1200~\\text{kJ/mol}$\n(ii) $\\text{H}_2\\text{(g)} + \\text{Cl}_2\\text{(g)} \\rightarrow 2\\text{HCl(g)} + 164~\\text{kJ/mol}$\n(iii) $\\text{HCl(g)} + \\text{aq} \\rightarrow \\text{HCl(aq)} + 83~\\text{kJ/mol}$\n(iv) $\\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6\\text{(s)} + \\text{aq} \\rightarrow \\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6\\text{(aq)} + 663~\\text{kJ/mol}$\nThe enthalpy of formation of anhydrous solid $\\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6$ is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Consider the following data.</p><p>(i) $2\\text{Al(s)} + 6\\text{HCl(aq)} \\rightarrow \\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6\\text{(aq)} + 3\\text{H}_2\\text{(g)} + 1200~\\text{kJ/mol}$</p><p>(ii) $\\text{H}_2\\text{(g)} + \\text{Cl}_2\\text{(g)} \\rightarrow 2\\text{HCl(g)} + 164~\\text{kJ/mol}$</p><p>(iii) $\\text{HCl(g)} + \\text{aq} \\rightarrow \\text{HCl(aq)} + 83~\\text{kJ/mol}$</p><p>(iv) $\\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6\\text{(s)} + \\text{aq} \\rightarrow \\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6\\text{(aq)} + 663~\\text{kJ/mol}$</p><p>The enthalpy of formation of anhydrous solid $\\text{Al}_2\\text{Cl}_6$ is :</p>",
