      "q": "$20.0 \\mathrm{dm}^3$ of an ideal gas ' X ' at 600 K and 0.5 MPa undergoes isothermal reversible expansion until pressure of the gas is 0.2 MPa . Which of the following option is correct?\n\n(Given: $\\log 2=0.3010$ and $\\log 5=0.6989$ )",
      "qHtml": "<p>$20.0 \\mathrm{dm}^3$ of an ideal gas ' X ' at 600 K and 0.5 MPa undergoes isothermal reversible expansion until pressure of the gas is 0.2 MPa . Which of the following option is correct?</p>\n<p>(Given: $\\log 2=0.3010$ and $\\log 5=0.6989$ )</p>",
