      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th January Morning Slot. Correct option: B. Work done in isothermal process,\n\nW = $$-$$ nRT ln$${{{V_2}} \\over {{V_1}}}$$\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ $$\\left| W \\right|$$ = nRT ln$${{{V_2}} \\over {{V_1}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $$\\left| W \\right|$$ = nRT (lnV 2 $$-$$ lnV 1 )\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $$\\left| W \\right|$$ = nRT lnV 2 $$-$$ nRT lnV 1\n\ngiven that $$V$$ 2 $$=$$ $$V$$\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ $$\\left| W \\right|$$ = nRT lnV $$-$$ nRT lnV 1\n\nBy comparing with the straight line equation,\n\ny = mx + C\n\nWe get slope is nRT and intercept $$-$$ nRT lnV 1 in $$\\left| W \\right|$$ and lnV graph.\n\nAs T 2 > T 1 So,\n\nSlope nRT 2 > nRT 1\n\nand intercept\n\n$$-$$ nRT 2 lnV 1 < $$-$$ nRT 1 lnV 1\n\nSo, we can say\n\n(1) slope of T 2 line is more then T 1\n\n(2) intercept of T 1 line is less negative than T 2 line, and intercept of T 1 can't be positive, it can be 0 or less than 0 as $$-$$ nRT 1 lnV 1 always $$ \\le $$ 0",
