      "q": "Arrange the following resultant mixtures in increasing order of their pH values\n\nA. $10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.2 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{Ca}(\\mathrm{OH})_2+25 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.1 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{HCl}$\n\nB. $10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.01 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4+10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.01 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{Ca}(\\mathrm{OH})_2$\n\nC. $10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.1 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4+10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.1 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{KOH}$\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Arrange the following resultant mixtures in increasing order of their pH values</p>\n<p>A. $10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.2 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{Ca}(\\mathrm{OH})_2+25 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.1 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{HCl}$</p>\n<p>B. $10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.01 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4+10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.01 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{Ca}(\\mathrm{OH})_2$</p>\n<p>C. $10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.1 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4+10 \\mathrm{~mL} 0.1 \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{KOH}$</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
