      "qHtml": "<p>At temperature T, compound $AB_{2(g)}$ dissociates as $AB_{2(g)} \\rightleftharpoons AB_{(g)} + \\frac{1}{2} B_{2(g)}$ having degree of dissociation $ x $ (small compared to unity). The correct expression for $ x $ in terms of $ K_p $ and $ p $ is:</p>",
