      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Evening Slot. Correct option: B. S(s) + O 2 (g) ⇋ SO 2 (g); K 1 = 10 52\n\nBy reversing the equation, we get\n\nSO 2 (g); ⇋ S(s) + O 2 (g) ; $${1 \\over {{K_1}}} = {1 \\over {{{10}^{52}}}}$$ ..............(1)\n\n2S(s) + 3O 2 (g) ⇋ 2SO 3 (g); K 2 = 10 129 ....................(2)\n\nPerforming (2) - 2 $$ \\times $$ (1), we get\n\n2SO 2 (g) + O 2 (g) ⇋ 2SO 3 (g)\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ Equilibrium constant of this reaction is\n\n= $${{{K_2}} \\over {K_1^2}}$$ = $${{{{10}^{129}}} \\over {{{\\left( {{{10}^{52}}} \\right)}^2}}}$$ = 10 25",
