      "q": "A vessel at 1000 K contains $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ with a pressure of 0.5 atm . Some of $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ is converted into CO on addition of graphite. If total pressure at equilibrium is 0.8 atm , then K p is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>A vessel at 1000 K contains $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ with a pressure of 0.5 atm . Some of $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ is converted into CO on addition of graphite. If total pressure at equilibrium is 0.8 atm , then K<sub>p</sub> is :</p>",
