      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p><b>Statement I :</b> Sublimation is used for the separation and purification of compounds with low melting point.</p>\n<p><b>Statement II :</b> The boiling point of a liquid increases as the external pressure is reduced. In the light of the above statements, \n<br><br>choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
