      "qHtml": "<p>IUPAC name of the some alkenes are given below.</p>\n<p>Find out the correct stability order.</p>\n<p>A. 2-Methylbut-2-ene</p>\n<p>B. cis-But-2-ene</p>\n<p>C. 2,3-Dimethylbut-2-ene</p>\n<p>D. Prop-1-ene</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
