      "qHtml": "Calculate the standard cell potential in (V) of the\ncell in which following reaction takes place :\n<br><br>Fe<sup>2+</sup>(aq) + Ag<sup>+</sup>(aq) $$ \\to $$ Fe<sup>3+</sup>(aq) + Ag (s)\n<br><br>Given that<br>\n<br>$$E_{A{g^ + }/Ag}^o = xV$$<br>\n<br>$$E_{Fe^{2+ }/Fe}^o = yV$$<br>\n<br>$$E_{Fe^{3+ }/Fe}^o = zV$$",
