      "qHtml": "Given that $${E^\\Theta }_{{O_2}/{H_2}O} = 1.23\\,V$$ ;<br>\n<br>$${E^\\Theta }_{{S_2}O_8^{2 - }/SO_4^{2 - }} = 2.05\\,V$$<br>\n<br>$${E^\\Theta }_{B{r_2}/B{r^ - }} = 1.09\\,V$$<br>\n<br>$${E^\\Theta }_{A{u^{3 + }}/Au} = 1.4\\,V$$<br>\n<br>The strongest oxidizing agent is :",
