        "<p>$t_{100\\%} = 2t_{1/2}$ and $t_{100\\%} = (2t_{1/2})^2$</p>",
        "<p>$t_{100\\%} = (t_{1/2})^{\\infty}$ and $t_{100\\%} = 2t_{1/2}$</p>"
