      "qHtml": "<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml8x8c3e/3824ddec-2938-424d-8640-44bdf4d3011e/2cd419a0-0246-11f1-88dd-c7214e4b90e3/file-6y3zli1ml8x8c3f.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Evening Shift Chemistry - Chemical Kinetics and Nuclear Chemistry Question 18 English\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>Given above is the concentration vs time plot for a dissociation reaction : $\\mathrm{A} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{nB}$.</p>\n<p>Based on the data of the initial phase of the reaction (initial 10 min ), the value of n is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .</p>",
