      "qHtml": "<p>Decomposition of A is a first order reaction at T(K) and is given by&nbsp; <b>A(g) &rarr; B(g) + C(g).</b></p><p>In a closed 1 L vessel, 1 bar A(g) is allowed to decompose at T(K). After 100 minutes, the total pressure was 1.5 bar. What is the rate constant (in min<sup>&minus;1</sup>) of the reaction? (log 2 = 0.3)</p>",
