      "q": "Half life of zero order reaction $\\mathrm{A} \\rightarrow$ product is 1 hour, when initial concentration of reactant is $2.0 \\mathrm{~mol} \\mathrm{~L}{ }^{-1}$. The time required to decrease concentration of A from 0.50 to $0.25 \\mathrm{~mol} \\mathrm{~L}^{-1}$ is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Half life of zero order reaction $\\mathrm{A} \\rightarrow$ product is 1 hour, when initial concentration of reactant is $2.0 \\mathrm{~mol} \\mathrm{~L}{ }^{-1}$. The time required to decrease concentration of A from 0.50 to $0.25 \\mathrm{~mol} \\mathrm{~L}^{-1}$ is :</p>",
