      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. For zero order reaction\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Half life }=\\frac{\\mathrm{A}_{\\mathrm{o}}}{2 \\mathrm{k}} \\\\\n& 60 \\min =\\frac{2}{2 \\mathrm{k}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{k}=\\frac{1}{60} \\mathrm{M} / \\min\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nNow\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& A_t=A_o-k t \\\\\n& t=\\frac{A_o-A_t}{k} \\\\\n&=\\frac{0.5-0.25}{1 / 60} \\\\\n& 0.25 \\times 60 \\\\\n& t=15 \\mathrm{~min}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
