      "qHtml": "<p>The correct increasing order of spin-only magnetic moment values of the complex ions \n<br><br>[MnBr<sub>4</sub>]<sup>2−</sup> (A), [Cu(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> (B), [Ni(CN)<sub>4</sub>]<sup>2−</sup> (C) and [Ni(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> (D) is :</p>",
