      "q": "Given below are two statements :\n\nStatement I : $\\left[\\mathrm{CoBr}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion will absorb light of lower energy than $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion.\n\nStatement II : In $\\left[\\mathrm{CoI}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion, the energy separation between the two set of d-orbitals is more than $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion.\n\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p><b>Statement I :</b> $\\left[\\mathrm{CoBr}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion will absorb light of lower energy than $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion.</p>\n<p><b>Statement II :</b> In $\\left[\\mathrm{CoI}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion, the energy separation between the two set of d-orbitals is more than $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}_4\\right]^{2-}$ ion.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
