      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p>Statement I: Aluminium upon reaction with NaOH forms $\\left[\\mathrm{Al}(\\mathrm{OH})_6\\right]^{3-}$ ion.</p>\n<p>Statement II : The geometry of $\\mathrm{ICl}_4^{-}, \\mathrm{ClO}_3^{-}$and $\\mathrm{IBr}_2^{-}$is square planar, pyramidal and linear respectively.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
