      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 11th April Morning Shift. Correct option: C. Benzene becomes more reactive towards EAS when any substituent raises the electron density.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2023 (Online) 11th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Alcohols, Phenols and Ethers Question 51 English Explanation]\n\nCorrect increasing order is :\n\n$$\nc < a < b < d\n$$",
