      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n\n<p><b>Statement I :</b> The structure of Maltose is given below:</p>\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mnubxm4e/585bf8da-97db-4dd8-ac67-da047ece8073/9001c5e0-35a4-11f1-beb0-677fb4c7a68c/file-6y3zli1mnubxm4f.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 2 English 1\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<p><b>Statement II :</b> The structure of Lactose is given below :</p>\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mnubyk4x/a2988f74-0636-46e8-8a1b-68a004ef53b4/aa484e10-35a4-11f1-beb0-677fb4c7a68c/file-6y3zli1mnubyk4y.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 2 English 2\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>correct</b> answer from the options given below :</p>",
