      "q": "Match List - I with List - II.\n\nList - I\nChromium (III) Complexes (en = ethylene diamine)\nList - II\nΔ₀ (cm⁻¹)\n\nA\n[Cr(CN)₆]³⁻\nI. 15,060\n\nB\n[CrF₆]³⁻\nII. 17,400\n\nC\n[Cr(H₂O)₆]³⁺\nIII. 22,300\n\nD\n[Cr(en)₃]³⁺\nIV. 26,600\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:",
