      "q": "The correct increasing order of stability of the complexes based on $\\Delta_0$ value is :\n\nI. $[\\text{Mn}(\\text{CN})_6]^{3-}$\n\nII. $[\\text{Co}(\\text{CN})_6]^{4-}$\n\nIII. $[\\text{Fe}(\\text{CN})_6]^{4-}$\n\nIV. $[\\text{Fe}(\\text{CN})_6]^{3-}$",
      "qHtml": "<p>The correct increasing order of stability of the complexes based on $\\Delta_0$ value is :</p>\n<ol>\n<li>I. $[\\text{Mn}(\\text{CN})_6]^{3-}$</li>\n<br><li>II. $[\\text{Co}(\\text{CN})_6]^{4-}$</li>\n<br><li>III. $[\\text{Fe}(\\text{CN})_6]^{4-}$</li>\n<br><li>IV. $[\\text{Fe}(\\text{CN})_6]^{3-}$</li>\n</ol>",
