      "q": "Identify the homoleptic complex(es) that is/are low spin.\n\n(A) $\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}(\\mathrm{CN})_5 \\mathrm{NO}\\right]^{2-}$\n\n(B) $\\left[\\mathrm{CoF}_6\\right]^{3-}$\n\n(C) $\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}(\\mathrm{CN})_6\\right]^{4-}$\n\n(D) $\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+}$\n\n(E) $\\left[\\mathrm{Cr}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+}$\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Identify the homoleptic complex(es) that is/are low spin.</p>\n<p>(A) $\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}(\\mathrm{CN})_5 \\mathrm{NO}\\right]^{2-}$</p>\n<p>(B) $\\left[\\mathrm{CoF}_6\\right]^{3-}$</p>\n<p>(C) $\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}(\\mathrm{CN})_6\\right]^{4-}$</p>\n<p>(D) $\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+}$</p>\n<p>(E) $\\left[\\mathrm{Cr}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+}$</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
