      "qHtml": "Let $\\alpha, \\alpha+2, \\alpha \\in \\mathbf{Z}$, be the roots of the quadratic equation $x(x+2)+(x+1)(x+3)+(x+2)(x+4)+\\ldots .+(x+\\mathrm{n}-1)(x+\\mathrm{n}+1)=4 \\mathrm{n}$ for some $\\mathrm{n} \\in \\mathbf{N}$. Then $\\mathrm{n}+\\alpha$ is equal to :",
