      "q": "Given below are two statements :\nStatement I :\n$25^{13} + 20^{13} + 8^{13} + 3^{13}$ is divisible by 7.\nStatement II :\nThe integral part of $(7 + 4\\sqrt{3})^{25}$ is an odd number.\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p><b>Statement I</b> :</p><p>$25^{13} + 20^{13} + 8^{13} + 3^{13}$ is divisible by 7.</p><p><b>Statement II</b> :</p><p>The integral part of $(7 + 4\\sqrt{3})^{25}$ is an odd number.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>correct answer</b> from the options given below :</p>",
