      "qHtml": "A function $$f$$ from the set of natural numbers to integers defined by\n$$$f\\left( n \\right) = \\left\\{ {\\matrix{\n   {{{n - 1} \\over 2},\\,when\\,n\\,is\\,odd}  \\cr \n   { - {n \\over 2},\\,when\\,n\\,is\\,even}  \\cr \n\n } } \\right.$$$\nis",
