      "qHtml": "<p>Let $a, b \\in \\mathbb{C}$. Let $\\alpha, \\beta$ be the roots of the equation $x^2+a x+b=0$. If $\\beta-\\alpha=\\sqrt{11}$ and $\\beta^2-\\alpha^2=3 i \\sqrt{11}$, then $\\left(\\beta^3-\\alpha^3\\right)^2$ is equal to:</p>",
