      "qHtml": "<p>If $f(x)=\\frac{2^x}{2^x+\\sqrt{2}}, \\mathrm{x} \\in \\mathbb{R}$, then $\\sum_\\limits{\\mathrm{k}=1}^{81} f\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{k}}{82}\\right)$ is equal to</p>",
