      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $$ \\begin{aligned} & f(x)=\\lim _{y \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1-\\cos (x y)}{(x y)^2} \\cdot \\frac{\\tan x y}{x y} \\frac{(x y)^3}{y^3} \\\\ & f(x)=\\frac{x^3}{2} \\\\ & f(x)=\\sin x \\\\ & \\frac{x^3}{2}=\\sin x \\end{aligned} $$\n\n3 points of intersection",
