      "qHtml": "<p>If $ \\lim\\limits_{x\\to 2} \\frac{\\sin\\left(x^3 - 5x^2 + ax + b\\right)}{\\left(\\sqrt{x-1}-1\\right) \\log_e(x-1)} = m $, then $a + b + m$ is equal to :</p>",
