      "q": "Let [ • ] denote the greatest integer function. If the domain of the function $f(x)=\\sin ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{x+[x]}{3}\\right)$ is $[\\alpha, \\beta)$, then $\\alpha^2+\\beta^2$ is equal to:",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let [ • ] denote the greatest integer function. If the domain of the function $f(x)=\\sin ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{x+[x]}{3}\\right)$ is $[\\alpha, \\beta)$, then $\\alpha^2+\\beta^2$ is equal to:</p>",
