      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift. Correct option: A. $$ \\begin{aligned} & \\sqrt{3} \\cos 2 \\theta+8 \\cos \\theta+3 \\sqrt{3}=0, \\theta \\in[-3 \\pi, 2 \\pi] \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\quad \\sqrt{3}\\left(2 \\cos ^2 \\theta-1\\right) 8 \\cos \\theta+3 \\sqrt{3}=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\quad 2 \\sqrt{3} \\cos ^2 \\theta+8 \\cos \\theta+2 \\sqrt{3}=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\quad 2 \\sqrt{3} \\cos ^2 \\theta+6 \\cos \\theta+2 \\cos \\theta+2 \\sqrt{3}=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\quad 2 \\sqrt{3} \\cos \\theta(\\cos \\theta+\\sqrt{3})+2(\\cos \\theta+\\sqrt{3})=0 \\\\ & \\therefore \\quad(2 \\sqrt{3} \\cos \\theta+2)(\\cos \\theta+\\sqrt{3})=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\cos \\theta=\\frac{-2}{2 \\sqrt{3}} \\\\ & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\end{aligned} $$\n\nTotal 5 solutions\n\nOption (4) is correct",
