      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\alpha^{\\mathrm{n}}+\\beta^{\\mathrm{n}}, \\mathrm{n} \\in \\mathrm{N}$. If $\\mathrm{P}_{10}=123, \\mathrm{P}_9=76, \\mathrm{P}_8=47$ and $\\mathrm{P}_1=1$, then the quadratic equation having roots $\\frac{1}{\\alpha}$ and $\\frac{1}{\\beta}$ is :</p>",
