      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\alpha, \\beta$ be the roots of the equation $x^2-x+\\mathrm{p}=0$ and $\\gamma, \\delta$ be the roots the equation $x^2-4 x+\\mathrm{q}=0$; $p, q \\in \\mathbf{Z}$. If $\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma, \\delta$ are in G.P., then $|p+q|$ equals :</p>",
