      "q": "Let $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$ be an A.P. and $g_1 = a_1, g_2, g_3, \\ldots$ be an increasing G.P. If $a_1 = a_2 + g_2 = 1$ and $a_3 + g_3 = 4$, then $a_{10} + g_5$ is equal to:",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$ be an A.P. and $g_1 = a_1, g_2, g_3, \\ldots$ be an increasing G.P. If $a_1 = a_2 + g_2 = 1$ and $a_3 + g_3 = 4$, then $a_{10} + g_5$ is equal to:</p>",
