      "qHtml": "<p>Let $a_n$ be the $n^{th}$ term of an A.P. If $S_n = a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\ldots + a_n = 700$, $a_6 = 7$ and $S_7 = 7$, then $a_n$ is equal to :</p>",
