      "qHtml": "<p>Let $x_1, x_2, x_3, x_4$ be in a geometric progression. If $2,7,9,5$ are subtracted respectively from $x_1, x_2, x_3, x_4$, then the resulting numbers are in an arithmetic progression. Then the value of $\\frac{1}{24}\\left(x_1 x_2 x_3 x_4\\right)$ is:</p>",
