      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\left\\langle a_{\\mathrm{n}}\\right\\rangle$ be a sequence such that $a_0=0, a_1=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $2 a_{\\mathrm{n}+2}=5 a_{\\mathrm{n}+1}-3 a_{\\mathrm{n}}, \\mathrm{n}=0,1,2,3, \\ldots$. Then $\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{100} a_k$ is equal to</p>",
