      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Let } S=5+\\frac{1}{7}(5+\\alpha)+\\frac{1}{7^2}(5+2 \\alpha)+\\ldots \\\\\n& \\frac{1}{7} S=\\frac{1}{7}(5)+\\frac{1}{7^2}(5+\\alpha)+\\ldots \\infty\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\frac{6}{7}(S)=5+\\frac{1}{7} \\alpha\\left(\\frac{1}{1-\\frac{1}{7}}\\right)\\\\\n&6=5+\\frac{\\alpha}{6} \\Rightarrow \\alpha=6\n\\end{aligned}$$",
