      "qHtml": "<p>The sum of all possible values of $\\mathbf{n} \\in \\mathbf{N}$, so that the coefficients of $x, x^2$ and $x^3$ in the expansion of $\\left(1+x^2\\right)^2(1+x)^{\\mathrm{n}}$, are in arithmetic progression is :</p>",
