      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $$ \\begin{aligned} & \\left(1+x^2\\right)^2\\left(1+x^n\\right) \\\\ & \\left(1+x^4+2 x^2\\right)(1+x)^n \\\\ & \\text { Coeff of } x={ }^n C_1 \\\\ & \\text { Coeff of } x^2={ }^n C_2+2 \\cdot{ }^n C_0 \\\\ & \\text { Coeff of } x^3={ }^n C_3+2 \\cdot{ }^n C_1 \\\\ & \\because \\text { Coeff of } x, x^2, x^3 \\rightarrow \\mathrm{AP} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 2\\left({ }^n C_2+2\\right)={ }^n C_1+{ }^n C_3+2 n \\\\ & 2^n C_2+4={ }^n C_3+3 n \\\\ & \\Rightarrow n^2-9 n^2+26 n-24=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow n=2,3,4 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\text { Sum of all value of } n \\text { is } 9 \\end{aligned} $$",
