      "q": "$\\left(\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{4}{7}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{3^2}+\\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{4}{7}+\\frac{4^2}{7^2}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{3^3}+\\frac{1}{3^2} \\times \\frac{4}{7}+\\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{4^2}{7^2}+\\frac{4^3}{7^3}\\right)+\\ldots$ upto infinite terms, is equal to",
      "qHtml": "<p>$\\left(\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{4}{7}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{3^2}+\\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{4}{7}+\\frac{4^2}{7^2}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{3^3}+\\frac{1}{3^2} \\times \\frac{4}{7}+\\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{4^2}{7^2}+\\frac{4^3}{7^3}\\right)+\\ldots$ upto infinite terms, is equal to</p>",
