      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& (1+x)^n={ }^n C_0+{ }^n C_1 x^1+{ }^n C_2 x^2+\\ldots{ }^n C_n x^n \\\\\n& { }^n C_4,{ }^n C_5 \\&{ }^n C_6 \\text { are in A.P. } \\\\\n& { }^n C_5-{ }^n C_4={ }^n C_6-{ }^n C_5 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{n!}{5!(n-5)!}-\\frac{n!}{4!(n-4)!}=\\frac{n!}{6!(n-6)!}-\\frac{n!}{5!(n-5)!} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 30(n-9)(n-6)=5(n-4)(n-11) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 30 n^2-450 n+1620=5 n^2 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{n-5}\\left[\\frac{n-4-5}{5(n-4)}\\right]=\\frac{1}{5}\\left[\\frac{n-5-6}{6(n-5)}\\right] \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{n-9}{5(n-4)}=\\frac{1}{5}\\left[\\frac{n-11}{6}\\right] \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow n^2-21 n+98=0 \\\\\n& n_{\\max }=14\n\\end{aligned}$$",
