      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th April Evening Slot. Correct option: D. Given $${}^n{C_{r - 1}}:{}^n{C_r}:{}^n{C_{r + 1}} = 2:15:70$$\n\n$${{{}^n{C_{r - 1}}} \\over {{}^n{C_r}}} = {2 \\over {15}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {r \\over {n - r + 1}} = {2 \\over {15}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow 15r = 2n - 2r + 2$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow 17r = 2n + 2$$ .... (i)\n\nNow $${{{}^n{C_r}} \\over {{}^n{C_{r + 1}}}} = {{15} \\over {70}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {{r + 1} \\over {n - r}} = {3 \\over {14}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 14r + 14 = 3n – 3r\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 17r = 3n – 14 ... (ii)\n\nNow From (i) and (ii) equation\n\n2n + 2 = 3n - 14 $$ \\Rightarrow $$ n = 16\n\nBy putting n = 16 in equation (i)\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ r = 2\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ Average of coefficient = $${{{}^{16}{C_1} + {}^{16}{C_2} + {}^{16}{C_3}} \\over 3} $$\n\n= $${{16 + 120 + 560} \\over 3}$$\n\n= $${{696} \\over 3} = 232$$",
