      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. Let\n\n$A$ = event that player A is selected as captain\n\n$B$ = event that player B is selected as captain\n\n$W$ = event that the team wins the tournament\n\nGiven:\n\n$$ P(A)=0.6,\\qquad P(B)=0.4 $$\n\nAlso,\n\n$$ P(W|A)=0.8,\\qquad P(W|B)=0.7 $$\n\nWe have to find $P(W)$.\n\nUsing the formula of total probability:\n\n$$ P(W)=P(A)\\,P(W|A)+P(B)\\,P(W|B) $$\n\nSubstituting the values:\n\n$$ P(W)=0.6\\times 0.8+0.4\\times 0.7 $$\n\n$$ P(W)=0.48+0.28 $$\n\n$$ P(W)=0.76 $$\n\nSo, the required probability is\n\n$$ \\boxed{0.76} $$\n\nHence, the correct option is Option B .",
