      "q": "If $A$ and $B$ are two events such that $P(A \\cap B)=0.1$, and $P(A \\mid B)$ and $P(B \\mid A)$ are the roots of the equation $12 x^2-7 x+1=0$, then the value of $\\frac{P(\\bar{A} \\cup \\bar{B})}{P(\\bar{A} \\cap \\bar{B})}$ is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>If $A$ and $B$ are two events such that $P(A \\cap B)=0.1$, and $P(A \\mid B)$ and $P(B \\mid A)$ are the roots of the equation $12 x^2-7 x+1=0$, then the value of $\\frac{P(\\bar{A} \\cup \\bar{B})}{P(\\bar{A} \\cap \\bar{B})}$ is :</p>",
