      "qHtml": "<p>A coin is tossed three times. Let $X$ denote the number of times a tail follows a head. If $\\mu$ and $\\sigma^2$ denote the mean and variance of $X$, then the value of $64\\left(\\mu+\\sigma^2\\right)$ is:</p>",
