      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Evening Slot. Correct option: A. Formula for standard hyperbola :\n\n$${{{x^2}} \\over {{a^2}}} - {{{y^2}} \\over {{b^2}}} = 1$$\n\nIt passes through (4, 6)\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ $${{16} \\over {{a^2}}} - {{36} \\over {{b^2}}} = 1$$ ........(1)\n\nWe know, $${e^2} = 1 + {{{b^2}} \\over {{a^2}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 4 = $$1 + {{{b^2}} \\over {{a^2}}}$$ [ as e = 2 ]\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $${{b^2} = 3{a^2}}$$ ....(2)\n\nPutting $${{b^2} = 3{a^2}}$$ in equation (1)\n\n$${{16} \\over {{a^2}}} - {{36} \\over {3{a^2}}} = 1$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $${{a^2} = 4}$$\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ , $${{b^2} = 12}$$\n\nSo Equation of hyperbola is\n\n$${{{x^2}} \\over 4} - {{{y^2}} \\over {12}} = 1$$\n\nEquation of tangent to the hyperbola at (4, 6) is\n\n$${{4x} \\over 4} - {{6y} \\over {12}} = 1$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $$x - {y \\over 2} = 1$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 2x – y – 2 = 0",
