      "q": "Let an ellipse $\\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$, $a < b$, pass through the point (4, 3) and have eccentricity $\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}$.\nThen the length of its latus rectum is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let an ellipse $\\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$, $a &lt; b$, pass through the point (4, 3) and have eccentricity $\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}$.</p><p>Then the length of its latus rectum is :</p>",
