      "qHtml": "<p>Let O be the origin, and P and Q be two points on the rectangular hyperbola $xy = 12$ such that the midpoint of the line segment PQ is $\\left( \\frac{1}{2}, -\\frac{1}{2} \\right)$. Then the area of the triangle OPQ equals :</p>",
