      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift Mathematics - Circle Question 20 English Explanation]\n\nBy pytogorus $\\mathrm{r}^2=\\mathrm{a}^2+\\frac{\\mathrm{b}^2}{4}=\\mathrm{P}^2$\n\n$$r=\\sqrt{\\frac{4 a^2+b^2}{4}}$$\n\nEquation of circle is $(x-\\alpha)^2+(y-\\beta)^2=r^2$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& x^2+y^2-2 a x-2 p y+\\alpha^2+p^2-r^2=0 \\\\\n& \\text { comparision } x^2+y^2-\\alpha x+\\beta y+r=0 \\\\\n& -\\alpha=-2 a, \\beta=-2 p, r=a^2 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2 a=\\alpha, 4 a^2+b^2=4 p^2 \\\\\n& \\alpha^2+b^2=4 p^2 \\\\\n& \\alpha^2+b^2=\\beta^2\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSo, $\\left(2 a, b^2\\right)=\\left(\\alpha, \\beta^2-4 r\\right)$",
