      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p><b>Statement I :</b> The function $f: \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}$ defined by $f(x) = \\frac{x}{1 + |x|}$ is one-one.</p>\n<p><b>Statement II :</b> The function $f: \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}$ defined by $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 4x - 30}{x^2 - 8x + 18}$ is many-one.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>correct answer</b> from the options given below :</p>",
