      "qHtml": "<p>If $26\\left(\\frac{2^3}{3}\\left({ }^{12} \\mathrm{C}_2\\right)+\\frac{2^5}{5}\\left({ }^{12} \\mathrm{C}_4\\right)+\\frac{2^7}{7}\\left({ }^{12} \\mathrm{C}_6\\right)+\\cdots+\\frac{2^{13}}{13}\\left({ }^{12} \\mathrm{C}_{12}\\right)\\right)=3^{13}-\\alpha$, then $\\alpha$ is equal to :</p>",
