      "q": "The coefficient of $x^2$ in the expansion of $\\left(2 x^2+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^{10}, x \\neq 0$, is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>The coefficient of $x^2$ in the expansion of $\\left(2 x^2+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^{10}, x \\neq 0$, is :</p>",
