      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $$ \\begin{aligned} & S=(1+x)+2(1+x)^2+3(1+x)^3+\\ldots+100(1+x)^{100} \\\\ & (1+x) S=(1+x)^2+\\ldots+99(1+x)^{100}+100(1+x)^{101} \\\\ & -x S=(1+x)\\left(\\frac{(1+x)^{100}-1}{x}\\right)-100(1+x)^{101} \\\\ & S=\\left(\\frac{(1+x)-(1+x)^{101}}{x^2}\\right)+\\frac{100(1+x)^{101}}{x} \\\\ & \\text { Coeff of } x^{48}=-{ }^{101} C_{50}+100 \\times{ }^{(101)} C_{49} \\end{aligned} $$",
