      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $$ \\begin{aligned} &\\begin{aligned} & \\left(a x^2+b x+c\\right)(1-2 x)^{26} \\\\ & a x^2(1-2 x)^{26}+b x(1-2 x)^{26}+c(1-2 x)^{26} \\end{aligned}\\\\ &\\text { Coefficient of }\\\\ &\\begin{aligned} & x \\Rightarrow\\left[0+b \\cdot{ }^{26} C_0+c \\cdot{ }^{26} C_1(-2)\\right] x \\\\ & =b-52 c \\end{aligned} \\end{aligned} $$\n\nCoefficient of\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} & x^2=\\left(a\\left({ }^{26} C_0\\right)+b \\cdot{ }^{26} C_1(-2)+c{ }^{26} C_2(-2)^2\\right) x^2 \\\\ & =a-52 b+{ }^{26} C_2 \\times 4=a-52 b+1300 c \\end{aligned} $$\n\nCoefficient of\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} & x^3=\\left[a \\cdot{ }^{26} C_1(-2)+b \\cdot{ }^{26} C_2(26)^2+c^{26} C_3(-2)^3\\right] \\\\ & =-52 a+1300 b-20800 c \\\\ & \\Rightarrow b-52 c=-56 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow b-52 c=-56 \\\\ & \\begin{aligned} a-52 b+1300 c=0 \\quad \\Rightarrow & a=1300 \\\\ \\quad-a+25 b-400 c=0 \\quad & b=100 \\\\ & c=3 \\\\ \\Rightarrow & a+b+c=1403 \\end{aligned} \\end{aligned} $$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Morning Shift | Mathematical Reasoning | ml89h7wg",
