      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 8th April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $$ \\begin{array}{|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|} \\hline \\text { Conveyance } & \\text { Bus } & \\text { Scooter } & \\text { Car } & \\text { Arrive late } & \\text { Bus } & \\text { Scooter } & \\text { Car } \\\\ \\hline \\text { Probability } & \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{2}{5} & \\text { Probability } & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} $$\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} &\\text { We label the events in the chart below : }\\\\ &\\begin{array}{|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|} \\hline \\text { Conveyance } & \\text { Bus } & \\text { Scooter } & \\text { Car } & \\text { Arrive late by } & \\text { Bus } & \\text { Scooter } & \\text { Car } \\\\ \\hline \\text { Event } & B & S & C & \\text { Event } & \\boldsymbol{L}_b & L_s & \\boldsymbol{L}_c \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} \\end{aligned} $$\n\nWe label the event that the candidate arrives late be $\\boldsymbol{L}$\n\n$$ \\begin{array}{|l|c|c|c|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text { Event } & \\boldsymbol{B} & \\boldsymbol{S} & \\boldsymbol{C} & \\boldsymbol{L}_b & \\boldsymbol{L}_s & \\boldsymbol{L}_c \\\\ \\hline \\text { Probability } & \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} $$\n\n$\\Rightarrow P(L \\cap B)=P(L) \\cdot P(B / L)=P(B \\cap L)$\n\n$$\\Rightarrow $$ $P(B / L)=\\frac{P(B \\cap L)}{P(L)}$\n\n$=\\frac{P(B) \\cdot P(L / B)}{P(B \\cap L)+P(S \\cap L)+P(C \\cap L)}$\n\n$=\\frac{P(B) \\cdot P(L / B)}{P(B) \\cdot P(L / B)+P(S) \\cdot P(L / S)+P(C) \\cdot P(C / B)}$\n\n$P(B / L)=\\frac{P(B) \\cdot P\\left(L_b\\right)}{P(B) \\cdot P\\left(L_b\\right)+P(S) \\cdot P\\left(L_s\\right)+P(C) \\cdot P\\left(L_c\\right)}$\n\n$=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right) \\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)}{\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right) \\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right) \\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right) \\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)}$\n\n$=\\left(\\frac{2}{25}\\right) \\cdot\\left(\\frac{300}{24+20+30}\\right)=\\frac{12}{37}$",
