      "qHtml": "<p>A data consists of 20 observations $x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_{20}$. If $\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{20}\\left(x_i+5\\right)^2=2500$ and $\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{20}\\left(x_i-5\\right)^2=100$, then the ratio of mean to standard deviation of this data is :</p>",
