      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $$ \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|} \\hline \\mathrm{X} & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline p(n) & \\frac{2 a+1}{30} & \\frac{8 a-1}{30} & \\frac{4 a+1}{30} & \\mathrm{~b} \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} $$\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} &\\begin{aligned} & \\mu=\\Sigma \\times p(n)=0+\\frac{8 a-1}{30}+2 \\times \\frac{4 a+1}{30}+3 b=\\frac{16 a+90 b+1}{30} \\\\ & \\sigma^2=\\Sigma x^2 p(n)-\\mu^2 \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2+\\mu^2=\\Sigma x^2 p(n)=2 \\\\ & \\frac{8 a-1}{30}+\\frac{4(4 a+1)}{30}+9 b=2 \\\\ & 8 a+90 b-19=0 \\ldots \\ldots \\ldots(i) \\\\ & \\Sigma p(n)=1 \\Rightarrow 14 a+1+30 b=30 \\\\ & 14 a+30 b-29=0 \\ldots \\ldots . .(i i) \\end{aligned}\\\\ &\\text { From (i) and (ii) }\\\\ &a=2 \\quad b=\\frac{1}{30}=\\frac{a}{b}=60 \\end{aligned} $$",
