      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Mean } \\overline{\\mathrm{x}}=5.5 \\\\\n& =\\sum_{\\mathrm{i}=1}^{10} \\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{i}}=5.5 \\times 10=55 \\\\\n& =\\sum_{\\mathrm{i}=1}^{10} \\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{i}}^2=371 \\\\\n& \\left(\\sum \\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{i}}\\right)_{\\text {new }}=55-(4+5)+(6+8)=60 \\\\\n& \\left(\\sum \\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{i}}\\right)_{\\text {new }}=371-\\left(4^2+5^2\\right)+\\left(6^2+8^2\\right)=430 \\\\\n& \\\\\n& \\text { Variance } \\sigma^2=\\frac{\\sum \\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{i}}^2}{10}-\\left(\\frac{\\sum \\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{i}}}{10}\\right)^2 \\\\\n& \\\\\n& \\sigma^2=\\frac{430}{10}-\\left(\\frac{60}{10}\\right)^2 \\\\\n& \\sigma^2=43-36 \\\\\n& \\sigma^2=7\n\\end{aligned}$$",
