      "qHtml": "<p>If <i>A</i> and <i>B</i> are two events such that $P(A) = 0.7$, $P(B) = 0.4$ and $P(A \\cap \\overline{B}) = 0.5$, where $\\overline{B}$ denotes the complement of <i>B</i>, then $P\\left(B \\mid (A \\cup \\overline{B})\\right)$ is equal to</p>",
