      "q": "If the probability that the random variable $X$ takes the value $x$ is given by\n\n$P(X=x)=k(x+1) 3^{-x}, x=0,1,2,3 \\ldots$, where $k$ is a constant, then $P(X \\geq 3)$ is equal to",
      "qHtml": "<p>If the probability that the random variable $X$ takes the value $x$ is given by</p>\n<p>$P(X=x)=k(x+1) 3^{-x}, x=0,1,2,3 \\ldots$, where $k$ is a constant, then $P(X \\geq 3)$ is equal to </p>",
