      "qHtml": "<p>Let <em>α</em> be a solution of $x^2 + x + 1 = 0$, and for some <em>a</em> and <em>b</em> in</p> <p>$R, \\begin{bmatrix} 4 & a & b \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 16 & 13 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & -14 & -8 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 0 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$. If $\\frac{4}{\\alpha^4} + \\frac{m}{\\alpha^a} + \\frac{n}{\\alpha^b} = 3$, then <em>m</em> + <em>n</em> is equal to _______</p>",
