      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 8th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\\alpha & 1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{array}\\right]$\n\n$\\Rightarrow|\\boldsymbol{A}|=15 \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}-10+16=15 \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}+6$\n\nNow adj $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}15 & 3 & -6 \\\\ -10 & 5 \\alpha & 4 \\\\ 8 & -4 \\alpha & 3 \\alpha-2\\end{array}\\right]$\n\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{B}=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 \\alpha & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 \\alpha & -2 \\alpha\\end{array}\\right]+\\operatorname{adj}(\\mathrm{A})$\n\n$B=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}16 & 3 & -6 \\\\ -10 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & \\alpha-2\\end{array}\\right]$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\&|\\mathrm{~B}|=6(5 \\alpha+6)=66 \\text { (given in question) } \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\alpha=1 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow|\\mathrm{~A}|=21\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\boldsymbol{A} \\cdot \\operatorname{Adj}(\\boldsymbol{A})=|\\boldsymbol{A}| \\boldsymbol{I} \\Rightarrow|\\boldsymbol{A} \\cdot \\operatorname{Adj}(\\boldsymbol{A})|=\\| \\boldsymbol{A}|\\boldsymbol{I}|=\\left(|\\boldsymbol{A}|^3\\right)|\\boldsymbol{I}|=|\\boldsymbol{A}|^3$\n\n$$\\Rightarrow $$ $|\\boldsymbol{A}||\\operatorname{Adj}(\\boldsymbol{A})|=|\\boldsymbol{A}|^3 \\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{Adj}(\\boldsymbol{A})|=|\\boldsymbol{A}|^2=(21)^2=441$",
