      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 6th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{A}=\\mathrm{P}+\\mathrm{I} \\\\ & \\mathrm{A}=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right]+\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & \\mathrm{A}=\\mathrm{P}+\\mathrm{I} \\text { where } \\mathrm{P}^3=0 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~A}^{99}=\\mathrm{I}+99 \\mathrm{P}+{ }^{99} \\mathrm{C}_2 \\mathrm{P}^2\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{A}^{99}-\\mathrm{I}=99\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right]+{ }^{99} \\mathrm{C}_2\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 99 \\times 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 44550 & 99 \\times 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}$\n\n$b_{31}=44550, b_{21}=99 \\times 3, b_{32}=99 \\times 3$\n\n$$\\therefore $$ $\\frac{\\mathrm{b}_{31}-\\mathrm{b}_{21}}{\\mathrm{~b}_{32}}$ = $\\frac{44550-297}{297}=149$",
