      "q": "Consider the matrix $f(x)=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\\cos x & -\\sin x & 0 \\\\ \\sin x & \\cos x & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$.\n\nGiven below are two statements :\n\nStatement I : $ f(-x)$ is the inverse of the matrix $f(x)$.\n\nStatement II : $f(x) f(y)=f(x+y)$.\n\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "Consider the matrix $f(x)=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\\cos x & -\\sin x & 0 \\\\ \\sin x & \\cos x & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$.\n<br><br>Given below are two statements :\n<br><br>Statement I : $ f(-x)$ is the inverse of the matrix $f(x)$.\n<br><br>Statement II : $f(x) f(y)=f(x+y)$.\n<br><br>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
