      "qHtml": "Let the determinant of a square matrix A of order $m$ be $m-n$, where $m$ and $n$<br><br> satisfy $4 m+n=22$ and $17 m+4 n=93$.<br><br> If $\\operatorname{det}(n \\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}(m A)))=3^{a} 5^{b} 6^{c}$ then $a+b+c$ is equal to :",
