      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 1st September Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $$\\Delta = \\left| {\\matrix{\n{ - 1} & 1 & 2 \\cr\n3 & { - a} & 5 \\cr\n2 & { - 2} & { - a} \\cr\n\n} } \\right|$$\n\n$$ = - 1({a^2} + 10) - 1( - 3a - 10) + 2( - 6 + 2a)$$\n\n$$ = - {a^2} - 10 + 3a + 10 - 12 + 4a$$\n\n$$\\Delta = - {a^2} + 7a - 12$$\n\n$$\\Delta = - [{a^2} - 7a + 12]$$\n\n$$\\Delta = - [(a - 3)(a - 4)]$$\n\n$${\\Delta _1} = \\left| {\\matrix{\n0 & 1 & 2 \\cr\n1 & { - a} & 5 \\cr\n7 & { - 2} & { - a} \\cr\n\n} } \\right|$$\n\n$$ = a + 35 - 4 + 14a$$\n\n= $$15a + 31$$\n\nNow, $${\\Delta _1} = 15a + 31$$\n\nFor inconsistent $$\\Delta$$ = 0 $$\\therefore$$ a = 3, a = 4 and for a = 3 and 4, $$\\Delta$$ 1 $$\\ne$$ 0\n\nn(S 1 ) = 2\n\nFor infinite solution : $$\\Delta$$ = 0 and $$\\Delta$$ 1 = $$\\Delta$$ 2 = $$\\Delta$$ 3 = 0\n\nNot possible\n\n$$\\therefore$$ n(S 2 ) = 0",
