      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}=2 \\hat{i}+3 \\hat{j}+3 \\hat{k}$ and $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}=6 \\hat{i}+3 \\hat{j}+3 \\hat{k}$. Then the square of the area of the triangle with adjacent sides determined by the vectors $(2 \\vec{a}+3 \\vec{b})$ and $(\\vec{a}-\\vec{b})$ is :</p>",
