      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $\\begin{aligned} & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OR}}=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OP}}}{5}=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}}{5} \\\\ & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{RM}}=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OQ}}}{5}=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}}{5} \\\\ & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OM}}-\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OR}}=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}}{5} \\\\ & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OM}}=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}+\\overline{\\mathrm{b}}}{5} \\\\ & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{PM}}=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OM}}-\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OP}} \\\\ & \\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}+\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}}{5}-\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}} \\\\ & =\\frac{\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}-4 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}}{5}\\end{aligned}$",
