      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $$\\vec{c}=\\lambda \\vec{a}+\\mu \\vec{b}$$\n\n$$\\vec{c}=(\\mu-\\lambda)\\hat{i}+(\\lambda+3\\mu)\\hat{j}+(3\\lambda+\\mu)\\hat{k}$$\n\n$$\\vec{c}\\cdot(3\\hat{i}-6\\hat{j}+2\\hat{k})=10$$\n\n$$3(\\mu-\\lambda)-6(\\lambda+3\\mu)+2(3\\lambda+\\mu)=10$$\n\n$$-3\\lambda-13\\mu=10 \\qquad \\ldots (1)$$\n\n$$\\vec{c}\\cdot(\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k})=-2$$\n\n$$5\\mu+3\\lambda=-2 \\qquad \\ldots (2)$$\n\nSolving (1) & (2)\n\n$$\\lambda=1,\\ \\mu=-1$$\n\n$$\\vec{c}=-2\\hat{i}-2\\hat{j}+2\\hat{k}$$\n\n$$|\\vec{c}|^2=12$$",
