      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift. Correct option: C. $\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{E}=3 \\sqrt{9 a^2+4 b^2+12 \\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b}}+4 \\sqrt{9 a^2+4 b^2-12 \\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b}} \\\\ & =3 \\sqrt{36+36+12 \\times 6 \\cos \\theta}+4 \\sqrt{36+36-72 \\cos \\theta} \\\\ & =3 \\sqrt{72+72 \\cos \\theta}+4 \\sqrt{72-72 \\cos \\theta} \\\\ & =18 \\sqrt{2} \\sqrt{1+\\cos \\theta}+24 \\sqrt{2} \\sqrt{1-\\cos \\theta} \\\\ & =18 \\sqrt{2} \\sqrt{2} \\cos \\frac{\\theta}{2}+24 \\sqrt{2}\\left(\\sqrt{2} \\sin \\frac{\\theta}{2}\\right) \\\\ & =36\\left(\\cos \\frac{\\theta}{2}\\right)+48 \\sin \\left(\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\right) \\\\ & \\mathrm{E}_{\\max }=\\sqrt{(36)^2+(48)^2}=\\sqrt{6^4+6^2 \\times 8^2}=60\\end{aligned}$",
