      "qHtml": "<p>Let P be a point in the plane of the vectors $\\overrightarrow{AB}=3\\hat{i} + \\hat{j} - \\hat{k}$ and $\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\hat{i} - \\hat{j} + 3\\hat{k}$ such that P is equidistant from the lines AB and AC. If $|\\overrightarrow{AP}| = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}$, then the area of the triangle ABP is :</p>",
