      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift. Correct option: A. $\\begin{aligned} & \\vec{a}=-5 \\cdot \\hat{i}+\\hat{j}-3 \\hat{k}, \\vec{b}=\\hat{i}+2 \\hat{j}-4 \\hat{k} \\\\\\\\ & \\vec{c}=(((\\vec{a} \\times \\vec{b}) \\times \\hat{i}) \\times \\hat{i}) \\times \\hat{i} \\\\\\\\ & =(((\\vec{a} \\cdot \\hat{i}) \\vec{b}-(\\vec{b} \\cdot \\hat{i}) \\vec{a}) \\times \\hat{i}) \\times \\hat{i} \\\\\\\\ & =((-5 \\vec{b}-\\vec{a}) \\times \\hat{i}) \\times \\hat{i}\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & =((-11 \\hat{j}+23 \\hat{k}) \\times \\hat{i}) \\times \\hat{i} \\\\\\\\ & = (11 \\hat{k}+23 \\hat{j}) \\times \\hat{i} \\\\\\\\ & = (11 \\hat{j}-23 \\hat{k})\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\vec{c} \\cdot(-\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k})=0+11-23 \\\\\\\\ & =-12\\end{aligned}$",
