      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 25th July Morning Shift. Correct option: A. If the vectors are co-planar,\n\n$$\\left| {\\matrix{\n{a + b + 2} & {a + 2b + c} & { - b - c} \\cr\n{b + 1} & {2b} & { - b} \\cr\n{b + 2} & {2b} & {1 - b} \\cr\n\n} } \\right| = 0$$\n\nNow, $${R_3} \\to {R_3} - {R_2},{R_1} \\to {R_1} - {R_2}$$\n\nSo, $$\\left| {\\matrix{\n{a + 1} & {a + c} & { - c} \\cr\n{b + 1} & {2b} & { - b} \\cr\n1 & 0 & 1 \\cr\n\n} } \\right| = 0$$\n\n$$ = (a + 1)2b - (a + c)(2b + 1) - c( - 2b)$$\n\n$$ = 2ab + 2b - 2ab - a - 2bc - c + 2bc$$\n\n$$ = 2b - a - c = 0$$",
