      "qHtml": "<p>If the point of intersection of the lines $ \\frac{x+1}{3} = \\frac{y+a}{5} = \\frac{z+b+1}{7} $ and $ \\frac{x-2}{1} = \\frac{y-b}{4} = \\frac{z-2a}{7} $  lies on xy-plane, then the value of $a+b$ is:</p>",
