      "q": "If the equation of the line passing through the point $ \\left( 0, -\\frac{1}{2}, 0 \\right) $ and perpendicular to the lines $ \\vec{r} = \\lambda \\left( \\hat{i} + a\\hat{j} + b\\hat{k} \\right) $ and $ \\vec{r} = \\left( \\hat{i} - \\hat{j} - 6\\hat{k} \\right) + \\mu \\left( -b \\hat{i} + a\\hat{j} + 5\\hat{k} \\right) $ is $ \\frac{x-1}{-2} = \\frac{y+4}{d} = \\frac{z-c}{-4} $, then $ a+b+c+d $ is equal to :",
