      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& L_1: \\frac{x-3}{3}=\\frac{y-\\alpha}{-1}=\\frac{z-3}{1} \\\\\n& L_2: \\frac{x+3}{-3}=\\frac{y+7}{2}=\\frac{z-\\beta}{4}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& a_1:(3, \\alpha, 3) \\quad a^2=(-3,-7, \\beta) \\\\\n& \\vec{b}_1=3 \\hat{i}-\\hat{j}+\\hat{k} \\quad \\vec{b}_2=-3 \\hat{i}+2 \\hat{j}+4 \\hat{k}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$d=\\frac{\\left|\\left(\\vec{a}_2-\\vec{a}_1\\right) \\cdot\\left(\\vec{b}_1 \\times \\vec{b}_2\\right)\\right|}{\\left|\\vec{b}_1 \\times \\vec{b}_2\\right|}=3 \\sqrt{30}$\n\n$=\\frac{\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}6 & \\alpha+7 & 3-\\beta \\\\ 3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right|}{\\sqrt{6^2+15^2+3^2}}=3 \\sqrt{30}$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\Rightarrow & |-15 \\alpha-3 \\beta-132|=270 \\\\\n& |5 \\alpha+\\beta+44|=90 \\\\\n\\Rightarrow & 5 \\alpha+\\beta=90-44=46\n\\end{aligned}$$",
