      "qHtml": "<p>For the function $f(x)=\\mathrm{e}^{\\sin |x|}-|x|, x \\in \\mathbf{R}$, consider the following statements :</p>\n<p><b>Statement I :</b> $ f$ is differentiable for all $x \\in \\mathbf{R}$.</p>\n<p><b>Statement II :</b> $ f$ is increasing in $\\left(-\\pi,-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
