      "qHtml": "<p>Let $f(x) = \\lim\\limits_{\\theta \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\cos \\pi x - x^\\left( \\frac{2}{\\theta} \\right) \\sin(x-1)}{1 + x^\\left( \\frac{2}{\\theta} \\right) (x-1)} \\right),\\ x \\in \\mathbb{R}$. Consider the following two statements :</p><p>(I) $f(x)$ is discontinuous at $x=1$.</p><p>(II) $f(x)$ is continuous at $x = -1$.</p><p>Then,</p>",
