      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $$ \\begin{aligned} &g(x)=|x|\\left[x^2\\right]\\\\ &\\text { Points of discontinuity of } \\mathrm{g}(\\mathrm{x}) \\text { in (-2,2) are }( \\pm 1, \\pm \\sqrt{2}, \\pm \\sqrt{3})\\\\ &\\begin{aligned} & \\therefore S=\\{-1,1,-\\sqrt{2}, \\sqrt{2} \\cdot-\\sqrt{3}, \\sqrt{3}\\} \\\\ & \\because f(x)=\\min \\left\\{\\sqrt{2 x}, x^2\\right\\} \\\\ & \\therefore \\sum_{x \\in S} f(x)=-\\sqrt{2}+1-2+2-\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{6}=1-\\sqrt{2} \\end{aligned} \\end{aligned} $$",
