      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 23rd January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{\\left(2-\\frac{3}{x}+\\frac{5}{x^2}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3 x}\\right)^{x / 2}}{\\left(3+\\frac{5}{x}+\\frac{4}{x^2}\\right)\\left(1+\\frac{2}{3 x}\\right)^{x / 2}} \\\\\n& =\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{e^{\\frac{x}{2}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3 x}-1\\right)}}{e^{\\frac{x}{2}\\left(1+\\frac{2}{3 x}-1\\right)}} \\\\\n& =\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{e^{-\\frac{1}{6}}}{e^{1 / 3}}=\\frac{2}{3} e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
