      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 26th February Morning Shift. Correct option: C. $$|f(x) - f(y)|\\, \\le \\,|{(x - y)^2}|$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\left| {{{f(x) - f(y)} \\over {x - y}}} \\right|\\, \\le \\,|x - y|$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\left| {\\mathop {\\lim }\\limits_{x \\to y} {{f(x) - f(y)} \\over {x - y}}} \\right|\\, \\le \\,|\\mathop {\\lim }\\limits_{x \\to y} (x - y)|$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow |f'(x)|\\, \\le 0$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow f'(x) = 0$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow f(x)$$ is constant function.\n\n$$ \\because $$ $$f(0)$$ = 1 then f(x) = 1",
