      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 1st February Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $\\begin{aligned} & I=\\int_0^1\\left(2 x^3-3 x^2-x+1\\right)^{1 / 3} d x \\\\\\\\ & I=\\int_0^1\\left((2 x-1)\\left(x^2-x-1\\right)\\right)^{1 / 3} d x \\\\\\\\ & I=\\int_0^1\\left[(2(1-x)-1)\\left((1-x)^2-(1-x)-1\\right)\\right]^{1 / 3} d x \\\\\\\\ & I=\\int_0^1\\left((1-2 x)\\left(x^2-x-1\\right)\\right)^{1 / 3} d x\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & I=-\\int_0^1\\left((2 x-1)\\left(x^2-x-1\\right)\\right)^{1 / 3} d x \\\\\\\\ & I=-I \\\\\\\\ & 2 I=0 \\\\\\\\ & I=0\\end{aligned}$",
