      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Morning Shift. Correct option: C. $\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Put } x=2 t \\Rightarrow d x=2 d t \\\\ & I=\\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\ell n 2 t}{4 t^2+4}(2 d t)=\\frac{1}{2} \\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\ell n 2+\\ell n t}{t^2+1} d t \\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2} \\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\ell n 2}{t^2+1} d t+\\frac{1}{2} \\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\ell n t}{t^2+1} d t\\end{aligned}$\n\n= $\\left[\\frac{\\ln 2}{2} \\tan ^{-1} \\mathrm{t}\\right]_0^{\\infty}+\\mathrm{I}_1$\n\n$=\\frac{\\ell \\mathrm{n} 2}{2} \\cdot \\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\mathrm{I}_1$\n\n$\\mathrm{I}_2=\\frac{1}{2} \\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\ell \\mathrm{nt}}{\\mathrm{t}^2+1} \\mathrm{dt}$\n\n$t=\\frac{1}{u} \\Rightarrow d t=-\\frac{d u}{u^2}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & =\\frac{1}{2} \\int_{\\infty}^0 \\frac{\\ell \\mathrm{n}(1 / \\mathrm{u})}{\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{u}^2}+1}\\left(-\\frac{\\mathrm{du}}{\\mathrm{u}^2}\\right) \\\\ & \\operatorname{Add} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{I}_1=0 \\\\ & \\mathrm{I}=\\frac{\\pi \\ell \\mathrm{n} 2}{4}\\end{aligned}$",
