      "a": 2,
      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 8th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $I=\\int\\limits_0^2\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{x\\left(x^2+x+1\\right)}}{(\\sqrt{x+1}) \\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{x^4+x^2+1}\\right)}\\right] d x$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & =\\int_0^2\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{x\\left(x^2+x+1\\right)}}{(\\sqrt{x+1}) \\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{x^4+2 x^2+1-x^2}\\right)}\\right] d x \\\\ & =\\int_0^2\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{x\\left(x^2+x+1\\right)}}{(\\sqrt{x+1}) \\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{\\left(x^2+1\\right)^2-x^2}\\right)}\\right] d x \\\\ & =\\int_0^2\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{x\\left(x^2+x+1\\right)}}{\\left.(\\sqrt{x+1}) \\cdot\\left\\{\\sqrt{\\left(x^2+1+x\\right)\\left(x^2+1-x\\right)}\\right\\}\\right]}\\right] d x \\\\ & =\\int_0^2\\left[\\frac{(\\sqrt{x}) \\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x+1}\\right)}{(\\sqrt{x+1}) \\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+1+x}\\right) \\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+1-x}\\right)}\\right] d x \\\\ & =\\int_0^2\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{(\\sqrt{x+1}) \\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{x^2-x+1}\\right)}\\right] d x \\\\ & =\\int_0^2\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{(x+1)\\left(x^2-x+1\\right)}}\\right] d x \\\\ & =\\int_0^2\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x^3+1}}\\right] d x\\end{aligned}$\n\nLet $x=t^2 \\Rightarrow d x=2 t d t$\n\n$\\boldsymbol{I}=\\int_0^{\\sqrt{2}}\\left[\\frac{2 t^2}{\\sqrt{t^6+1}}\\right] d t=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right) \\int_0^{\\sqrt{2}}\\left[\\frac{3 t^2}{\\sqrt{t^6+1}}\\right] d t$\n\nLet $t^3=u \\Rightarrow 3 t^2 d t=d u$\n\n$\\boldsymbol{I}=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^2 \\cdot \\int_0^{2 \\sqrt{2}}\\left[\\frac{\\boldsymbol{d u}}{\\sqrt{u^2+1}}\\right]$\n\nUsing standard integration formulaes :\n\n$\\int\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}\\right) \\boldsymbol{d x}=\\ln \\left|\\boldsymbol{x}+\\sqrt{\\boldsymbol{x}^2+\\boldsymbol{a}^2}\\right|+C$\n\n= $\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right) \\cdot\\left[\\ln \\left|\\boldsymbol{u}+\\sqrt{\\boldsymbol{u}^2+1}\\right|\\right]_0^{2 \\sqrt{2}}$\n\n$=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right) \\cdot[\\ln (2 \\sqrt{2}+3)-\\ln 1]=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right) \\cdot[\\ln (3+2 \\sqrt{2})]$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 8th April Evening Shift | Area Under Curves | mnsik61b",
