      "qHtml": "<p>Let f : R $$\\to$$ R be a continuous function satisfying f(x) + f(x  + k) = n, for all x $$\\in$$ R where k > 0 and n is a positive integer. If $${I_1} = \\int\\limits_0^{4nk} {f(x)dx} $$ and $${I_2} = \\int\\limits_{ - k}^{3k} {f(x)dx} $$, then :</p>",
