      "q": "The value of the integral $\\int\\limits_0^2 \\frac{\\sqrt{x\\left(x^2+x+1\\right)}}{(\\sqrt{x+1})\\left(\\sqrt{x^4+x^2+1}\\right)} \\mathrm{d} x$ is equal to:",
      "qHtml": "<p>The value of the integral $\\int\\limits_0^2 \\frac{\\sqrt{x\\left(x^2+x+1\\right)}}{(\\sqrt{x+1})\\left(\\sqrt{x^4+x^2+1}\\right)} \\mathrm{d} x$ is equal to:</p>",
