      "q": "Let $y = y(x)$ be the solution of the differential equation $x \\frac{dy}{dx} - y = x^2 \\cot x$, $x \\in (0, \\pi)$. If $y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$, then\n$6y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) - 8y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$ is equal to :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let $y = y(x)$ be the solution of the differential equation $x \\frac{dy}{dx} - y = x^2 \\cot x$, $x \\in (0, \\pi)$. If $y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$, then</p><p>$6y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) - 8y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$ is equal to :</p>",
