      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $f(x)=\\int \\frac{8(2 x+2)+8}{x^2+2 x-15} d x$\n\n$$\\Rightarrow f(x)=8\\ell n\\left|x^2+2x-15\\right|+\\ell n\\left|\\frac{x-3}{x+5}\\right|+C$$\n\n$$\\Rightarrow f(4)=14\\ell n3+C$$\n\n$$\\Rightarrow 14\\ell n3=14\\ell n3+C$$\n\n$$\\therefore C=0$$\n\nNow, $$f(7)=8\\ell n48-\\ell n3$$\n\n$$=\\ell n\\left(\\frac{(48)^8}{3}\\right)$$\n\n$$\\Rightarrow f(7)=\\ell n(2^{32}\\times 3^7)$$\n\n$$\\alpha=32,\\ \\beta=7\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\alpha+\\beta=39$$",
