      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 31st January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{R}=\\frac{\\rho \\mathrm{L}}{\\pi \\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2}{4}} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{R}}{\\mathrm{R}}=\\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{L}}{\\mathrm{L}}+\\frac{2 \\Delta \\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{L}}{\\mathrm{L}}=0.1 \\% \\text { and } \\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}}=0.1 \\% \\\\\n& \\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{R}}{\\mathrm{R}}=0.3 \\%\n\\end{aligned}$$",
