      "q": "Match List - I with List - II .\n\nList I (Number)\nList II (Significant figure)\n\n(A) 1001\n(I) 3\n\n(B) 010.1\n(II) 4\n\n(C) 100.100\n(III) 5\n\n(D) 0.0010010\n(IV) 6\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "Match <b>List - I</b> with <b>List - II</b>.\n<br><br><table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>List I (Number)</th>\n    <th>List II (Significant figure)</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(A) 1001</td>\n    <td>(I) 3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(B) 010.1</td>\n    <td>(II) 4</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(C) 100.100</td>\n    <td>(III) 5</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(D) 0.0010010</td>\n    <td>(IV) 6</td>\n  </tr>\n</table><br>\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
