      "q": "A quantity Q is formulated as $X^{-2}Y^{+\\frac{3}{2}}Z^{-\\frac{2}{5}}$. X, Y, and Z are independent parameters which have fractional errors of 0.1, 0.2, and 0.5, respectively in measurement. The maximum fractional error of Q is",
      "qHtml": "<p>A quantity Q is formulated as $X^{-2}Y^{+\\frac{3}{2}}Z^{-\\frac{2}{5}}$. X, Y, and Z are independent parameters which have fractional errors of 0.1, 0.2, and 0.5, respectively in measurement. The maximum fractional error of Q is</p>",
