      "q": "Match List I with List II.\n\nList - I\n\nList - II\n\n(A)\nCoefficient of viscosity\n(I)\n$\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^0 \\mathrm{~T}^{-3}\\right]$\n\n(B)\nIntensity of wave\n(II)\n$\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{-2} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2}\\right]$\n\n(C)\nPressure gradient\n(III)\n$\\left[\\mathrm{M}^{-1} \\mathrm{LT}^2\\right]$\n\n(D)\nCompressibility\n(IV)\n$\\left[\\mathrm{ML}^{-1} \\mathrm{~T}^{-1}\\right]$\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:",
