      "q": "The position of a particle moving on $x$-axis is given by $x(t)=A \\sin t+B \\cos ^2 t+C t^2+D$, where $t$ is time. The dimension of $\\frac{A B C}{D}$ is",
      "qHtml": "<p>The position of a particle moving on $x$-axis is given by $x(t)=A \\sin t+B \\cos ^2 t+C t^2+D$, where $t$ is time. The dimension of $\\frac{A B C}{D}$ is</p>",
