      "q": "The velocity $(v)$ - Distance $(x)$ graph is shown in figure. Which graph represents acceleration(a) versus distance ( $x$ ) variation of this system?\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 5 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>The velocity $(v)$ - Distance $(x)$ graph is shown in figure. Which graph represents acceleration(a) versus distance ( $x$ ) variation of this system?</p>\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml99jro5/e344d242-35f6-48c7-9816-87c4f82c8990/584fb050-0276-11f1-bf92-8d689bc79bfa/file-6y3zli1ml99jro6.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 5 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
