        "<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml99nh22/0e7a09d9-d387-41aa-b26f-85260aa3e32d/bf598eb0-0276-11f1-bf92-8d689bc79bfa/file-6y3zli1ml99nh23.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 5 English Option 3\" loading=\"lazy\">",
