      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 24th February Morning Shift. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2021 (Online) 24th February Morning Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 87 English Explanation 1]\n\nFrom the graph for first line, the slope is negative and intercept is positive.\n\nSo, equation of line is\n\n$$v = - mt + c$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {a_1} = {{dv} \\over {dt}} = - m$$\n\nSimilarly, for second line, the slope is positive and intercept is negative, so equation of line is\n\n$$v = mt - c$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {a_2} = {{dv} \\over {dt}} = m$$\n\n$$\\therefore$$ The corresponding acceleration-time graph as shown below\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2021 (Online) 24th February Morning Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 87 English Explanation 2]\n\nHence, option (a) is correct.",
