      "q": "A helicopter flying horizontally with a speed of 360 km/h at an altitude of 2 km, drops an object at an instant. The object hits the ground at a point O, 20 s after it is dropped. Displacement of 'O' from the position of helicopter where the object was released is :\n(use acceleration due to gravity g = 10 m/s 2 and neglect air resistance)",
      "qHtml": "<p>A helicopter flying horizontally with a speed of 360 km/h at an altitude of 2 km, drops an object at an instant. The object hits the ground at a point O, 20 s after it is dropped. Displacement of 'O' from the position of helicopter where the object was released is :</p> <p>(use acceleration due to gravity g = 10 m/s<sup>2</sup> and neglect air resistance)</p>",
