      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{H}_{\\mathrm{Max}}=\\frac{(\\mathrm{usin} \\theta)^2}{2 \\mathrm{~g}} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{\\max }\\right)_1}{\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{\\max }\\right)_2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{u}^2 \\sin ^2(45-\\alpha)}{\\mathrm{u}^2 \\sin ^2(45+\\alpha)} \\\\\n& =\\frac{\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\cos \\alpha-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\sin \\alpha\\right)^2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\cos \\alpha+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\sin \\alpha\\right)^2} \\\\\n& =\\frac{1-\\sin 2 \\alpha}{1+\\sin 2 \\alpha}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
