      "a": 0,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift. Correct option: A. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}}=5 \\mathrm{t}^2 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}-5 \\hat{\\mathrm{t}} \\\\\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}=10 \\mathrm{t} \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}-5 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}} \\\\\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}=20 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}-5 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}} \\quad \\text { at } \\mathrm{t}=2 \\mathrm{sec}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Plane Question 15 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\tan \\theta=\\frac{20}{5}=4 \\\\\n& \\theta=\\tan ^{-1} 4 \\\\\n& \\text { From-veY-axis }\n\\end{aligned}$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift | Motion in Two Dimensions | m6v42g89",
      "pyq": true,
