      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Evening Shift. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Plane Question 17 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{k}_{\\mathrm{i}}=\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{mv}^2 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{k}_{\\mathrm{f}}=\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~m}\\left(\\mathrm{v} \\cos 60^{\\circ}\\right)^2=\\frac{1}{8} \\mathrm{mv}^2 \\\\\n& \\Delta \\mathrm{k}=\\mathrm{k}_{\\mathrm{i}}-\\mathrm{k}_{\\mathrm{f}}=\\frac{3}{8} \\mathrm{mv}^2=\\frac{3}{8} \\times 0.1 \\times 400=15 \\mathrm{~J}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Evening Shift | Motion in Two Dimensions | m6rp5uq3",
