      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. For vertical throw,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& h=\\frac{v^{2}}{2 g} \\\\\\\\\n& v=\\sqrt{2 g h}=\\sqrt{2 g \\times 136} \\quad...(1)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor max range, $\\theta=45^{\\circ}$\n\n$R_{\\max }=\\frac{v^{2}}{g} \\quad...(2)$\n\nFrom (1) and (2)\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\max } & =\\frac{v^{2}}{g}=\\frac{2 g \\times 136}{g} \\\\\\\\\n& =272 \\mathrm{~m}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift | Motion in Two Dimensions | 1ldye79sy",
