      "q": "The velocity time graph of a body moving in a straight line is shown in the figure.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2023 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 42 English]\n\nThe ratio of displacement to distance travelled by the body in time 0 to 10s is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>The velocity time graph of a body moving in a straight line is shown in the figure.</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lesvstw5/3c8e1940-d40f-474a-bf3c-d2d478ef0494/f4328850-b9f2-11ed-89b5-a150a08c777c/file-1lesvstw6.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift Physics - Motion in a Straight Line Question 42 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>The ratio of displacement to distance travelled by the body in time 0 to 10s is :</p>",
