      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 25th July Morning Shift. Correct option: C. In 4 sec. 1 st drop will travel\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {1 \\over 2}$$ $$\\times$$ (9.8) $$\\times$$ (4) 2 = 78.4 m\n\n$$\\therefore$$ 2 nd drop would have travelled\n\n$$\\Rightarrow$$ 78.4 $$-$$ 34.3 = 44.1 m.\n\nTime for 2 nd drop\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {1 \\over 2}$$(9.8)t 2 = 44.1\n\nt = 3 sec\n\n$$\\therefore$$ each drop have time gap of 1 sec\n\n$$\\therefore$$ 1 drop per sec",
