      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift Physics - Laws of Motion Question 16 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& m g \\sin 60^{\\circ}-\\mu m g \\cos 60^{\\circ}=m a \\\\\n& g \\sin 60-\\mu g \\cos 60=\\frac{g}{2} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}-\\frac{\\mu}{2}=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\\n& \\mu=\\sqrt{3}-1\n\\end{aligned}$$",
