      "qHtml": "<p>Figures (a), (b), (c) and (d) show variation of force with time.</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1ldodevx5/697d42ac-e581-4144-a577-2c890a64d1d1/b22297a0-a3ab-11ed-bed3-417993225459/file-1ldodevx6.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 1st February Evening Shift Physics - Laws of Motion Question 58 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>The impulse is highest in figure.</p>",
