      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 31st January Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $a=-\\mu g$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\because v=u+a t \\\\\\\\\n& 0=20+(-\\mu \\times 10) \\times 5 \\\\\\\\\n& 50 \\mu=20 \\\\\\\\\n& \\mu=\\frac{2}{5}=0.4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
