      "qHtml": "A block of $\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~kg}$ is attached to a string whose other end is attached to the wall. An unknown force $\\mathrm{F}$ is applied so that the string makes an angle of $30^{\\circ}$ with the wall. The tension $\\mathrm{T}$ is:\n(Given $\\mathrm{g}=10 \\mathrm{~ms}^{-2}$ )<br><br>\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1ldqydxm8/9459b9ba-83cf-4b5e-b0bc-46470dfbd13c/48a5a700-a517-11ed-868c-9b3df14ba4de/file-1ldqydxm9.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 30th January Evening Shift Physics - Laws of Motion Question 54 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
