      "a": 2,
      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 29th January Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $$m = 20$$ kg\n\n$$t = 20$$ sec.\n\nAcceleration $$ = {F \\over {20}}$$ m/s$$^2$$\n\n$$\\therefore$$ $$v = u + at$$\n\n$$v = 0 + \\left( {{F \\over {20}}} \\right)(20)$$\n\n$$ = F$$ ms$$^{-1}$$\n\nNow for next 10 sec.\n\n$$S=ut$$\n\n$$50=F(10)$$\n\n$$F=5$$",
