      "qHtml": "Two masses m<sub>1</sub> = 5 kg and m<sub>2</sub> = 10 kg, connected by an inextensible\nstring over a frictionless pulley, are moving as shown in the figure. The\ncoefficient of friction of horizontal surface is 0.15. The minimum\nweight m that should be put on top of m<sub>2</sub> to stop the motion is : \n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://gateclass.static.cdn.examgoal.net/QnesxWEJnmYijVnQK/eCK8N08Mme9lQl9W1twbQNO9fdQ5g/cLWLtQMyXwjU7k70O7FH4K/uploadfile.jpg\" alt=\"JEE Main 2018 (Offline) Physics - Laws of Motion Question 129 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
