      "q": "A spherical ball of mass 2 kg falls from a height of 10 m and is brought to rest after penetrating 10 cm into sand.\n\nThe average force exerted by sand on the ball is _________ N.\n\n(Take $g = 10 \\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}$)",
      "qHtml": "<p>A spherical ball of mass 2 kg falls from a height of 10 m and is brought to rest after penetrating 10 cm into sand.<br><br> The average force exerted by sand on the ball is _________ N.<br><br>(Take $g = 10 \\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}$)</p>",
