      "qHtml": "A body of mass $4 \\mathrm{~kg}$ experiences two forces $\\vec{F}_1=5 \\hat{i}+8 \\hat{j}+7 \\hat{k}$ and $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{F}}_2=3 \\hat{i}-4 \\hat{j}-3 \\hat{k}$. The acceleration acting on the body is :",
