      "qHtml": "The position vector of a particle related to time $t$ is given by\n<br><br>\n$\\vec{r}=\\left(10 t \\hat{i}+15 t^{2} \\hat{j}+7 \\hat{k}\\right) m$\n<br><br>\nThe direction of net force experienced by the particle is :",
