      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th January Morning Slot. Correct option: A. [Diagram: JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th January Morning Slot Physics - Laws of Motion Question 123 English Explanation]\n\nAt equilibrium,\n\nN = mgcos45 o . . . . . . (1)\n\n3 + mgsin45 o = P + $$\\mu $$N\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 3 + $${{mg} \\over {\\sqrt 2 }}$$ = P + 0.6 $$\\left( {{{mg} \\over {\\sqrt 2 }}} \\right)$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 3 + $${{100} \\over {\\sqrt 2 }}$$ = P + 0.6 $$ \\times $$ $${{100} \\over {\\sqrt 2 }}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ P = 3 + $${{40} \\over {\\sqrt 2 }}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ P = 3 + 20 $${\\sqrt 2 }$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ P = 31.28 $$ \\simeq $$ 32 N",
