      "q": "A solid sphere of mass 5 kg and radius 10 cm is kept in contact with another solid sphere of mass 10 kg and radius 20 cm . The moment of inertia of this pair of spheres about the tangent passing through the point of contact is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ $\\mathrm{kg} \\cdot \\mathrm{m}^2$.",
      "qHtml": "<p>A solid sphere of mass 5 kg and radius 10 cm is kept in contact with another solid sphere of mass 10 kg and radius 20 cm . The moment of inertia of this pair of spheres about the tangent passing through the point of contact is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ $\\mathrm{kg} \\cdot \\mathrm{m}^2$.</p>",
