      "qHtml": "<p>A uniform rod of mass $m$ and length $l$ suspended by means of two identical inextensible light strings as shown in figure. Tension in one string immediately after the other string is cut, is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ . $(g$ acceleration due to gravity)</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mm4mw6n1/31404005-4ee9-4184-b694-cbeb1520c124/d46524d0-13b6-11f1-865a-8bf6aebc55a0/file-6y3zli1mm4mw6n2.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Morning Shift Physics - Rotational Motion Question 19 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
