      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift. Correct option: A. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift Physics - Rotational Motion Question 37 English Explanation 1]\n\n$$\\alpha=\\frac{\\mathrm{M} \\ell^2}{12}\\quad\\text{..... (1)}$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift Physics - Rotational Motion Question 37 English Explanation 2]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\begin{aligned}\n& \\alpha^{\\prime}=2\\left[\\frac{\\frac{\\mathrm{M}}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\ell}{2}\\right)^2}{12}\\right] \\\\\n& \\alpha^{\\prime}=\\frac{\\mathrm{M} \\ell^2}{48}=\\frac{\\alpha}{4}\n\\end{aligned}\\\\\n&\\text { Correct option is (2) }\n\\end{aligned}$$",
