      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th April Morning Slot. Correct option: B. $$T = \\int\\limits_{x = x}^{x = \\ell } {dm{\\omega ^2}} x = \\int\\limits_{x = x}^{x = \\ell } {{m \\over \\ell }} dx{\\omega ^2}x\\,T$$\n\n$$ = {{m{\\omega ^2}} \\over {2\\ell }}\\left( {{\\ell ^2} - {x^2}} \\right)$$\n\n$$ \\therefore T = {{m{\\omega ^2}} \\over {2\\ell }}\\left( {{\\ell ^2} - {x^2}} \\right)$$",
