      "qHtml": "<p>Three masses $200 \\mathrm{~kg}, 300 \\mathrm{~kg}$ and 400 kg are placed at the vertices of an equilateral triangle with sides 20 m . They are rearranged on the vertices of a bigger triangle of side 25 m and with the same centre. The work done in this process $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ J. (Gravitational constant $\\mathrm{G}=6.7 \\times 10^{-11} \\mathrm{~N} \\mathrm{~m}^2 / \\mathrm{kg}^2$ )</p>",
