      "q": "The escape velocity from a spherical planet $A$ is $10 \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{s}$. The escape velocity from another planet $B$ whose density and radius are $10 \\%$ of those of planet $A$, is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ $\\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}$.",
      "qHtml": "<p>The escape velocity from a spherical planet $A$ is $10 \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{s}$. The escape velocity from another planet $B$ whose density and radius are $10 \\%$ of those of planet $A$, is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ $\\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}$.</p>",
