      "qHtml": "<p>An object is kept at rest at a distance of $3 R$ above the earth's surface where $R$ is earth's radius. The minimum speed with which it must be projected so that it does not return to earth is :\n(Assume $\\mathrm{M}=$ mass of earth, $\\mathrm{G}=$ Universal gravitational constant)</p>",
