      "q": "The Young's modulus of steel wire of radius $r$ and length $L$ is $Y$.\n\nIf the radius $r$ and length $L$ of the wire are doubled then the value of $Y$",
      "qHtml": "<p>The Young's modulus of steel wire of radius $r$ and length $L$ is $Y$.</p>\n<p>If the radius $r$ and length $L$ of the wire are doubled then the value of $Y$</p>",
