      "qHtml": "<p>A string $A$ of length 0.314 m and Young's modulus $2 \\times 10^{10} \\mathrm{~N} / \\mathrm{m}^2$ is connected to another string $B$ of length and Young's modulus both twice of those of $A$. This series combination of strings is then suspended from a rigid support and its free end is fixed to a load of mass 0.8 kg . The net change in length of the combination is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ mm.</p>\n<p>(radius of both the strings is 0.2 mm and acceleration due to gravity $=10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$ ) (Mass of both strings is to be neglected as compared to the mass of load)</p>",
