      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot Physics - Properties of Matter Question 274 English Explanation]\n\n$${F \\over A} = y.{{\\Delta \\ell } \\over \\ell }$$\n\n$$\\Delta \\ell \\propto F$$ . . .. (i)\n\nT $$=$$ mg\n\nT $$=$$ mg $$-$$ f B $$=$$ mg $$-$$ $${m \\over {{\\rho _b}}}.{\\rho _\\ell }.$$g\n\n$$ = \\left( {1 - {{{\\rho _\\ell }} \\over {{\\rho _b}}}} \\right)$$ mg\n\n$$ = \\left( {1 - {2 \\over 8}} \\right)$$ mg\n\nT' $$=$$ $${3 \\over 4}$$ mg\n\nFrom (i)\n\n$${{\\Delta \\ell '} \\over {\\Delta \\ell }} = {{T'} \\over T} = {3 \\over 4}$$\n\n$$\\Delta \\ell ' = {3 \\over 4}.\\Delta \\ell = 3$$ mm",
