      "qHtml": "<p>The increase in the pressure required to decrease the volume ( $\\Delta V$ ) of water is $6.3 \\times 10^7 \\mathrm{~N} / \\mathrm{m}^2$. The percentage decrease in the volume is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .</p>\n<p>(Bulk modulus of water $=2.1 \\times 10^9 \\mathrm{~N} / \\mathrm{m}^2$.)</p>",
