      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: A. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Properties of Matter Question 42 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Shear moduli }=\\frac{\\sigma_{\\text {shear }}}{\\theta} \\\\\n& 10^{10}=\\frac{10^5}{\\pi \\times 16 \\times 10^{-4}} \\times \\frac{1}{\\theta} \\\\\n& \\theta=\\frac{1}{160 \\pi} \\text { Radian }\n\\end{aligned}$$",
