      "q": "Given below are two statements:\n\nStatement I: The hot water flows faster than cold water\n\nStatement II: Soap water has higher surface tension as compared to fresh water.\nIn the light above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p>\n<p>Statement I: The hot water flows faster than cold water</p>\n<p>Statement II: Soap water has higher surface tension as compared to fresh water.\nIn the light above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
