      "qHtml": "If the terminal speed of a sphere of gold (density $$ = 19.5\\,\\,kg/{m^3}$$) is $$0.2$$ $$m/s$$ in a viscous liquid (density $$ = 1.5\\,\\,kg/{m^3}$$, find the terminal speed of a sphere of silver (density $$ = 10.5\\,\\,kg/{m^3}$$) of the same size in the same liquid",
