      "qHtml": "<p>A water spray gun is attached to a hose of cross sectional area $30 \\mathrm{~cm}^2$. The gun comprises of 10 perforations each of cross sectional area of $15 \\mathrm{~mm}^2$. If the water flows in the hose with the speed of $50 \\mathrm{~cm} / \\mathrm{s}$, calculate the speed at which the water flows out from each perforation. (Neglect any edge effects)</p>",
