      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 31st January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 31st January Morning Shift Physics - Properties of Matter Question 99 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{mg}-\\mathrm{F}_{\\mathrm{B}}-\\mathrm{F}_{\\mathrm{v}}=\\mathrm{ma} \\\\\n& \\left(\\rho \\frac{4}{3} \\pi \\mathrm{r}^3\\right) g-\\left(\\rho_{\\mathrm{L}} \\frac{4}{3} \\pi \\mathrm{r}^3\\right) g-6 \\pi \\eta r v=m \\frac{d v}{d t}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nLet $$\\frac{4}{3 m} \\pi R^3 g\\left(\\rho-\\rho_L\\right)=K_1$$ and $$\\frac{6 \\pi \\eta r}{m}=K_2$$\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{dv}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\mathrm{K}_1-\\mathrm{K}_2 \\mathrm{~V}$$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\int_\\limits0^v \\frac{d v}{K_1-K_2 v}=\\int_\\limits0^t d t \\\\\n& -\\frac{1}{K_2} \\ln \\left[K_1-K_2 v\\right]_0^v=t \\\\\n& \\ell n\\left(\\frac{K_1-K_2 v}{K_1}\\right)=-K_2 t \\\\\n& K_1-K_2 v=K_1 e^{-K_2 t} \\\\\n& v=\\frac{K_1}{K_2}\\left[1-e^{-K_2 t}\\right]\n\\end{aligned}$$",
