      "q": "Water falls from a height of 200 m into a pool. Calculate the rise in temperature of the water assuming no heat dissipation from the water in the pool.\n(Take g = 10 m/s 2 , specific heat of water = 4200 J/(kg K))",
      "qHtml": "<p>Water falls from a height of 200 m into a pool. Calculate the rise in temperature of the water assuming no heat dissipation from the water in the pool.</p><p>(Take <em>g</em> = 10 m/s<sup>2</sup>, specific heat of water = 4200 J/(kg K))</p>",
