      "q": "A mixture of carbon dioxide and oxygen has volume 8310 cm 3 , temperature 300 K, pressure 100 kPa and mass 13.2 g. The number of moles of carbon dioxide and oxygen gases in the mixture respectively are ______.\n(Assume both carbon dioxide and oxygen gases behave like ideal gases) [R = 8.31 J/mol K]",
      "qHtml": "<p>A mixture of carbon dioxide and oxygen has volume 8310 cm<sup>3</sup>, temperature 300 K, pressure 100 kPa and mass 13.2 g. The number of moles of carbon dioxide and oxygen gases in the mixture respectively are ______.</p><p>(Assume both carbon dioxide and oxygen gases behave like ideal gases) [R = 8.31 J/mol K]</p>",
