      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 43 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\text { Number of masses will remain constant }\\\\\n&\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{n}_1+\\mathrm{n}_2=\\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{f}} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{P}_1 \\mathrm{~V}_1}{\\mathrm{RT}_1}+\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_2 \\mathrm{~V}_2}{\\mathrm{RT}_2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}} \\mathrm{~V}_{\\mathrm{f}}}{\\mathrm{RT}_{\\mathrm{f}}} \\\\\n& \\frac{8 \\times 2 \\mathrm{~V}}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 1000}+\\frac{7 \\times \\mathrm{V}}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 500}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}(3 \\mathrm{~V})}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 600} \\\\\n& \\frac{16}{1000}+\\frac{14}{1000}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 600} \\\\\n& \\frac{30}{1000}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}}{200} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}=6 \\mathrm{kPa}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
