      "q": "Consider the sound wave travelling in ideal gases of $\\mathrm{He}, \\mathrm{CH}_4$, and $\\mathrm{CO}_2$. All the gases have the same ratio $\\frac{P}{\\rho}$, where $P$ is the pressure and $\\rho$ is the density. The ratio of the speed of sound through the gases $\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{He}}: \\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{CH}_4}: \\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{CO}_2}$ is given by",
      "qHtml": "<p>Consider the sound wave travelling in ideal gases of $\\mathrm{He}, \\mathrm{CH}_4$, and $\\mathrm{CO}_2$. All the gases have the same ratio $\\frac{P}{\\rho}$, where $P$ is the pressure and $\\rho$ is the density. The ratio of the speed of sound through the gases $\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{He}}: \\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{CH}_4}: \\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{CO}_2}$ is given by</p>",
