      "qHtml": "<p>P-T diagram of an ideal gas having three different densities $$\\rho_1, \\rho_2, \\rho_3$$ (in three different cases) is shown in the figure. Which of the following is correct :</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lv0c9ybo/2046aa5a-f490-422f-b144-66f8e3b19492/550cfc40-fad0-11ee-891c-2b72d88c1441/file-1lv0c9ybp.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 103 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
