      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift. Correct option: A. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& P M=\\rho R T \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{P}{T}=\\left(\\frac{R}{m}\\right) \\rho=\\text { slope }\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSo from given curve, $$\\rho_1>\\rho_2>\\rho_3$$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift | Kinetic Theory of Gases | lv0vyue8",
