      "qHtml": "A solid body of constant heat capacity $$1$$ $$J/{}^ \\circ C$$ is being heated by keeping it in contact with reservoirs in two ways:\n<br>$$(i)$$  Sequentially keeping in contact with $$2$$ reservoirs such that each reservoir \n<br>$$\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$$supplies same amount of heat. \n<br>$$(ii)$$ Sequentially keeping in contact with $$8$$ reservoirs such that each reservoir \n<br>$$\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$$supplies same amount of heat. \n<br>In both the cases body is brought from initial temperature $${100^ \\circ }C$$ to final temperature $${200^ \\circ }C$$. Entropy change of the body in the two cases respectively is :",
