      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 3rd April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 3rd April Evening Shift Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 39 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\omega_1=\\mathrm{P}_0 \\mathrm{v}_0 \\ell \\mathrm{n} 4 \\\\\n& \\omega_2=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_0}{4}\\left(-3 \\mathrm{v}_0\\right)=-\\frac{3 \\mathrm{P}_0 \\mathrm{v}_0}{4} \\\\\n& \\omega_3=0 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Q}_{\\mathrm{T}}=\\Delta \\mathrm{U}_{\\text {cyclic }}+\\omega \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Q}_{\\mathrm{T}}=\\omega \\quad\\left(\\Delta \\mathrm{U}_{\\text {cyclic }}=0\\right) \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Q}_{\\mathrm{T}}=\\mathrm{P}_0 \\mathrm{v}_0\\left(\\ln 4-\\frac{3}{4}\\right) \\\\\n& =\\mathrm{P}_0 \\mathrm{v}_0(2 \\ln 2-0.75)\n\\end{aligned}$$",
