      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 3rd April Morning Shift. Correct option: B. Using WET\n\nTotal energy supplied $=$ gravitational potential energy + spring potential energy + work done by gas\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{Mg}\\left(\\mathrm{~L}_1-\\mathrm{L}_0\\right)+\\int_{\\mathrm{L}_0}^{\\mathrm{L}_1} \\mathrm{kx}^3 \\mathrm{dx}+\\mathrm{nRT} \\ell \\mathrm{n} \\\\\n& {\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{~L}_1 \\mathrm{~A}}{\\mathrm{~L}_0 \\mathrm{~A}}\\right]+\\mathrm{W}_{\\text {ext }}=0} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{~K}}{4}\\left[\\mathrm{x}^4\\right]_{\\mathrm{L}_0}^{\\mathrm{L}_1}+\\mathrm{Mg}\\left(\\mathrm{~L}_1-\\mathrm{L}_0\\right)+\\int_{\\mathrm{L}_0}^{\\mathrm{L}_1} k x^3 \\mathrm{dx}+\\mathrm{nRT} \\ell \\mathrm{n} \\\\\n& {\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{~L}_1}{\\mathrm{~L}_0}\\right]+\\mathrm{W}_{\\text {ext }}=0} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{k}}{4}\\left(\\mathrm{~L}_1^4-\\mathrm{L}_0^4\\right)+\\mathrm{Mg}\\left(\\mathrm{~L}_1-\\mathrm{L}_0\\right)+\\mathrm{nRT} \\ell \\mathrm{n} \\\\\n& {\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{~L}_1}{\\mathrm{~L}_0}\\right]+\\mathrm{W}_{\\text {ext }}=0} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~W}_{\\text {ext }}=\\frac{\\mathrm{k}}{4}\\left(\\mathrm{~L}_1^4-\\mathrm{L}_0^4\\right)+\\mathrm{Mg}\\left(\\mathrm{~L}_1-\\mathrm{L}_0\\right)+\\mathrm{nRT} \\ell \\mathrm{n}\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{~L}_1}{\\mathrm{~L}_0}\\right]\n\\end{aligned}$$",
