      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 31st January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. Let $\\gamma$ be the ratio of $\\frac{C_{p}}{C_{v}}$\n\nThen for adiabatic process\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& P V^{\\gamma}=\\text { Constant } \\\\\\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{P_{i}}{P_{f}}=\\left(\\frac{V_{f}}{V_{i}}\\right)^{\\gamma} \\\\\\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{81}{16}=\\left(\\frac{27}{8}\\right)^{\\gamma} \\\\\\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\gamma=\\frac{4}{3}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
