      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 30th January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. Isothermal process $$\\Delta T=0$$\n\n$$\\Delta U=\\frac{f}{2}nR\\Delta T$$\n\n$$\\Delta U=0$$\n\nNo change in internal energy\n\n$$\\Delta Q=\\Delta W$$ (1$$^{st}$$ law)\n\n$$\\Delta Q=+\\mathrm{ve}$$\n\n$$\\Delta W=+\\mathrm{ve}$$",
