      "q": "One mole of an ideal gas is taken through an adiabatic process where the temperature rises from 27$$^\\circ$$ C to 37$$^\\circ$$ C. If the ideal gas is composed of polyatomic molecule that has 4 vibrational modes, which of the following is true? [R = 8.314 J mol $$-$$1 k $$-$$1 ]",
      "qHtml": "One mole of an ideal gas is taken through an adiabatic process where the temperature rises from 27$$^\\circ$$ C to 37$$^\\circ$$ C. If the ideal gas is composed of polyatomic molecule that has 4 vibrational modes, which of the following is true? [R = 8.314 J mol<sup>$$-$$1</sup> k<sup>$$-$$1</sup>]",
