      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 27th July Morning Shift. Correct option: B. Work done in adiabatic process = $${{ - nR} \\over {\\gamma - 1}}({T_f} - {T_i})$$\n\n$$\\therefore$$ $${W_{AD}} = {{ - nR} \\over {\\gamma - 1}}({T_2} - {T_1})$$\n\nand $${W_{BC}} = {{ - nR} \\over {\\gamma - 1}}({T_2} - {T_1})$$\n\n$$\\therefore$$ $${W_{AD}} = {W_{BC}}$$",
