      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 10th January Morning Slot. Correct option: D. $${t_1} = 1 - {{{T_2}} \\over {{T_1}}} = 1 - {{{T_2}} \\over {{T_2}}} = 1 - {{{T_4}} \\over {{T_3}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\,\\,\\,{{{T_2}} \\over {{T_1}}} = {{{T_3}} \\over {{T_4}}} = {{{T_4}} \\over {{T_3}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\,\\,\\,{T_2} = \\sqrt {{T_1}{T_3}} = \\sqrt {{T_1}\\sqrt {{T_2}{T_4}} } $$\n\n$${T_3} = \\sqrt {{T_2}{T_4}} $$\n\n$$T_2^{3/4} = \\sqrt {T_1^{1/2}} T_4^{1/4}$$\n\n$${T_2} = T_1^{2/3}T_4^{1/3}$$",
