      "a": 2,
      "s": "JEE Main 2018 (Online) 15th April Morning Slot. Correct option: C. We know,\n\nWork done on gas = nRT $$\\ell $$n $$\\left( {{{{P_f}} \\over {{P_i}}}} \\right)$$\n\nGiven P f = 2P i\n\nT = 27 + 273 = 300 K\n\nand for monoatomic gas, n = 1.\n\n$$\\therefore\\,\\,\\,\\,$$ Work done = 1 $$ \\times $$R $$ \\times $$300 $$\\ell $$n(2)\n\n= 300 R $$\\ell $$n(2)",
      "source": "JEE Main 2018 (Online) 15th April Morning Slot | Thermodynamics | eAHGMSeknk5s3DfFL7Ptq",
