      "qHtml": "Two moles of helium gas are taken over the cycle $$ABCD,$$ as shown in the $$P$$-$$T$$ diagram.\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/OCCqNsnBb6k2TwPFf/mQhrDIhyXBnQsHTFlLVUBSCT93Otu/j3qP3Oow0WPqFIuDe9WRhV/image.png\" alt=\"AIEEE 2009 Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 435 English\" loading=\"lazy\"> \n<p>The work done on the gas in taking it from $$D$$ to $$A$$ is :</p>",
