      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& x=x_0 \\sin ^2 \\frac{t}{2}=x_0\\left(\\frac{1-\\cos t}{2}\\right) \\\\\n& x-\\frac{x_0}{2}=\\frac{-\\cos t}{2} \\\\\n& \\text { where } x_0=1 \\\\\n& x-\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{-\\cos t}{2}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nParticle is oscillating between $\\mathrm{x}=0$ to $\\mathrm{x}=1$",
