      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 26th February Evening Shift. Correct option: B. As we know time period of second’s penduklum is 2 sec, so statement (1) is incorrect.\n\nTime taken by particle performing SHM between two\nextreme position is half of the time period.\n\nHere, T = 2 sec.\n\nSo, time = 2/2 = 1 sec",
      "source": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 26th February Evening Shift | Oscillations | fRNuoiDVSnesqdH7At1klunj0s9",
      "pyq": true,
      "exactPaperText": true,
