      "qHtml": "A cylindrical plastic bottle of negligible mass is filled with 310 ml of water and left floating in a pond with still water. If pressed downward slightly and released, it starts performing simple harmonic motion at angular frequency $$\\omega $$. If the radius of the bottle is 2.5 cm then $$\\omega $$ is close to – (density of water = 10<sup>3</sup> kg/m<sup>3</sup>).",
