      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 10th January Evening Slot. Correct option: B. For closed organ pipe, resonate frequency is odd multiple of fundamental frequency.\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ (2n + 1) f 0 $$ \\le $$ 20,000\n\n(f 0 is fundamental frequency = 1.5 KHz)\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ n = 6\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ Total number of overtone that can be heared is 7. (0 to 6)",
