      "s": "JEE Main 2017 (Offline). Correct option: A. For a particle executing SHM\n\nAt mean position; t = 0, $$\\omega $$t = 0, y = 0, V = V max = a$$\\omega $$\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ K.E = K.E max = $${1 \\over 2}m{\\omega ^2}{a^2}$$\n\nAt extreme position : t =\n$${T \\over 4}$$\n, $$\\omega $$t =\n$${\\pi \\over 2}$$\n, y = A, V = V min = 0\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ K.E = K.E min = 0\n\nHence graph (A) correctly represents kinetic energy - time graph.",
