      "q": "Two sources of sound S 1 and S 2 produce sound waves of same frequency 660 Hz. A listener is moving from\nsource S 1 towards S 2 with a constant speed u m/s and he hears 10 beats/s. The velocity of sound is 330 m/s.\nThen, u equals :",
      "qHtml": "Two sources of sound S<sub>1</sub> and S<sub>2</sub> produce sound waves of same frequency 660 Hz. A listener is moving from\nsource S<sub>1</sub> towards S<sub>2</sub> with a constant speed u m/s and he hears 10 beats/s. The velocity of sound is 330 m/s.\nThen, u equals :",
