      "q": "Two point charges $2 q$ and $q$ are placed at vertex $A$ and centre of face $C D E F$ of the cube as shown in figure. The electric flux passing through the cube is:\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 17 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>Two point charges $2 q$ and $q$ are placed at vertex $A$ and centre of face $C D E F$ of the cube as shown in figure. The electric flux passing through the cube is:</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml8vpwww/f87f6a03-afb8-4a48-8987-9908e54b3525/43687e00-0240-11f1-88dd-c7214e4b90e3/file-6y3zli1ml8vpwwx.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 17 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
