      "qHtml": "<p>A point charge of $10^{-8} \\mathrm{C}$ is placed at origin. The work done in moving a point charge $2 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ from point $A(4,4,2) \\mathrm{m}$ to $B(2,2,1) \\mathrm{m}$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ J. $\\left(\\frac{1}{4 \\pi \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{o}}}=9 \\times 10^9\\right.$ in SI units)</p>",
