      "q": "Consider a parallel plate capacitor of area A (of each plate) and separation ' $d$ ' between the plates. If $E$ is the electric field and $\\varepsilon_0$ is the permittivity of free space between the plates, then potential energy stored in the capacitor is",
      "qHtml": "<p>Consider a parallel plate capacitor of area A (of each plate) and separation ' $d$ ' between the plates. If $E$ is the electric field and $\\varepsilon_0$ is the permittivity of free space between the plates, then potential energy stored in the capacitor is</p>",
