      "q": "A parallel plate capacitor has capacitance $C$, when there is vacuum within the parallel plates. A sheet having thickness $\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^{\\mathrm{rd}}$ of the separation between the plates and relative permittivity $K$ is introduced between the plates. The new capacitance of the system is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>A parallel plate capacitor has capacitance $C$, when there is vacuum within the parallel plates. A sheet having thickness $\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^{\\mathrm{rd}}$ of the separation between the plates and relative permittivity $K$ is introduced between the plates. The new capacitance of the system is :</p>",
