      "qHtml": "<p>Two point charges $\\mathrm{q}_1=3 \\mu C$ and $\\mathrm{q}_2=-4 \\mu C$ are placed at points $(2 \\hat{i}+3 \\hat{j}+3 \\hat{k})$ and $(\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k})$ respectively. Force on charge $\\mathrm{q}_2$ is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ N. (Take $\\frac{1}{4 \\pi \\epsilon_0}=9 \\times 10^9$ SI Units)</p>",
