      "q": "Six point charges are kept $60^{\\circ}$ apart from each other on the circumference of a circle of radius $R$ as shown in figure. The net electric field at the center of the circle is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .\n\n( $\\epsilon_0$ is permittivity of free space)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 23 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>Six point charges are kept $60^{\\circ}$ apart from each other on the circumference of a circle of radius $R$ as shown in figure. The net electric field at the center of the circle is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .</p>\n<p>( $\\epsilon_0$ is permittivity of free space)</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml8uei1k/9e65ab98-b14c-49c4-8345-d42e155ebad2/1ce43580-023b-11f1-88dd-c7214e4b90e3/file-6y3zli1ml8uei1l.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 23 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
