      "a": 0,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift. Correct option: A. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift Physics - Capacitor Question 20 English Explanation]\n\nSince parallel combination, so v is same for both\n\nwe know, $q=cv$\n\n$\\Rightarrow q \\propto C$ (for constant v)\n\nwe can see in the graph,\n\nat final state, $q_2 > q_1$,\n\nso $c_2 > c_1$\n\nNow, as $$u = {1 \\over 2}c{v^2} \\Rightarrow u \\propto c$$ (for constant v)\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {u_2} > {u_1}$$\n\nHence, option 1 is correct.",
