      "q": "Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).\n\nAssertion (A) : The outer body of an aircraft is made of metal which protects persons sitting inside from lightning strikes.\n\nReason (R) : The electric field inside the cavity enclosed by a conductor is zero.\n\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as <b>Assertion (A)</b> and the other is labelled as <b>Reason (R).</b></p>\n<p><b>Assertion (A) :</b> The outer body of an aircraft is made of metal which protects persons sitting inside from lightning strikes.</p>\n<p><b>Reason (R) :</b> The electric field inside the cavity enclosed by a conductor is zero.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <u>most appropriate</u> answer from the options given below :</p>",
