      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift Physics - Current Electricity Question 38 English Explanation 1]\n\nHere, $${V_A} = {V_C}$$ & $${V_B} = {V_D}$$\n\nSo,\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift Physics - Current Electricity Question 38 English Explanation 2]\n\nSo resistances are in parallel combination.\n\nWe know, $${1 \\over {{R_p}}} = {1 \\over {{R_1}}} + {1 \\over {{R_2}}} + {1 \\over {{R_3}}}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {1 \\over {{R_p}}} = {3 \\over r} + {3 \\over r} + {3 \\over r} = {9 \\over r}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {R_p} = {r \\over 9}$$",
