      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 25th February Morning Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2021 (Online) 25th February Morning Shift Physics - Magnetic Effect of Current Question 151 English Explanation]\n\n$$B = {{{\\mu _0}Ni{R^2}} \\over {2{{({R^2} + {x^2})}^{3/2}}}}$$\n\nat x 1 = 0.05 m, $${B_1} = {{{\\mu _0}Ni{R^2}} \\over {2{{({R^2} + {{(0.05)}^2})}^{3/2}}}}$$\n\nat x 2 = 0.2 m, $${B_2} = {{{\\mu _0}Ni{R^2}} \\over {2{{({R^2} + {{(0.2)}^2})}^{3/2}}}}$$\n\n$${{{B_1}} \\over {{B_2}}} = {{{{({R^2} + 0.04)}^{3/2}}} \\over {{{({R^2} + 0.0025)}^{3/2}}}}$$\n\n$${\\left( {{8 \\over 1}} \\right)^{2/3}} = {{{R^2} + 0.04} \\over {{R^2} + 0.0025}}$$\n\n4 (R 2 + 0.0025) = R 2 + 0.04\n\n3R 2 = 0.04 $$-$$ 0.0100\n\nR 2 = $${{0.03} \\over 3}$$ = 0.01\n\nR = $$\\sqrt {0.01} $$ = 0.1 m",
