      "q": "Photon with kinetic energy of 1MeV moves\nfrom south to north. It gets an acceleration of\n10 12 m/s 2 by an applied magnetic field (west to\neast). The value of magnetic field : (Rest mass\nof proton is 1.6 × 10 –27 kg) :",
      "qHtml": "Photon with kinetic energy of 1MeV moves\nfrom south to north. It gets an acceleration of\n10<sup>12</sup> m/s<sup>2</sup> by an applied magnetic field (west to\neast). The value of magnetic field : (Rest mass\nof proton is 1.6 × 10<sup>–27</sup> kg) :",
