      "a": 0,
      "s": "JEE Main 2020 (Online) 8th January Morning Slot. Correct option: A. [Diagram: JEE Main 2020 (Online) 8th January Morning Slot Physics - Magnetic Effect of Current Question 172 English Explanation]\n\nK.E = $${1 \\over 2}m{v^2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 1 MeV = $${1 \\over 2}m{v^2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 1.6 $$ \\times $$ 10 -19 $$ \\times $$ 10 6 = $${1 \\over 2}$$ $$ \\times $$ 1.6 × 10 –27 $$ \\times $$ v 2\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ v = $$\\sqrt 2 \\times {10^7}$$ m/s\n\nF m = qvB sin$$\\theta $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ F m = qvB [as $$\\theta $$ = 90 o ]\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ ma = Bev\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 1.6 × 10 –27 $$ \\times $$ 10 12 = 1.6 $$ \\times $$ 10 -19 $$ \\times $$ $$\\sqrt 2 \\times {10^7}$$ $$ \\times $$ B\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ B = 0.71 mJ",
