      "qHtml": "<p>In an ac circuit, the instantaneous current is zero, when the instantaneous voltage is maximum. In this case, the source may be connected to :</p>\n<p>A. pure inductor.</p>\n<p>B. pure capacitor.</p>\n<p>C. pure resistor.</p>\n<p>D. combination of an inductor and capacitor.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
