      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 30th January Evening Shift. Correct option: C. Intensity of emergent light\n\n$$=\\frac{\\mathrm{I}_0}{2} \\cos ^2 45^{\\circ}=\\frac{\\mathrm{I}_0}{4}$$",
