      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 26th February Morning Shift. Correct option: B. Fringe width ($$\\beta$$) = $${{\\lambda D} \\over d}$$\n\nd = 2 $$\\times$$ 10 $$-$$3 m\n\n$$\\lambda$$ = 500 $$\\times$$ 10 $$-$$9 m\n\nD = 1 m\n\nNow\n\n$$\\beta$$ = $${{500 \\times {{10}^{ - 9}} \\times 1} \\over {2 \\times {{10}^{ - 3}}}}$$\n\n$$\\beta$$ = $${5 \\over 2} \\times {10^{ - 4}}$$\n\n$$\\beta$$ = 2.5 $$\\times$$ 10 $$-$$4\n\n$$\\beta$$ = 0.25 mm",
