      "s": "JEE Main 2020 (Online) 5th September Evening Slot. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2020 (Online) 5th September Evening Slot Physics - Wave Optics Question 123 English Explanation]\n\nInitially S 2 L = 2 m\n\nS 1 L = $$\\sqrt {{2^2} + {{\\left( {1.5} \\right)}^2}} $$ = 2.5 m\n\nFor minimum at (L)\n\nS 1 L – S 2 L = $$\\Delta $$x = $$\\left( {2n + 1} \\right){\\lambda \\over 2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 2.5 - 2 = $$\\left( {2n + 1} \\right){1 \\over 2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 0.5 = $${{\\left( {2n + 1} \\right)} \\over 2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 1 = 2n + 1\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ n = 0 (first minima)\n\nso at P $$ \\to $$ first maxima\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ S 1 P – S 2 P = n$$\\lambda $$ = 1$$\\lambda $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ d - 2 = 1\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ d = 3 m",
