      "q": "The exit surface of a prism with refractive index $n$ is coated with a material having refractive index $\\frac{n}{2}$. When this prism is set for minimum angle of deviation, it exactly meets the condition of critical angle. The prism angle is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .",
      "qHtml": "<p>The exit surface of a prism with refractive index $n$ is coated with a material having refractive index $\\frac{n}{2}$. When this prism is set for minimum angle of deviation, it exactly meets the condition of critical angle. The prism angle is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ .</p>",
