      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 8th April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. Equivalent focal length\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{f}}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{f}_1}+\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{f}_2} \\\\\n& =\\frac{1}{30}+\\frac{1}{-20}=\\frac{2-3}{60}=-\\frac{1}{60} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{f}=-60 \\mathrm{~cm}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nLens formula\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{v}}-\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{u}}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{f}} \\\\\n& \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{v}}-\\frac{1}{-20}=\\frac{1}{-60} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{v}=-15 \\mathrm{~cm}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
