      "q": "When an object is placed 40 cm away from a spherical mirror an image of magnification $\\frac{1}{2}$ is produced. To obtain an image with magnification of $\\frac{1}{3}$, the object is to be moved :",
      "qHtml": "<p>When an object is placed 40 cm away from a spherical mirror an image of magnification $\\frac{1}{2}$ is produced. To obtain an image with magnification of $\\frac{1}{3}$, the object is to be moved :</p>",
