      "q": "An unpolarised light is incident at an interface of two dielectric media having refractive indices of 2 (incident medium) and $2 \\sqrt{3}$ (medium) respectively. To satisfy the condition that reflected and refracted rays are perpendicular to each other, the angle of incidence is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$",
      "qHtml": "<p>An unpolarised light is incident at an interface of two dielectric media having refractive indices of 2 (incident medium) and $2 \\sqrt{3}$ (medium) respectively. To satisfy the condition that reflected and refracted rays are perpendicular to each other, the angle of incidence is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$</p>",
