      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. Through $P_2 I_1=I_0 \\sin ^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta\\right)$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift Physics - Wave Optics Question 29 English Explanation]\n\n$$I_1=I_0 \\cos ^2 \\theta$$\n\nThrough $P_3 I_{\\text {net }}=\\left(I_0 \\cos ^2 \\theta\\right) \\sin ^2 \\theta$\n\n$$I_{\\text {net }}=\\frac{I_0}{4}[\\sin (2 \\theta)]^2 \\text { for max } I_{\\text {net }} \\theta=45^{\\circ}$$\n\nSo angle between $\\mathrm{P}_2$ and $\\mathrm{P}_3=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\n\nCorrect Ans. (1)",
