      "qHtml": "<p>A light wave described by $E=60\\left[\\sin \\left(3 \\times 10^{15}\\right) t+\\sin \\left(12 \\times 10^{15}\\right) t\\right]$ (in SI units) falls on a metal surface of work function 2.8 eV . The maximum kinetic energy of ejected photoelectron is (approximately)</p>\n<p>$\\_\\_\\_\\_$ eV. $\\left(h=6.6 \\times 10^{-34}\\right.$ J.s. and $\\left.e=1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\mathrm{C}\\right)$</p>",
