      "qHtml": "<p>A small mirror of mass $m$ is suspended by a massless thread of length $l$. Then the small angle through which the thread will be deflected when a short pulse of laser of energy E falls normal on the mirror</p>\n<p>($\\mathrm{c}=$ speed of light in vacuum and $g=$ acceleration due to gravity)</p>",
