      "q": "A sub-atomic particle of mass $10^{-30} \\mathrm{~kg}$ is moving with a velocity $2.21 \\times 10^6 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$. Under the matter wave consideration, the particle will behave closely like $\\qquad$ $\\left(\\mathrm{h}=6.63 \\times 10^{-34} \\mathrm{~J} . \\mathrm{s}\\right)$",
