      "qHtml": "<p>A light source of wavelength $\\lambda$ illuminates a metal surface and electrons are ejected with maximum kinetic energy of 2 eV . If the same surface is illuminated by a light source of wavelength $\\frac{\\lambda}{2}$, then the maximum kinetic energy of ejected electrons will be (The work function of metal is 1 eV )</p>",
