      "qHtml": "<p>The ratio of momentum of the photons of the $1^{\\text {st }}$ and $2^{\\text {nd }}$ line of Balmer series of Hydrogen atoms is $\\alpha / \\beta$. The possible values of $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ are:-</p>",
