      "q": "Angular momentum of an electron in a hydrogen atom is $\\frac{3h}{\\pi}$, then the energy of the electron is _____ eV.",
      "qHtml": "<p>Angular momentum of an electron in a hydrogen atom is $\\frac{3h}{\\pi}$, then the energy of the electron is _____ eV.</p>",
