      "q": "If an alpha particle with energy 7.7 MeV is bombarded on a thin gold foil, the closest distance from nucleus it can reach is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ m. (Atomic number of gold $=79$ and $\\frac{1}{4 \\pi \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{o}}}=9 \\times 10^9$ in SI units)",
      "qHtml": "<p>If an alpha particle with energy 7.7 MeV is bombarded on a thin gold foil, the closest distance from nucleus it can reach is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ m. (Atomic number of gold $=79$ and $\\frac{1}{4 \\pi \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{o}}}=9 \\times 10^9$ in SI units)</p>",
