      "q": "The minimum frequency of photon required to break a particle of mass 15.348 amu into $4 \\alpha$ particles is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ kHz .\n\n[mass of He nucleus = $4.002 \\mathrm{amu}, 1 \\mathrm{amu}=1.66 \\times 10^{-27} \\mathrm{~kg}, \\mathrm{~h}=6.6 \\times 10^{-34} \\mathrm{~J} . \\mathrm{s}$ and $\\mathrm{c}=3 \\times 10^8 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$ ]",
      "qHtml": "<p>The minimum frequency of photon required to break a particle of mass 15.348 amu into $4 \\alpha$ particles is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ kHz .</p>\n<p>[mass of He nucleus = $4.002 \\mathrm{amu}, 1 \\mathrm{amu}=1.66 \\times 10^{-27} \\mathrm{~kg}, \\mathrm{~h}=6.6 \\times 10^{-34} \\mathrm{~J} . \\mathrm{s}$ and $\\mathrm{c}=3 \\times 10^8 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$ ]</p>",
