      "s": "JEE Main 2022 (Online) 24th June Morning Shift. Correct option: D. 220 A $$\\to$$ 105 B + 115 C\n\n$$\\Rightarrow$$ Q = [105 $$\\times$$ 6.4 + 115 $$\\times$$ 6.4] $$-$$ [220 $$\\times$$ 5.6] MeV\n\n$$\\Rightarrow$$ Q = 176 MeV",
