      "qHtml": "Find the Binding energy per neucleon for $${}_{50}^{120}Sn$$. Mass of proton m<sub>p</sub>\n = 1.00783 U, mass of neutron\nm<sub>n</sub>\n = 1.00867 U and mass of tin nucleus m<sub>Sn</sub> = 119.902199 U. (take 1U = 931 MeV)",
