      "qHtml": "<p>The binding energy per nucleon of $^{209}_{83}Bi$ is _______ MeV.</p><p>[Take $m(^{209}_{83}Bi) = 208.980388\\ \\text{u}$, $m_p = 1.007825\\ \\text{u}$, $m_n = 1.008665\\ \\text{u}$, $1\\ \\text{u} = 931\\ \\text{MeV}/c^2$]</p>",
