      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements. One is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).</p>\n<p>Assertion (A) : The binding energy per nucleon is found to be practically independent of the atomic number A , for nuclei with mass numbers between 30 and 170 .</p>\n<p>Reason (R) : Nuclear force is long range.\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
