      "q": "Find the correct combination of $\\mathrm{A}, \\mathrm{B}, \\mathrm{C}$ and D inputs which can cause the LED to glow.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift Physics - Semiconductor Question 17 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>Find the correct combination of $\\mathrm{A}, \\mathrm{B}, \\mathrm{C}$ and D inputs which can cause the LED to glow.</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1ml8ubiki/5ea6a32f-9e52-4db4-bcd3-afe24bbe1338/c9deda20-023a-11f1-88dd-c7214e4b90e3/file-6y3zli1ml8ubikj.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift Physics - Semiconductor Question 17 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
