      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 17th March Morning Shift. Correct option: B. Reading = MSR + VSD $$\\times$$ LC $$-$$ zero error\n\nReading = 8.5 + $${{(0.1) \\times 6} \\over {10}} - {{0.2} \\over {10}} = 8.54$$ cm",
      "source": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 17th March Morning Shift | Experimental Physics | aHLoWQMEVWbods0LBY1kmj3p1zj",
