      "s": "AIEEE 2009. Correct option: A. 30 vernier scale divisions coincide with 29 main scale divisions.\n\nTherefore 1 V.S.D = $${{29} \\over {30}}$$ M.S.D\n\nLeast count = 1 M.S.D - 1 V.S.D\n\n= 1 M.S.D - $${{29} \\over {30}}$$ M.S.D\n\n= $${{1} \\over {30}}$$ M.S.D\n\n= $${{1} \\over {30}}$$ $$ \\times $$ 0.5 o\n\n= $${{1} \\over {30}}$$ $$ \\times $$ $${1 \\over 2}$$ o\n\n= $${1 \\over {60}}$$ o\n\n= 1 min",
