      "qHtml": "<p>What is the mole fraction of water in $10 \\%$ by weight $(\\mathrm{w} / \\mathrm{w})$ of aqueous urea solution?</p>\n<p>[Given: Molar mass of $\\mathrm{H}, \\mathrm{O}, \\mathrm{C}$ and N are $1,16,12$ and $14 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ respectively.]</p>",
