      "qHtml": "<p>The correct order of total number of atoms present in</p>\n<p>(A) 2 moles of cyclohexane</p>\n<p>(B) 684 g of sucrose</p>\n<p>(C) 90.8 L of dihydrogen at STP</p>\n<p>is :</p>",
