      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift. Correct option: B. At STP, according to Avogadro’s law, $1$ mole of any gas occupies $22.4 \\, \\text{L}$.\n\nSo, number of moles of $\\mathrm{SO_2}$ is\n\n$$ n=\\frac{V}{22.4}=\\frac{1.4187}{22.4} $$\n\n$$ n=0.0633 \\text{ mol} $$\n\nNow, number of molecules\n\n$$ = n \\times N_A $$\n\nwhere $N_A = 6.022 \\times 10^{23}$\n\nSo,\n\n$$ \\text{Number of molecules} = 0.0633 \\times 6.022 \\times 10^{23} $$\n\n$$ = 3.812 \\times 10^{22} $$\n\nHence, the correct answer is:\n\n$$ \\boxed{0.0633 \\text{ mol ; } 3.812 \\times 10^{22} \\text{ molecules}} $$\n\nSo, Option B is correct.",
