      "qHtml": "<p>Which of the following have same number of significant figures?</p>\n<p>A. 0.00253</p>\n<p>B. 1.0003</p>\n<p>C. 15.0</p>\n<p>D. 163</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
