      "qHtml": "<p>Production of iron in blast furnace follows the following equation</p>\n<p>Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub>(s) + 4CO(g) $$\\to$$ 3Fe(l) + 4CO<sub>2</sub>(g)</p>\n<p>when 4.640 kg of Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> and 2.520 kg of CO are allowed to react then the amount of iron (in g) produced is :</p>\n<p>[Given : Molar Atomic mass (g mol<sup>$$-$$1</sup>) : Fe = 56, Molar Atomic mass (g mol<sup>$$-$$1</sup>) : O \n = 16, Molar Atomic mass (g mol<sup>$$-$$1</sup>) : C = 12]</p>",
