      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 16th March Evening Shift. Correct option: B. [Diagram: JEE Main 2021 (Online) 16th March Evening Shift Chemistry - Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry Question 171 English Explanation 1]\n\nMillimoles of H 3 PO 3 = M $$\\times$$ V = 1 $$\\times$$ 50 = 50\n\nFor 1 millimole of H 3 PO 3 , we require 2 millimoles of NaOH.\n\nFor 50 millimole of H 3 PO 3 , we require (2 $$\\times$$ 50) = 100 millimoles of NaOH.\n\nMillimoles of NaOH = M $$\\times$$ V = 100\n\n1 $$\\times$$ V = 100\n\nV = 100 mL\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2021 (Online) 16th March Evening Shift Chemistry - Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry Question 171 English Explanation 2]\n\nMillimoles of H 3 PO 2 = M $$\\times$$ V = 2 $$\\times$$ 100 = 200\n\nFor 1 millimole of H 3 PO 2 , we require 1 millimoles of NaOH.\n\nFor 200 millimoles of H 3 PO 2 , we require 200 millimoles of NaOH.\n\nSo, volume of NaOH = 200 mL",
