      "qHtml": "<p>What is the energy (in J atom<sup>−1</sup>) required for the following process?</p> <p>Li<sup>2+</sup> (g) &rarr; Li<sup>3+</sup> (g) + e<sup>&minus;</sup></p> <p>(Take the ionization energy for the H atom in the ground state as $2.18 \\times 10^{−18} \\text{ J atom}^{−1}$)</p>",
