      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $\\begin{aligned} & E_n=-R_H \\times \\frac{Z^2}{n^2} \\\\ & \\Delta E=2.18 \\times 10^{-11} \\times 10^{-7} \\times 1^2\\left[\\frac{1}{1^2}-\\frac{1}{2^2}\\right] \\\\ & =1.635 \\times 10^{-18} \\mathrm{Joule} / \\text { atom } \\\\ & =1.635 \\times 10^{-18} \\times 6.02 \\times 10^{23} \\text { Joule } / \\text { mole } \\\\ & =9.835 \\times 10^5 \\text { Joule } / \\text { mole }\\end{aligned}$",
