      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift Chemistry - Structure of Atom Question 68 English Explanation]\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\lambda=\\frac{h}{p} \\\\\\\\\n& \\lambda \\propto \\frac{1}{p}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, graph between $\\lambda$ and $p$ is rectangular hyperbola.",
