      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p><b>Statement (I) :</b> The radii of isoelectronic species increases in the order.\n<br><br>Mg<sup>2+</sup> &lt; Na<sup>+</sup> &lt; F<sup>$-$</sup> &lt; O<sup>2-</sup></p><p><b>Statement (II) :</b> The magnitude of electron gain enthalpy of halogen decreases in the order.\n<br><br>Cl &gt; F &gt; Br &gt; I</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :</p>",
