      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 23rd January Evening Shift. Correct option: B. Order of M.P. of group 14: $\\mathrm{C}>\\mathrm{Si}>\\mathrm{Ge}>\\mathrm{Pb}>\\mathrm{Sn}$\n\nElement\nM.P. ($^\\circ$C)\n\nZ = 6 = C\n3730\n\nZ = 14 = Si\n1410\n\nZ = 32 = Ge\n937\n\nZ = 50 = Sn\n232\n\nZ = 82 = Pb\n327",
