      "qHtml": "<p>Among $\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{~S}, \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}, \\mathrm{NF}_3, \\mathrm{NH}_3$ and $\\mathrm{CHCl}_3$, identify the molecule $(\\mathrm{X})$ with lowest dipole moment value. The number of lone pairs of electrons present on the central atom of the molecule $(X)$ is :</p>",
