      "a": 1,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $\\mathrm{KCl}_{(\\mathrm{s})}+\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O} \\xrightarrow{\\Delta \\mathrm{H} \\text { sol. }} \\mathrm{K}_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+}+\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\text {(aq) }}^{-1}$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Evening Shift Chemistry - Thermodynamics Question 31 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta \\mathrm{H}_{\\mathrm{Sol}^{\\mathrm{n}} .} & =\\mathrm{L} \\cdot \\mathrm{E} \\cdot+(\\mathrm{H} \\cdot \\mathrm{E})_{\\mathrm{K}_{(\\mathrm{g})}^{+}}+(\\mathrm{HE})_{\\mathrm{Cl}_{(\\mathrm{g})}^{-1}} \\\\\n& =\\mathrm{Z}-\\mathrm{x}-\\mathrm{y} \\\\\n& =\\mathrm{z}-(\\mathrm{x}+\\mathrm{y})\n\\end{aligned}$$",
