      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift. Correct option: C. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& (10 \\mathrm{~L}, 300 \\mathrm{~K}) \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{n}=1}(20 \\mathrm{~L}, 300 \\mathrm{~K}) \\\\\n& -\\mathrm{q}=\\mathrm{w}=-\\mathrm{nRT} \\ln \\frac{\\mathrm{~V}_2}{\\mathrm{~V}_1} \\\\\n& =-8.3 \\times 300 \\times \\ln \\left(\\frac{20}{10}\\right) \\\\\n& =-1.718 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{q}=1.718 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{w}=-1.718 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\\\\n& \\Delta \\mathrm{U}=0(\\because \\Delta \\mathrm{~T}=0)\n\\end{aligned}$$",
