      "qHtml": "<p>Arrange the following in order of magnitude of work done by the system/on the system at constant temperature.</p>\n<p>(a) $\\left|w_{\\text {reversible }}\\right|$ for expansion in infinite stages.</p>\n<p>(b) $\\left|w_{\\text {irreversible }}\\right|$ for expansion in single stage.</p>\n<p>(c) $\\left|\\mathrm{w}_{\\text {reversible }}\\right|$ for compression in infinite stages.</p>\n<p>(d) $\\left|w_{\\text {irreversible }}\\right|$ for compression in single stage.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
