      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift. Correct option: D. Reaction is spontaneous at relatively high temperature and non-spontaneous at low temperature $\\Delta \\mathrm{G}=\\Delta \\mathrm{H}-\\mathrm{T} \\Delta \\mathrm{S}$\nIt is only possible when $\\Delta \\mathrm{H}$ and $\\Delta \\mathrm{S}$ both are positive.\n\nOption (1)",
      "source": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift | Thermodynamics | m6ulvp77",
      "pyq": true,
      "exactPaperText": true,
      "pyqSourceSlug": "thermodynamics"
