      "q": "Match List - I with List - II.\n\nList - I\n(Partial Derivatives)\n\nList - II\n(Thermodynamic Quantity)\n\n(A)\n$\\left(\\frac{\\partial \\mathrm{G}}{\\partial \\mathrm{T}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{P}}$\n(I)\nCp\n\n(B)\n$\\left(\\frac{\\partial \\mathrm{H}}{\\partial \\mathrm{T}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{P}}$\n(II)\n$-$S\n\n(C)\n$\\left(\\frac{\\partial \\mathrm{G}}{\\partial \\mathrm{P}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{T}}$\n(III)\nCv\n\n(D)\n$\\left(\\frac{\\partial \\mathrm{U}}{\\partial \\mathrm{T}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{V}}$\n(IV)\nV\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
