      "s": "JEE Main 2018 (Online) 16th April Morning Slot. Correct option: D. A 2 (g) $$\\rightleftharpoons$$ 2 A (g)\n\nAssume initially concentration of A 2 = [A 2 ] = 1 m\n\nat equilibrium [A 2 ] = 1 $$ \\times $$ $${{80} \\over {100}}$$ = 0.8 M\n\nand 20% of [A 2 ] = 1 $$ \\times $$ $${{20} \\over {100}}$$ = 0.2 M\n\n$$\\therefore\\,\\,\\,\\,$$ [A] = 2 $$ \\times $$ 0.2 = 0.4 M\n\nEquilibrium constant\n\nK = $${{{{[A]}^2}} \\over {[{A_2}]}}$$ = $${{{{\\left[ {0.4} \\right]}^2}} \\over {\\left[ {0.8} \\right]}}$$ = 0.2\n\n$$\\Delta $$G o = $$-$$ RT $$\\ell $$nK\n\n= $$-$$ 8.314 $$ \\times $$ 320 $$ \\times $$ $$\\ell $$n(0.2)\n\n= 4281 J/mol.",
