      "qHtml": "<p>Which of the following mixture gives a buffer solution with $\\mathrm{pH}=9.25$ ?</p>\n<p>Given : $\\mathrm{pK}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_4 \\mathrm{OH}\\right)=4.75$</p>",
