      "q": "At $\\mathrm{T}(\\mathrm{K})$, the equilibrium constant of\n\n$\\mathrm{A}_2(g)+\\mathrm{B}_2(g) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{C}(g)$ is $2.7 \\times 10^{-5}$.\n\nWhat is the equilibrium constant for\n\n$\\frac{1}{3} \\mathrm{~A}_2(\\mathrm{~g})+\\frac{1}{3} \\mathrm{~B}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\frac{1}{3} \\mathrm{C}(\\mathrm{g})$ at the same temperature?",
      "qHtml": "<p>At $\\mathrm{T}(\\mathrm{K})$, the equilibrium constant of \n<br><br>$\\mathrm{A}_2(g)+\\mathrm{B}_2(g) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{C}(g)$ is $2.7 \\times 10^{-5}$. \n<br><br>What is the equilibrium constant for \n<br><br>$\\frac{1}{3} \\mathrm{~A}_2(\\mathrm{~g})+\\frac{1}{3} \\mathrm{~B}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\frac{1}{3} \\mathrm{C}(\\mathrm{g})$ at the same temperature?</p>",
