      "qHtml": "<p>One mole of $\\mathrm{Cl}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$ was passed into 2 L of cold 2 M KOH solution. After the reaction, the concentrations of $\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}, \\mathrm{ClO}^{-}$and $\\mathrm{OH}^{-}$are respectively (assume volume remains constant)</p>",
