      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p>Statement I : Hyperconjugation is not a permanent effect.</p>\n<p>Statement II : In general, greater the number of alkyl groups attached to a positively charged Cation, greater is the hyperconjugation interaction and stabilization of the cation.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
