      "q": "Match List - I with List - II.\n\nList - I (Structure)\nList - II (IUPAC Name)\n\n(A)\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 58 English 1]\n\n(I) 4-Methylpent-1-ene\n\n(B) (CH 3 ) 2 C(C 3 H 7 ) 2\n(II) 3-Ethyl-5-methylheptane\n\n(C)\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 58 English 2]\n\n(III) 4,4-Dimethylheptane\n\n(D)\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 58 English 3]\n\n(IV) 2-Methyl-1,3-pentadiene\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Match List - I with List - II.</p><table>\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th>List - I (Structure)</th>\n    <th>List - II (IUPAC Name)</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(A) <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m6qtjjfx/f6d760b2-153a-4a10-bcc0-502c2561378e/9ce4fdd0-e326-11ef-9ab1-8bface956638/file-jaoe38c1m6qtjjfy.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 58 English 1\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n    <td>(I) 4-Methylpent-1-ene</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(B) (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>C(C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>7</sub>)<sub>2</sub></td>\n    <td>(II) 3-Ethyl-5-methylheptane</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(C) <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m6qtjhgd/2b7f5949-c082-425f-a769-4dc2543f42e0/9b5becd0-e326-11ef-9ab1-8bface956638/file-jaoe38c1m6qtjhge.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 58 English 2\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n    <td>(III) 4,4-Dimethylheptane</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(D) <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m6qtjfdu/36692632-9a67-4527-8d20-ea46bbdbe6c7/99c28820-e326-11ef-9ab1-8bface956638/file-jaoe38c1m6qtjfdv.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 58 English 3\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n    <td>(IV) 2-Methyl-1,3-pentadiene</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
