      "qHtml": "<p>How many different stereoisomers are possible for the given molecule?</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m6qthd5q/cbbc9778-3c6d-46d6-bfce-8094d554a4d7/606c2fe0-e326-11ef-b217-b145f2036112/file-jaoe38c1m6qthd5r.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Morning Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 54 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
