      "a": 0,
      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift. Correct option: A. For osmotic pressure, we use the NCERT relation:\n\n$$ \\pi = C R T = \\frac{n}{V}RT $$\n\nwhere\n\n$\\pi$ = osmotic pressure\n\n$n$ = number of moles of solute\n\n$V$ = volume of solution\n\n$R = 0.083 \\, \\text{L bar mol}^{-1}\\text{K}^{-1}$\n\n$T = 300 \\, \\text{K}$\n\nProtein molar mass is:\n\n$$ M = 50000 \\, \\text{g mol}^{-1} $$\n\nNow solve each part.\n\nFor solution A\n\nMass of protein $= 1 \\, \\text{g}$\n\nMoles of protein:\n\n$$ n_A = \\frac{1}{50000} = 2 \\times 10^{-5} \\, \\text{mol} $$\n\nVolume:\n\n$$ V_A = 0.5 \\, \\text{L} $$\n\nSo concentration:\n\n$$ C_A = \\frac{2 \\times 10^{-5}}{0.5} = 4 \\times 10^{-5} \\, \\text{mol L}^{-1} $$\n\nHence osmotic pressure:\n\n$$ x = \\pi_A = C_A RT $$\n\n$$ x = (4 \\times 10^{-5})(0.083)(300) $$\n\nFirst calculate:\n\n$$ 0.083 \\times 300 = 24.9 $$\n\nSo,\n\n$$ x = 4 \\times 10^{-5} \\times 24.9 = 9.96 \\times 10^{-4} \\, \\text{bar} $$\n\nFor solution B\n\nMass of protein $= 2 \\, \\text{g}$\n\nMoles:\n\n$$ n_B = \\frac{2}{50000} = 4 \\times 10^{-5} \\, \\text{mol} $$\n\nVolume:\n\n$$ V_B = 1 \\, \\text{L} $$\n\nConcentration:\n\n$$ C_B = \\frac{4 \\times 10^{-5}}{1} = 4 \\times 10^{-5} \\, \\text{mol L}^{-1} $$\n\nThus,\n\n$$ y = \\pi_B = C_BRT $$\n\n$$ y = (4 \\times 10^{-5})(0.083)(300) $$\n\n$$ y = 9.96 \\times 10^{-4} \\, \\text{bar} $$\n\nAfter mixing A and B\n\nTotal moles of protein:\n\n$$ n_{\\text{total}} = 2 \\times 10^{-5} + 4 \\times 10^{-5} = 6 \\times 10^{-5} \\, \\text{mol} $$\n\nTotal volume:\n\n$$ V_{\\text{total}} = 0.5 + 1 = 1.5 \\, \\text{L} $$\n\nConcentration after mixing:\n\n$$ C_{\\text{mix}} = \\frac{6 \\times 10^{-5}}{1.5} = 4 \\times 10^{-5} \\, \\text{mol L}^{-1} $$\n\nAgain,\n\n$$ z = \\pi_{\\text{mix}} = C_{\\text{mix}}RT $$\n\n$$ z = (4 \\times 10^{-5})(0.083)(300) = 9.96 \\times 10^{-4} \\, \\text{bar} $$\n\nSo,\n\n$$ x = 9.96 \\times 10^{-4} \\, \\text{bar}, \\quad y = 9.96 \\times 10^{-4} \\, \\text{bar}, \\quad z = 9.96 \\times 10^{-4} \\, \\text{bar} $$\n\nTherefore, the correct option is:\n\n$$ \\boxed{\\text{Option A}} $$",
