      "q": "At 298 K , the mole percentage of $\\mathrm{N}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$ in air is $80 \\%$. Water is in equilibrium with air at a pressure of 10 atm . What is the mole fraction of $\\mathrm{N}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$ in water at 298 K ? $\\left(\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{H}}\\right.$ for $\\mathrm{N}_2$ is $\\left.6.5 \\times 10^7 \\mathrm{~mm} \\mathrm{Hg}\\right)$",
      "qHtml": "<p>At 298 K , the mole percentage of $\\mathrm{N}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$ in air is $80 \\%$. Water is in equilibrium with air at a pressure of 10 atm . What is the mole fraction of $\\mathrm{N}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$ in water at 298 K ? $\\left(\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{H}}\\right.$ for $\\mathrm{N}_2$ is $\\left.6.5 \\times 10^7 \\mathrm{~mm} \\mathrm{Hg}\\right)$</p>",
