      "qHtml": "<p>The standard cell potential $\\left(\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\ominus}\\right)$ of a fuel cell based on the oxidation of methanol in air that has been used to power television relay station is measured as 1.21 V . The standard half cell reduction potential for $\\mathrm{O}_2\\left(\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{O}_2 / \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}}^{\\circ}\\right)$ is 1.229 V .</p>\n<p>Choose the correct statement :</p>",
