      "qHtml": "<p>A solution of aluminium chloride is electrolysed for 30 minutes using a current of 2 A . The amount of the aluminium deposited at the cathode is __________ .</p>\n<p>[Given : molar mass of aluminium and chlorine are $27 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ and $35.5 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ respectively. Faraday constant $\\left.=96500 \\mathrm{C} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}\\right]$</p>",
