      "q": "An organic compound undergoes first order decomposition. The time taken for decomposition to $\\left(\\frac{1}{8}\\right)^{\\text {th }}$ and $\\left(\\frac{1}{10}\\right)^{\\text {th }}$ of its initial concentration are $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 8}$ and $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 10}$ respectively.\n\nWhat is the value of $\\frac{\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 8}}{\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 10}} \\times 10$ ?\n\n$$ (\\log 2=0.3) $$",
      "qHtml": "<p>An organic compound undergoes first order decomposition. The time taken for decomposition to $\\left(\\frac{1}{8}\\right)^{\\text {th }}$ and $\\left(\\frac{1}{10}\\right)^{\\text {th }}$ of its initial concentration are $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 8}$ and $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 10}$ respectively.</p>\n<p>What is the value of $\\frac{\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 8}}{\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 10}} \\times 10$ ?</p>\n<p>$$ (\\log 2=0.3) $$</p>",
