      "qHtml": "<p>For $\\mathrm{A}_2+\\mathrm{B}_2 \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{AB}$</p>\n<p>$\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{a}}$ for forward and backward reaction are 180 and $200 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ respectively</p>\n<p>If catalyst lowers $\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{a}}$ for both reaction by $100 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$.</p>\n<p>Which of the following statement is correct?</p>",
