      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift. Correct option: D. [Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 2nd April Evening Shift Chemistry - Chemical Kinetics and Nuclear Chemistry Question 38 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\mathrm{A} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{~B}$$ Slow\n\n$\\Delta \\mathrm{H}=+$ ve $\\quad \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{a}_1} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{High}$\n\n$$\\mathrm{B} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{C}$$ Fast\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Delta \\mathrm{H}=-\\mathrm{ve} \\quad \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{a}_2} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Low} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{C} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{D} \\\\\n& \\Delta \\mathrm{H}=-\\mathrm{ve} \\quad \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{a}_3} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Low}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
