      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Evening Shift. Correct option: C. Because no. of bacteria initial $=\\mathrm{N}_0$ and No. of bacteria at any time $\\mathrm{t}=\\mathrm{N}$\n\nSince bacterial growth is given as\n\n$$\\mathrm{N}=\\mathrm{N}_0 \\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{Kt}}$$\n\nWhere K = growth constant for bacterial growth\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Evening Shift Chemistry - Chemical Kinetics and Nuclear Chemistry Question 48 English Explanation]",
