      "q": "[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Chemical Kinetics and Nuclear Chemistry Question 41 English]\n\nFor a given reaction $\\mathrm{R} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{P}, \\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}$ is related to $[\\mathrm{A}]_0$ as given in table.\n\nGiven: $\\log 2=0.30$\n\nWhich of the following is true?\n\nA. The order of the reaction is $1 / 2$.\n\nB. If $[\\mathrm{A}]_0$ is 1 M , then $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}$ is $200 \\sqrt{10} \\mathrm{~min}$\n\nC. The order of the reaction changes to 1 if the concentration of reactant changes from 0.100 M to 0.500 M.\n\nD. $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}$ is 800 min for $[\\mathrm{A}]_0=1.6 \\mathrm{M}$\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:",
      "qHtml": "<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m6w1jab3/2bb5cf80-7c80-444c-9aaf-f1fcea1bfc2f/ca1e67f0-e605-11ef-80a5-67ab586ae463/file-jaoe38c1m6w1jab4.png\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 28th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Chemical Kinetics and Nuclear Chemistry Question 41 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>For a given reaction $\\mathrm{R} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{P}, \\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}$ is related to $[\\mathrm{A}]_0$ as given in table.</p>\n<p>Given: $\\log 2=0.30$</p>\n<p>Which of the following is true?</p>\n<p>A. The order of the reaction is $1 / 2$.</p>\n<p>B. If $[\\mathrm{A}]_0$ is 1 M , then $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}$ is $200 \\sqrt{10} \\mathrm{~min}$</p>\n<p>C. The order of the reaction changes to 1 if the concentration of reactant changes from 0.100 M to 0.500 M.</p>\n<p>D. $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}$ is 800 min for $[\\mathrm{A}]_0=1.6 \\mathrm{M}$</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
