      "qHtml": "<p>On heating a mixture of common salt and $K_2Cr_2O_7$ in equal amount along with concentrated $H_2SO_4$ in a test tube, a gas is evolved. Formula of the gas evolved and oxidation state of the central metal atom in the gas respectively are:</p>",
