      "q": "The calculated spin-only magnetic moments of $K_3[Fe(OH)_6]$ and $K_4[Fe(OH)_6]$ respectively are :",
      "qHtml": "<p>The calculated spin-only magnetic moments of $K_3[Fe(OH)_6]$ and $K_4[Fe(OH)_6]$ respectively are :</p>",
