      "qHtml": "<p>From the magnetic behaviour of $\\left[\\mathrm{NiCl}_4\\right]^{2-}$ (paramagnetic) and $\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CO})_4\\right]$ (diamagnetic), choose the correct geometry and oxidation state.</p>",
