      "qHtml": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p><b>Statement I:</b> The second ionization enthalpy of B, Al and Ga is in the order of B &gt; Al &gt; Ga.</p><p><b>Statement II:</b> The correct order in terms of first ionization enthalpy is Si &lt; Ge &lt; Pb &lt; Sn.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>correct</b> answer from the options given below :</p>",
