      "q": "Regarding the hydrides of group 15 elements $\\mathrm{EH}_3(\\mathrm{E}=\\mathrm{N}, \\mathrm{P}, \\mathrm{As}, \\mathrm{Sb})$, select the correct statement from the following :\n\nA. The stability of hydrides decreases down the group.\n\nB. The basicity of hydrides decreases down the group.\n\nC. The reducing character increases down the group.\n\nD. The boiling point increases down the group.\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Regarding the hydrides of group 15 elements $\\mathrm{EH}_3(\\mathrm{E}=\\mathrm{N}, \\mathrm{P}, \\mathrm{As}, \\mathrm{Sb})$, select the correct statement from the following :</p>\n<p>A. The stability of hydrides decreases down the group.</p>\n<p>B. The basicity of hydrides decreases down the group.</p>\n<p>C. The reducing character increases down the group.</p>\n<p>D. The boiling point increases down the group.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
