      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift. Correct option: D. Statement I:\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift Chemistry - p-Block Elements Question 5 English Explanation 1]\n\nThe complex formed is a compound with coordination number 4 not 6 .\n\n$$ \\text { Statement II: } $$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift Chemistry - p-Block Elements Question 5 English Explanation 2]\n\n$$ \\text { } \\begin{aligned}Steric ,\\,No. \\,\\, & =4 \\mathrm{bp}+2 \\mathrm{lp} \\\\ & =6 \\end{aligned} $$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift Chemistry - p-Block Elements Question 5 English Explanation 3]\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} \\text { Stervic No. } & =3 bp+1 lp \\\\ & =4 \\end{aligned} $$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift Chemistry - p-Block Elements Question 5 English Explanation 4]\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} \\text { Steric No. } & =2 \\mathrm{bp}+3 \\mathrm{lp} \\\\ & =5 \\end{aligned} $$",
      "source": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift | p-Block (15-18) | mnswhsmf",
