      "qHtml": "<p>Match List I with List II</p>\n<p>\n<table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST I <br>Name of reaction</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST II <br>Reagent used</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>A.</td>\n    <td>Hell-Volhard-Zelinsky reaction</td>\n    <td>I.</td>\n    <td>$$NaOH + {I_2}$$</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>B.</td>\n    <td>Iodoform reaction</td>\n    <td>II.</td>\n    <td>(i) $$Cr{O_2}C{l_2},C{S_2}$$ (ii) $${H_2}O$$</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>C.</td>\n    <td>Etard reaction</td>\n    <td>III.</td>\n    <td>(i) $$B{r_2}$$ / red phosphorus (ii) $$H_2O$$</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>D.</td>\n    <td>Gatterman-Koch reaction</td>\n    <td>IV.</td>\n    <td>$$CO,HCl,$$, anhyd. $$AlC{l_3}$$</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
