      "q": "Match the List-I with List-II\n\nList-I\nChloro derivative List-II\nExample\nA. Vinyl Chloride I. CH$_2$ = CH - CH$_2$Cl\nB. Benzyl Chloride II. CH$_3$ - CH(Cl)CH$_3$\nC. Alkyl Chloride III. CH$_2$ = CHCl\nD. Allyl Chloride IV.\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2026 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Haloalkanes and Haloarenes Question 8 English]\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
