      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 4th April Morning Shift. Correct option: A. Match each amino acid with its correct one-letter symbol and whether it is essential or non-essential:\n\nArginine $\\rightarrow$ one-letter symbol is $R$\n\nIn standard school-level classification here, it is matched as Essential\n\nSo, $A \\rightarrow II$\n\nAspartic acid $\\rightarrow$ one-letter symbol is $D$\n\nIt is Non-essential\n\nSo, $B \\rightarrow I$\n\nLysine $\\rightarrow$ one-letter symbol is $K$\n\nIt is Essential\n\nSo, $C \\rightarrow IV$\n\nGlutamic acid $\\rightarrow$ one-letter symbol is $E$\n\nIt is Non-essential\n\nSo, $D \\rightarrow III$\n\nThus the correct matching is:\n\n$$ A-II,\\; B-I,\\; C-IV,\\; D-III $$\n\nSo, the correct option is Option A .",
