      "qHtml": "<p>Match List I with List II</p>\n<p>\n<table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST I<br>Natural amino acid</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST II<br>One letter code</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>A.</td>\n    <td>Glutamic acid</td>\n    <td>I.</td>\n    <td>Q</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>B.</td>\n    <td>Glutamine</td>\n    <td>II.</td>\n    <td>W</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>C.</td>\n    <td>Tyrosine</td>\n    <td>III.</td>\n    <td>E</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>D.</td>\n    <td>Tryptophan</td>\n    <td>IV.</td>\n    <td>Y</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
