      "q": "Match List I with List II\n\nLIST I\nComplex\n\nLIST II\nColour\n\nA.\n$$Mg(N{H_4})P{O_4}$$\nI.\nbrown\n\nB.\n$${K_3}[Co{(N{O_2})_6}]$$\nII.\nwhite\n\nC.\n$$MnO{(OH)_2}$$\nIII.\nyellow\n\nD.\n$$F{e_4}{[Fe{(CN)_6}]_3}$$\nIV.\nblue\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Match List I with List II</p>\n<p>\n<table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST I<br>Complex</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>LIST II<br>Colour</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>A.</td>\n    <td>$$Mg(N{H_4})P{O_4}$$</td>\n    <td>I.</td>\n    <td>brown</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>B.</td>\n    <td>$${K_3}[Co{(N{O_2})_6}]$$</td>\n    <td>II.</td>\n    <td>white</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>C.</td>\n    <td>$$MnO{(OH)_2}$$</td>\n    <td>III.</td>\n    <td>yellow</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>D.</td>\n    <td>$$F{e_4}{[Fe{(CN)_6}]_3}$$</td>\n    <td>IV.</td>\n    <td>blue</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
