      "q": "The correct order of the complexes $\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_5\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)\\right]^{3+}(\\mathrm{A}),\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+}(\\mathrm{B}),\\left[\\mathrm{Co}(\\mathrm{CN})_6\\right]^{3-}(\\mathrm{C})$ and $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_5\\right]^{2+}(\\mathrm{D})$ in terms of wavelength of light absorbed is",
      "qHtml": "The correct order of the complexes $\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_5\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)\\right]^{3+}(\\mathrm{A}),\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+}(\\mathrm{B}),\\left[\\mathrm{Co}(\\mathrm{CN})_6\\right]^{3-}(\\mathrm{C})$ and $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_5\\right]^{2+}(\\mathrm{D})$ in terms of wavelength of light absorbed is",
