      "qHtml": "<p>Let $a_1, a_2, a_3, a_4$ be an A.P. of four terms such that each term of the A.P. and its common difference $l$ are integers. If $a_1+a_2+a_3+a_4=48$ and $a_1 a_2 a_3 a_4+l^4=361$, then the largest term of the A.P. is equal to</p>",
