      "qHtml": "<p>Let $729,81,9,1, \\ldots$ be a sequence and $\\mathrm{P}_n$ denote the product of the first $n$ terms of this sequence.</p>\n<p>If $2 \\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{40}\\left(\\mathrm{P}_n\\right)^{\\frac{1}{n}}=\\frac{3^\\alpha-1}{3^\\beta}$ and $\\operatorname{gcd}(\\alpha, \\beta)=1$, then</p>\n<p>$\\alpha+\\beta$ is equal to</p>",
