      "q": "If for $3 \\leq r \\leq 30$, $\\left({^{30}C_{30-r}}\\right) + 3\\left({^{30}C_{31-r}}\\right) + 3\\left({^{30}C_{32-r}}\\right) + \\left({^{30}C_{33-r}}\\right) = {^mC_r}$, then m equals :",
      "qHtml": "<p>If for $3 \\leq r \\leq 30$, $\\left({^{30}C_{30-r}}\\right) + 3\\left({^{30}C_{31-r}}\\right) + 3\\left({^{30}C_{32-r}}\\right) + \\left({^{30}C_{33-r}}\\right) = {^mC_r}$, then m equals :</p>",
