      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& y=\\frac{5-x}{x^2-3 x+2} \\\\\n& y x^2-3 x y+2 y+x-5=0 \\\\\n& y z^2+(-3 y+1) x+(2 y-5)=0\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nCase I : If $y=0$ (Accepted)\n\n$$\\Rightarrow x=5$$\n\nCase II : If $y \\neq 0$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{D} \\geq 0 \\\\\n& (-3 y+1)^2-4(y)(2 y-5) \\geq 0 \\\\\n& 9 y^2+1-6 y-8 y^2+20 y \\geq 0 \\\\\n& y^2+14 y+1 \\geq 0 \\\\\n& (y+7)^2-48 \\geq 0 \\\\\n& |y+7| \\geq 4 \\sqrt{3} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow y+7 \\geq 4 \\sqrt{3} \\text { or } \\mathrm{y}+7 \\leq-4 \\sqrt{3} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{y} \\geq 4 \\sqrt{3}-7 \\text { or } \\mathrm{y} \\leq-4 \\sqrt{3}-7\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nFrom Case I and Case II\n\n$$y \\in(-\\infty,-4 \\sqrt{3}-7] \\cup[4 \\sqrt{3}-7, \\infty)$$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { So } \\alpha=-4 \\sqrt{3}-7 \\\\\n& \\quad \\beta=4 \\sqrt{3}-7 \\\\\n& \\begin{aligned}\n\\Rightarrow a^2+b^2 & =(-4 \\sqrt{3}-7)^2+(4 \\sqrt{3}-7)^2 \\\\\n& =2(48+49) \\\\\n& =194\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
