      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 6th April Evening Shift. Correct option: A. $\\begin{aligned} & z=\\frac{-\\sqrt{6} i \\pm \\sqrt{-6+12}}{2} \\\\ & =\\frac{-\\sqrt{6} i \\pm \\sqrt{6}}{2} \\\\ & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}( \\pm 1-i)\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\alpha=\\frac{-\\sqrt{6}}{2}(1+\\mathrm{i}), \\beta=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}(1-\\mathrm{i}) \\\\ & \\alpha=\\frac{-\\sqrt{6}}{2} \\times \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i} \\pi / 4}, \\beta=+\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2} \\times \\sqrt{2}-\\mathrm{i} \\pi / 4 \\\\ & \\alpha=-\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i} \\pi / 4}, \\beta=+\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{e}^{-\\mathrm{i} \\pi / 4}\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\alpha^8+\\beta^8=81 \\cdot \\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i} 2 \\pi}+81 \\cdot \\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}(-2 \\pi)} \\\\ & =81(1+1)=162\\end{aligned}$",
