      "qHtml": "<p>Let $f: \\mathbb{R} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ be a function defined by $f(x)=(2+3 a) x^2+\\left(\\frac{a+2}{a-1}\\right) x+b, a \\neq 1$. If $f(x+y)=f(x)+f(\\mathrm{y})+1-\\frac{2}{7} x \\mathrm{y}$, then the value of $28 \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^5|f(i)|$ is</p>",
