      "q": "Let $f(x)=\\lim \\limits_{y \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{(1-\\cos (x y)) \\tan (x y)}{y^3}$. Then the number of solutions of the equation $f(x)=\\sin x$, $x \\in \\mathbf{R}$ is :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let $f(x)=\\lim \\limits_{y \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{(1-\\cos (x y)) \\tan (x y)}{y^3}$. Then the number of solutions of the equation $f(x)=\\sin x$, $x \\in \\mathbf{R}$ is :</p>",
