      "qHtml": "<p>The product of all possible values of $\\alpha$, for which \n<br><br>$\\lim \\limits_{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left(\\frac{1-\\cos (\\alpha x) \\cos ((\\alpha+1) x) \\cos ((\\alpha+2) x)}{\\sin ^2((\\alpha+1) x)}\\right)=2$, is :</p>",
