      "qHtml": "<p>Let $f: \\mathbb{R} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ be a continuous function satisfying $f(0)=1$ and $f(2 x)-f(x)=x$ for all $x \\in \\mathbb{R}$. If $\\lim _\\limits{n \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left\\{f(x)-f\\left(\\frac{x}{2^n}\\right)\\right\\}=G(x)$, then $\\sum_\\limits{r=1}^{10} G\\left(r^2\\right)$ is equal to</p>",
