      "q": "The sum of all the integral values of $p$ such that the equation $3 \\sin ^2 x+12 \\cos x-3=p, x \\in \\mathbb{R}$, has at least one solution, is:",
      "qHtml": "<p>The sum of all the integral values of $p$ such that the equation $3 \\sin ^2 x+12 \\cos x-3=p, x \\in \\mathbb{R}$, has at least one solution, is:</p>",
