      "qHtml": "<p>Let</p><p>$A = \\{ z \\in \\mathbb{C} : |z - 2| \\leq 4 \\}$ and</p><p>$B = \\{ z \\in \\mathbb{C} : |z - 2| + |z + 2| = 5 \\}$.</p><p>Then the max $\\{|z_1 - z_2| : z_1 \\in A \\text{ and } z_2 \\in B \\}$ is :</p>",
