      "qHtml": "Let $${Z_1}$$ and $${Z_2}$$ be two roots of the equation $${Z^2} + aZ + b = 0$$, Z being complex. Further , assume that the origin, $${Z_1}$$ and $${Z_2}$$ form an equilateral triangle. Then :",
