      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\alpha_\\theta$ and $\\beta_\\theta$ be the distinct roots of $2 x^2+(\\cos \\theta) x-1=0, \\theta \\in(0,2 \\pi)$. If m and M are the minimum and the maximum values of $\\alpha_\\theta^4+\\beta_\\theta^4$, then $16(M+m)$ equals :</p>",
