      "q": "Let $\\alpha=3+4+8+9+13+14+\\ldots$ upto 40 terms. If $(\\tan \\beta)^{\\frac{\\alpha}{1020}}$ is a root of the equation $x^2+x-2=0, \\beta \\in\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$, then $\\sin ^2 \\beta+3 \\cos ^2 \\beta$ is equal to :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\alpha=3+4+8+9+13+14+\\ldots$ upto 40 terms. If $(\\tan \\beta)^{\\frac{\\alpha}{1020}}$ is a root of the equation $x^2+x-2=0, \\beta \\in\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$, then $\\sin ^2 \\beta+3 \\cos ^2 \\beta$ is equal to :</p>",
