      "qHtml": "<p>If $ \\frac{1}{1^4} + \\frac{1}{2^4} + \\frac{1}{3^4} + \\ldots \\infty= \\frac{\\pi^4}{90} $,</p> <p>$\\frac{1}{1^4} + \\frac{1}{3^4} + \\frac{1}{5^4} + \\ldots \\infty= \\alpha $,</p> <p>$ \\frac{1}{2^4} + \\frac{1}{4^4} + \\frac{1}{6^4} + \\ldots \\infty= \\beta $,</p> <p>then $ \\frac{\\alpha}{\\beta} $ is equal to :</p>",
