      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 22nd January Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots \\ldots, a_{2 k} \\quad \\rightarrow \\mathrm{A.P.}\\\\\n& \\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{\\mathrm{k}} \\mathrm{a}_{2 \\mathrm{r}-1}=40, \\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{\\mathrm{k}} \\mathrm{a}_{2 \\mathrm{r}}=55, \\mathrm{a}_{2 \\mathrm{k}}-\\mathrm{a}_1=27 \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{k}}{2}\\left[2 \\mathrm{a}_1+(\\mathrm{k}-1) 2 \\mathrm{~d}\\right]=40, \\frac{\\mathrm{k}}{2}\\left[2 \\mathrm{a}_2+(\\mathrm{k}-1) 2 \\mathrm{~d}\\right]=55, \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~d}=\\frac{27}{2 \\mathrm{k}-1} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{a}_1=\\frac{40}{\\mathrm{k}}-(\\mathrm{k}-1) \\mathrm{d}=\\frac{55}{\\mathrm{k}}-\\mathrm{kd} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~d}=\\frac{15}{\\mathrm{k}} \\Rightarrow \\frac{27}{2 \\mathrm{k}-1}=\\frac{15}{\\mathrm{k}} \\Rightarrow 9 \\mathrm{k}=10 \\mathrm{k}-5 \\\\\n& \\therefore \\mathrm{k}=5\n\\end{aligned}$$",
