      "s": "JEE Main 2020 (Online) 4th September Evening Slot. Correct option: D. Consider the three consecutive coefficients as\n\n$$^{n + 5}{C_r},{\\,^{n + 5}}{C_{r + 1}},{\\,^{n + 5}}{C_{r + 2}}$$\n\n$$ \\because $$ $${{^{n + 5}{C_r}} \\over {^{n + 5}{C_{r + 1}}}} = {1 \\over 2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {{r + 1} \\over {n + 5 - r}} = {1 \\over 2} \\Rightarrow 3r = n + 3$$ ...(i)\n\nand $${{^{n + 5}{C_{r + 1}}} \\over {^{n + 5}{C_{r + 2}}}} = {5 \\over 7}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $$ \\Rightarrow {{r + 2} \\over {n + 4 - r}} = {5 \\over 7} \\Rightarrow 12r = 5n + 6$$ ...(ii)\n\nFrom (i) and (ii) n = 6\n\nLargest coefficient in the expansion is $${^{11}{C_6}}$$ = 462",
