      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 20th July Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $${(1 - x)^{101}}{({x^2} + x + 1)^{100}}$$\n\nCoefficient of $${x^{256}} = {[(1 - x)(1 + x + {x^2})]^{100}}(1 - x) = {(1 - {x^3})^{100}}(1 - x)$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow ({}^{100}{C_0} - {}^{100}{C_1}{x^3} + {}^{100}{C_2}{x^6} - {}^{100}{C_3}{x^9}...)(1 - x)$$\n\n$$\\sum {{{( - 1)}^r}{}^{100}{C_r}{x^{3r}}(1 - x)} $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow 3r = 256$$ or $$255 \\Rightarrow r = {{256} \\over 3}$$ (Reject)\n\nr = 85\n\nCoefficient = $${}^{100}{C_{85}} = {}^{100}{C_{15}}$$",
