      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 6th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{n}}\\left(1^2+2^2+\\ldots+\\mathrm{n}^2\\right) \\\\ & \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{n}(\\mathrm{n}+1)(2 \\mathrm{n}+1)}{6 \\mathrm{n}} \\\\ & \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\frac{1}{6}\\left[2 \\mathrm{n}^2+3 \\mathrm{n}+1\\right] \\\\ & \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\Sigma \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\frac{1}{6}\\left[2 \\Sigma \\mathrm{n}^2+3 \\Sigma \\mathrm{n}+\\Sigma 1\\right] \\\\ & \\Sigma \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\frac{1}{6}\\left[2 \\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{n}(\\mathrm{n}+1)(2 \\mathrm{n}+1)}{6}+\\frac{3 \\mathrm{n}(\\mathrm{n}+1)}{2}+\\mathrm{n}\\right] \\\\ & \\mathrm{S}_{10}=\\frac{1}{6}\\left[\\frac{2 \\times 10 \\times 11 \\times 21}{6}+\\frac{3}{2} \\times 10 \\times 11+10\\right] \\\\ & =\\frac{10}{6}\\left[77+\\frac{33}{2}+1\\right]=\\frac{315}{2}\\end{aligned}$",
