      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: B. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& S_n=\\sum_{r=1}^n \\frac{4 r}{4+3 r^2+r^4} \\\\\n& =2 \\sum_{r=1}^n \\frac{2 r}{\\left(r^2+2\\right)^2-r^2}=2 \\sum_{r=1}^n \\frac{\\left(r^2+2+r\\right)-\\left(r^2+2-r\\right)}{\\left(r^2+2+r\\right)\\left(r^2+2-r\\right)} \\\\\n& =2 \\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac{1}{r^2+2-r}-\\frac{1}{r^2+2+r}\\right) \\\\\n& S_{20}=2\\left[\\left(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{8}\\right)+\\ldots\\right] \\\\\n& \\quad=2\\left(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{20^2+2+20}\\right) \\\\\n& \\quad=2\\left(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{422}\\right) \\\\\n& \\quad=2\\left(\\frac{422-2}{422 \\times 2}\\right)=\\frac{420}{422}=\\frac{210}{211}=\\frac{m}{n} \\\\\n& m+n=421\n\\end{aligned}$$",
