      "q": "A bag contains $(\\mathrm{N}+1)$ coins -N fair coins, and one coin with 'Head' on both sides. A coin is selected at random and tossed. If the probability of getting 'Head' is $\\frac{9}{16}$, then N is equal to:",
      "qHtml": "<p>A bag contains $(\\mathrm{N}+1)$ coins -N fair coins, and one coin with 'Head' on both sides. A coin is selected at random and tossed. If the probability of getting 'Head' is $\\frac{9}{16}$, then N is equal to:</p>",
