      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Morning Shift. Correct option: A. $$ \\begin{aligned} & \\text { Mean }=8 \\\\ & \\frac{2+4+10+x+y+12+14}{7}=8 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow x+y=14 \\\\ & \\text { variance }=16 \\\\ & 16=\\frac{2^2+4^2+10^2+x^2+y^2+12^2+14^2+y^2}{7}-8^2 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow x^2+y^2=100 \\\\ & \\therefore x=8, y=6 \\\\ & \\text { New set }:\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\} \\\\ & \\text { Required probability }=1-P(\\text { both number are } \\geq 4) \\\\ & =1-\\frac{{ }^3 C_2}{{ }^6 C_2} \\\\ & =1-\\frac{3}{15} \\\\ & =\\frac{4}{5} \\end{aligned} $$",
