      "q": "Let Ajay will not appear in JEE exam with probability $\\mathrm{p}=\\frac{2}{7}$, while both Ajay and Vijay will appear in the exam with probability $\\mathrm{q}=\\frac{1}{5}$. Then the probability, that Ajay will appear in the exam and Vijay will not appear is :",
      "qHtml": "Let Ajay will not appear in JEE exam with probability $\\mathrm{p}=\\frac{2}{7}$, while both Ajay and Vijay will appear in the exam with probability $\\mathrm{q}=\\frac{1}{5}$. Then the probability, that Ajay will appear in the exam and Vijay will not appear is :",
