      "s": "JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th April Morning Slot. Correct option: A. [Diagram: JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th April Morning Slot Mathematics - Circle Question 134 English Explanation]\n\nLet the point of tangency A(cos $$\\theta $$, sin $$\\theta $$)\n\nEquation of tangent at A,\n\nxcos $$\\theta $$ + ysin $$\\theta $$ = 1\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ P(sec$$\\theta $$, 0) and Q(0, cosec$$\\theta $$)\n\nLet M(h, k) is the mid-point of PQ.\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ h = $${{\\sec\\theta + 0} \\over 2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 2h = sec $$\\theta $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ cos $$\\theta $$ = $${1 \\over {2h}}$$ .....(1)\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ k = $${{\\cos ec\\theta + 0} \\over 2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ 2k = cosec $$\\theta $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ sin $$\\theta $$ = $${1 \\over {2k}}$$ .....(2)\n\nFrom (1) and (2),\n\nsin 2 $$\\theta $$ + cos 2 $$\\theta $$ = $${\\left( {{1 \\over {2h}}} \\right)^2} + {\\left( {{1 \\over {2k}}} \\right)^2}$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $${1 \\over {4{h^2}}} + {1 \\over {4{k^2}}} = 1$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $${{{h^2} + {k^2}} \\over {4{h^2}{k^2}}} = 1$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ $${h^2} + {k^2} = 4{h^2}{k^2}$$\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ Locus of the midpoint,\n\nx 2 + y 2 – 4x 2 y 2 = 0",
