      "qHtml": "<p>Let $x=9$ be a directrix of an ellipse E , whose centre is at the origin and eccentricity is $\\frac{1}{3}$. Let $\\mathrm{P}(\\alpha, 0)$, $\\alpha>0$, be a focus of E and AB be a chord passing through P . Then the locus of the mid point of AB is :</p>",
