      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\frac{x^2}{f\\left(a^2+7 a+3\\right)}+\\frac{y^2}{f(3 a+15)}=1$ represent an ellipse with major axis along $y$-axis, where $f$ is a strictly decreasing positive function on $\\mathbf{R}$. If the set of all possible values of $a$ is $\\mathbf{R}-[\\alpha, \\beta]$, then $\\alpha^2+\\beta^2$ is equal to :</p>",
