      "q": "Suppose that two chords, drawn from the point $(1,2)$ on the circle $x^2+y^2+x-3 y=0$ are bisected by the $y$-axis. If the other ends of these chords are R and S , and the mid point of the line segment RS is $(\\alpha, \\beta)$, then $6(\\alpha+\\beta)$ is equal to :",
      "qHtml": "<p>Suppose that two chords, drawn from the point $(1,2)$ on the circle $x^2+y^2+x-3 y=0$ are bisected by the $y$-axis. If the other ends of these chords are R and S , and the mid point of the line segment RS is $(\\alpha, \\beta)$, then $6(\\alpha+\\beta)$ is equal to :</p>",
