      "s": "JEE Main 2022 (Online) 27th June Morning Shift. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Main 2022 (Online) 27th June Morning Shift Mathematics - Properties of Triangle Question 13 English Explanation]\n\n$$CD = \\sqrt {{{(10 + {x^2})}^2} - {{(10 - {x^2})}^2}} = 2\\sqrt {10} |x|$$\n\nArea $$ = {1 \\over 2} \\times CD \\times AB = {1 \\over 2} \\times 2\\sqrt {10} |x|(20 - 2{x^2})$$\n\n$$A = \\sqrt {10} |x|(10 - {x^2})$$\n\n$${{dA} \\over {dx}} = \\sqrt {10} {{|x|} \\over x}(10 - {x^2}) + \\sqrt {10} |x|( - 2x) = 0$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow 10 - {x^2} = 2{x^2}$$\n\n$$3{x^2} = 10$$\n\n$$x = k$$\n\n$$3{k^2} = 10$$",
