      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $$ \\begin{aligned} & (1+x)^{100}={ }^{100} C_0+{ }^{100} C_{1 x}+{ }^{100} C_{2 x^2}+\\ldots \\ldots . .+{ }^{100} C_{100 x^{100}} \\\\ & \\sum_{r=50}^{100} \\frac{{ }^{100} C_r}{r+1}=\\frac{1}{101} \\sum_{r=50}^{100}{ }^{101} C_{r+1} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{101} \\sum_{r=51}^{100}{ }^{101} C_r \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\frac{2^{100}}{101} \\end{aligned} $$",
