      "q": "Let $\\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}$ denote the coefficient of $x^{\\mathrm{r}}$ in the binomial expansion of $(1+x)^{\\mathrm{n}}, \\mathrm{n} \\in \\mathrm{N}, 0 \\leq \\mathrm{r} \\leq \\mathrm{n}$. If\n\n$P_n=C_0-C_1+\\frac{2^2}{3} C_2-\\frac{2^3}{4} C_3+\\ldots . .+\\frac{(-2)^n}{n+1} C_n$, then the value of $\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{25} \\frac{1}{P_{2 n}}$ equals.",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}$ denote the coefficient of $x^{\\mathrm{r}}$ in the binomial expansion of $(1+x)^{\\mathrm{n}}, \\mathrm{n} \\in \\mathrm{N}, 0 \\leq \\mathrm{r} \\leq \\mathrm{n}$. If \n<br><br>$P_n=C_0-C_1+\\frac{2^2}{3} C_2-\\frac{2^3}{4} C_3+\\ldots . .+\\frac{(-2)^n}{n+1} C_n$, then the value of $\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{25} \\frac{1}{P_{2 n}}$ equals.</p>",
