      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 22nd January Evening Shift. Correct option: A. $$ \\begin{aligned} P_n & =\\sum_{r=0}^n \\frac{{ }^n C_r(-2)^r}{r+1}=\\sum_{r=0}^n \\frac{1}{(n+1)}{ }^{n+1} C_{r+1}(-2)^r \\\\ & =\\frac{-1}{2(n+1)} \\sum_{r=0}^n{ }^{n+1} C_{r+1}(-2)^{r+1}=\\frac{-1}{2(n+1)}\\left[(1-2)^{n+1}-1\\right] \\\\ P_n & =\\frac{1}{2(n+1)}\\left[1-(-1)^{n+1}\\right] \\end{aligned} $$\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} & P_{2 n}=\\frac{1}{2(2 n+1)}\\left[1-(-1)^{2 n+1}\\right] \\\\ & P_{2 n}=\\frac{1}{2 n+1} \\\\ & \\sum_{n=0} \\frac{1}{P_{2 n}}=\\sum_{n=1}^{25}(2 n+1)=3+5+\\ldots . .+51=\\frac{25}{2}[51+3]=25 \\times 27=675 \\end{aligned} $$",
