      "a": 2,
      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift. Correct option: C. $$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\text { Let the observations be } x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_{99}, 50\\\\\n&\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Mean }=\\frac{x_1+x_2+\\ldots+x_9+50}{100}=40 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow x_1+x_2+\\ldots+x_{99}=4000-50 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow x_1+x_2+\\ldots+x_{99}=3950 \\\\\n& \\text { Current Mean }=\\frac{3950+40}{100} \\\\\n& \\mu=\\frac{399}{10}=39.9 \\\\\n& (\\text { S.D })^2=\\sum_{i=1}^{99} \\frac{\\left(x_i\\right)^2+2500}{100}-(40)^2 \\\\\n& \\sum_{i=1}^{99} x_i^2=160101 \\\\\n& (\\text { Correct S.D })^2=\\frac{160101+1600}{100}-\\left(\\frac{399}{10}\\right)^2 \\\\\n& \\sigma=5 \\\\\n& 10(\\mu+\\sigma)=10(39.9+5)=449\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
