      "q": "For a statistical data $\\mathrm{x}_1, \\mathrm{x}_2, \\ldots, \\mathrm{x}_{10}$ of 10 values, a student obtained the mean as 5.5 and $\\sum_{i=1}^{10} x_i^2=371$. He later found that he had noted two values in the data incorrectly as 4 and 5 , instead of the correct values 6 and 8 , respectively. The variance of the corrected data is",
      "qHtml": "<p>For a statistical data $\\mathrm{x}_1, \\mathrm{x}_2, \\ldots, \\mathrm{x}_{10}$ of 10 values, a student obtained the mean as 5.5 and $\\sum_{i=1}^{10} x_i^2=371$. He later found that he had noted two values in the data incorrectly as 4 and 5 , instead of the correct values 6 and 8 , respectively. The variance of the corrected data is</p>",
