      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 2nd April Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $$ \\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{A}=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll} 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & \\alpha \\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & \\mathrm{A}^2-4 \\mathrm{~A}+\\mathrm{I}=0 \\end{aligned} $$\n\ntrace of matrix\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} & \\alpha+1=4 \\\\ & \\alpha=3 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~B}=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll} 3 & 3 \\\\ \\beta & 2 \\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & \\mathrm{B}^2-5 \\mathrm{~B}-6 \\mathrm{I}=0 \\end{aligned} $$\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\operatorname{det} .(B)=6-3 \\beta=-6 \\\\ & 3 \\beta=12 \\\\ & \\beta=4 \\\\ & B-A=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{array}\\right] ; B+A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}4 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 5\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & (B-A)(B+A)=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}13 & 15 \\\\ 7 & 10\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & \\operatorname{adj}(A)=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right], \\operatorname{adjB}=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}2 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & \\operatorname{adj}(A+B)=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}5 & -5 \\\\ -5 & 4\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}$",
