      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 4th April Evening Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\begin{aligned}\n& A=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n0 & 1 & 0\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\n& A^2=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n0 & 1 & 0\n\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n0 & 1 & 0\n\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n1 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n1 & 0 & 1\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\n& A^3=A+A^2-I \\\\\n& A^3=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n2 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 1 & 0\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\n& A^4=A^2+A^2-I=2 A^2-I \\\\\n& A^4=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n2 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n2 & 0 & 1\n\\end{array}\\right] \\text { and } A^5=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n3 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n2 & 1 & 0\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\n& A^{50}=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n25 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n25 & 0 & 1\n\\end{array}\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\\\\n&\\text { Sum of elements }=53\n\\end{aligned}$$",
