      "qHtml": "<p>Let $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 5\\end{array}\\right]$. Then the sum of all elements of the matrix $\\operatorname{adj}\\left(\\operatorname{adj}\\left(2(\\operatorname{adj} \\mathrm{~A})^{-1}\\right)\\right)$ is equal to:</p>",
