      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift. Correct option: D. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& |\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj} A))|=81 \\\\\n& =|A|^{(n-1)^3}=(3)^4 \\Rightarrow|A|^8=3^4 \\Rightarrow|A|=3^{1 / 2} \\\\\n& |\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj} A)|^{\\frac{(n-1)^2}{2}}=|A|^{\\left(3 n^2-5 n-4\\right)} \\\\\n& {\\left[|A|^{(n-1)^2}\\right]^{\\frac{(n-1)^2}{2}}=|A|^{3 n^2-5 n-4}} \\\\\n& |A|^{2(n-1)^2}=|A|^{3 n^2-5 n-4} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2(n-1)^2=3 n^2-5 n-4 \\\\\n& \\quad n^2-n-6=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow n=-2,3 \\\\\n& \\sum_{x \\leftarrow 5}\\left|A^{n^2+n}\\right|=\\left|A^2\\right|+\\left|A^{12}\\right| \\\\\n& =3+3^6=732\n\\end{aligned}$$",
