      "qHtml": "<p>Let $ \\alpha, \\beta \\ (\\alpha \\neq \\beta) $ be the values of $ m $, for which the equations $ x+y+z=1 $, $ x+2y+4z=m $ and $ x+4y+10z=m^2 $ have infinitely many solutions. Then the value of $ \\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{10} (n^{\\alpha}+n^{\\beta}) $ is equal to :</p>",
