      "qHtml": "<p>For a $3 \\times 3$ matrix $M$, let trace $(M)$ denote the sum of all the diagonal elements of $M$. Let $A$ be a $3 \\times 3$ matrix such that $|A|=\\frac{1}{2}$ and trace $(A)=3$. If $B=\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}(2 A))$, then the value of $|B|+$ trace $(B)$ equals :</p>",
