      "q": "If the system of equations\n$x + 5y + 6z = 4$\n$2x + 3y + 4z = 7$\n$x + 6y + az = b$\nhas infinitely many solutions, then the point $(a, b)$ lies on the line",
      "qHtml": "<p>If the system of equations</p> <p>$x + 5y + 6z = 4$</p> <p>$2x + 3y + 4z = 7$</p> <p>$x + 6y + az = b$</p> <p>has infinitely many solutions, then the point $(a, b)$ lies on the line</p>",
