      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\alpha, \\beta \\in \\mathbb{R}$ be such that the system of linear equations</p>\n<p>$ \\begin{aligned} x + 2y + z &= 5 \\\\ 2x + y + \\alpha z &= 5 \\\\ 8x + 4y + \\beta z &= 18 \\end{aligned} $</p>\n<p>has no solution. Then $\\frac{\\beta}{\\alpha}$ is equal to :</p>",
