      "qHtml": "<p>For the matrices $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 3 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix}$ and $B = \\begin{bmatrix} -29 & 49 \\\\ -13 & 18 \\end{bmatrix}$, if $(A^{15} + B) \\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}$, then among the following which one is <b>true</b>?</p>",
