      "qHtml": "<p>Let the vectors $\\vec{a} = -\\hat{i} + \\hat{j} + 3\\hat{k}$ and $\\vec{b} = \\hat{i} + 3\\hat{j} + \\hat{k}$. For some $\\lambda, \\mu \\in \\mathbb{R}$, let $\\vec{c} = \\lambda \\vec{a} + \\mu \\vec{b}$.</p><p>If $\\vec{c} \\cdot (3\\hat{i} - 6\\hat{j} + 2\\hat{k}) = 10$ and $\\vec{c} \\cdot (\\hat{i} + \\hat{j} + \\hat{k}) = -2$, then $|\\vec{c}|^2$ is equal to :</p>",
