      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 24th January Morning Shift. Correct option: A. $$ \\begin{aligned} &\\begin{aligned} & \\vec{a}=2 \\hat{i}+\\hat{j}-2 \\hat{k}, \\vec{b}=\\hat{i}-\\hat{j} \\\\ & |\\vec{a}|=\\sqrt{4+1+4}=3,|\\vec{b}|=\\sqrt{1+1}=\\sqrt{2} \\end{aligned}\\\\ &\\text { It is given that } \\vec{c}=\\vec{a} \\times \\vec{b}\\\\ &\\begin{gathered} \\vec{c}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} \\hat{i} & \\hat{j} & \\hat{k} \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 \\end{array}\\right| \\\\ \\vec{c}=\\hat{i}(0+2)-\\hat{j}(0+2)+\\hat{k}(-2-1) \\\\ \\vec{c}=2 \\hat{i}-2 \\hat{j}-3 \\hat{k} \\end{gathered} \\end{aligned} $$\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} &|\\vec{c}|=\\sqrt{4+4+1}=\\sqrt{9}=3\\\\ &\\text { It is given that }|\\vec{c} \\times \\vec{d}|=3 \\& \\text { angle between } \\vec{c} \\& \\vec{d} \\text { is } \\pi / 4\\\\ &\\begin{gathered} |\\vec{c}||\\vec{d}| \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{4}=3 \\\\ 3|\\vec{d}| \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}=3 \\Rightarrow|\\vec{d}|=\\sqrt{2} \\\\ |\\vec{d}-\\vec{a}|=\\sqrt{11}(\\text { given }) \\\\ |\\vec{d}-\\vec{a}|^2=11 \\\\ |\\vec{d}|^2+|\\vec{a}|^2-2 \\vec{d} \\cdot \\vec{a}=11 \\\\ 2+9-2 \\vec{d} \\cdot \\vec{a}=11 \\text { use }|\\vec{a}|=3 \\\\ 11-2 \\vec{d} \\cdot \\vec{a}=11 \\\\ -2 \\vec{d} \\cdot \\vec{a}=0 \\\\ \\vec{d} \\cdot \\vec{a}=0 \\end{gathered} \\end{aligned} $$",
