      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\vec{a}$ and $\\vec{b}$ be two unit vectors such that the angle between them is $\\frac{\\pi}{3}$. If $\\lambda \\vec{a}+2 \\vec{b}$ and $3 \\vec{a}-\\lambda \\vec{b}$ are perpendicular to each other, then the number of values of $\\lambda$ in $[-1,3]$ is :</p>",
