      "s": "JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift. Correct option: C. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& 6|\\vec{a} \\times \\vec{b}|=15 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow|\\vec{a} \\times \\vec{b}|=\\frac{5}{2}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift Mathematics - Vector Algebra Question 66 English Explanation 1]\n\nArea of quadrilateral $$O A B C$$\n\n$$=$$ area of $$\\triangle O A C+$$ area of $$\\triangle A B C$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift Mathematics - Vector Algebra Question 66 English Explanation 2]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\frac{15}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}|(\\overrightarrow{A B} \\times \\overrightarrow{B C})| \\\\\n& =\\frac{15}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}|(4 \\vec{a}+5 \\vec{b}) \\times(6 \\vec{a}+2 \\vec{b})| \\\\\n& =\\frac{15}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}|(22 \\vec{a} \\times \\vec{b})| \\\\\n& =\\frac{15}{2}+11 \\times \\frac{5}{2} \\\\\n& =\\frac{70}{2}=35\n\\end{aligned}$$",
