      "qHtml": "If the volume of a parallelopiped, whose<br> coterminus edges are given by the <br>vectors $$\\overrightarrow a  = \\widehat i + \\widehat j + n\\widehat k$$, <br>$$\\overrightarrow b  = 2\\widehat i + 4\\widehat j - n\\widehat k$$ and  <br>$$\\overrightarrow c  = \\widehat i + n\\widehat j + 3\\widehat k$$ ($$n \\ge 0$$), is 158 cu. units, then :",
