      "qHtml": "<p>If the distance of the point $(a, 2,5)$ from the image of the point $(1,2,7)$ in the line $\\frac{x}{1}=\\frac{y-1}{1}=\\frac{z-2}{2}$ is 4 , then the sum of all possible values of $a$ is equal to :</p>",
