      "qHtml": "<p>The square of the distance of the point $(-2,-8,6)$ from the line $\\frac{x-1}{1}=\\frac{y-1}{2}=\\frac{z}{-1}$ along the line $\\frac{x+5}{1}=\\frac{y+5}{-1}=\\frac{z}{2}$ is equal to:</p>",
