      "qHtml": "<p>If $\\lim _\\limits{x \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{e}}{1-\\mathrm{e}}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{e}}-\\frac{x}{1+x}\\right)\\right)^x=\\alpha$, then the value of $\\frac{\\log _{\\mathrm{e}} \\alpha}{1+\\log _{\\mathrm{e}} \\alpha}$ equals :</p>",
