      "q": "If the function $f(x)=\\frac{e^x\\left(e^{\\tan x-x}-1\\right)+\\log _e(\\sec x+\\tan x)-x}{\\tan x-x}$ is continuous at $x=0$, then the value of $f(0)$ is equal to",
      "qHtml": "<p>If the function $f(x)=\\frac{e^x\\left(e^{\\tan x-x}-1\\right)+\\log _e(\\sec x+\\tan x)-x}{\\tan x-x}$ is continuous at $x=0$, then the value of $f(0)$ is equal to</p>",
