      "qHtml": "<p>If $\\sum_\\limits{r=1}^n T_r=\\frac{(2 n-1)(2 n+1)(2 n+3)(2 n+5)}{64}$, then $\\lim _\\limits{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\sum_\\limits{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac{1}{T_r}\\right)$ is equal to :</p>",
