      "s": "JEE Main 2026 (Online) 23rd January Morning Shift. Correct option: C. $$ \\begin{aligned} & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\frac{-3}{2}} \\frac{a x^2+2 a x+3}{4 x^2+4 x-3}=b \\\\ & a x^2+2 a x+3=0 \\quad \\text { at } n=\\frac{-3}{2} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\frac{9 a}{4}-3 a+3=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\frac{3 a}{4}=3 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow a=4 \\\\ & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\frac{-3}{2}} \\frac{4 x^2+8 a x+3}{4 x^2+4 x-3} \\end{aligned} $$\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} & =\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\frac{-3}{2}} \\frac{(2 x+1)(2 x+3)}{(2 x-1)(2 x+3)} \\\\ & =\\frac{-2}{-4}=\\frac{1}{2}=b \\\\ & \\therefore f(x)=\\frac{2 x+1}{2 x-1} \\\\ & f(f(x))=\\frac{7}{5} \\\\ & \\therefore \\quad \\frac{2 f(x)+1}{2 f(x)-1}=\\frac{7}{5} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow f(x)=3 \\\\ & \\frac{2 x+1}{2 x-1}=3 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow x=1 \\end{aligned} $$",
