      "qHtml": "<p>Let $[\\cdot]$ denote the greatest integer function, and let $f(x)=\\min \\left\\{\\sqrt{2} x, x^2\\right\\}$.</p>\n<p>Let $\\mathrm{S}=\\left\\{x \\in(-2,2)\\right.$ : the function $\\mathrm{g}(x)=|x|\\left[x^2\\right]$ is discontinuous at $\\left.x\\right\\}$.</p>\n<p>Then $\\sum\\limits_{x \\in \\mathrm{~S}} f(x)$ equals</p>",
