      "qHtml": "<p>Let $f(x)$ be a polynomial of degree 5, and have extrema at $x = 1$ and $x = -1$. If $\\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{f(x)}{x^3} \\right) = -5$, then $f(2) - f(-2)$ is equal to:</p>",
