      "qHtml": "<p>The number of critical points of the function <br><br>$f(x) = \\begin{cases} |\\frac{\\sin x}{x}|, & x \\neq 0 \\\\ 1, & x = 0 \\end{cases}$ in the interval $(-2\\pi, 2\\pi)$ is equal to :</p>",
