      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 8th April Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $$\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{x}) & =\\frac{\\mathrm{x}}{3}+\\frac{3}{\\mathrm{x}}+3, \\mathrm{x} \\neq 0 \\\\\n\\mathrm{f}^{\\prime}(\\mathrm{x}) & =\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{3}{\\mathrm{x}^2}=0 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x}= \\pm 3 \\\\\n\\mathrm{f}^{\\prime}(\\mathrm{x}) & =\\frac{\\mathrm{x}^2-3}{3 \\mathrm{x}^2} \\\\\n\\mathrm{f}^{\\prime}(\\mathrm{x}) & >0 \\forall(-\\infty,-3) \\cup(3, \\infty) \\rightarrow \\text { increasing } \\\\\n\\mathrm{f}^{\\prime}(\\mathrm{x}) & <0 \\forall(-3,0) \\cup(0,3) \\rightarrow \\text { decreasing } \\\\\n\\sum_{\\mathrm{i}=1}^5 \\alpha_{\\mathrm{i}}^2 & =(-3)^2+(3)^2+(-3)^2+(0)^2+(3)^2 \\\\\n& =36\n\\end{aligned}$$",
