      "qHtml": "<p>Let <b>f : ℝ $$ \\to $$ ℝ</b> be a polynomial function of degree four having extreme values at <b>x = 4</b> and <b>x = 5</b>. If <span>$ \\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x)}{x^2} = 5 $</span>, then <b>f(2)</b> is equal to :</p>",
