      "s": "JEE Main 2025 (Online) 3rd April Evening Shift. Correct option: A. $$\\begin{aligned}\n& f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}\n|-x-2+2 x| & x \\leq-2 \\\\\n|x+2+2 x| & -2 \\leq x \\leq 0 \\\\\n|x+2-2 x| & x \\geq 0\n\\end{array}\\right. \\\\\n& f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{lc}\n|-x-2+2 x| & x \\leq-2 \\\\\n|x+2+2 x| & -2 \\leq x \\leq 0 \\\\\n|x+2-2 x| & x \\geq 0\n\\end{array}\\right. \\\\\n& f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}\n|x-2| & x \\leq-2 \\\\\n|3 x+2| & -2< x \\leq 0 \\\\\n|2-x| & x>0\n\\end{array}\\right.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$$\\begin{gathered}\nf(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}\n2-x & x \\leq-2 \\\\\n-3 x-2 & -2< x \\leq-\\frac{2}{3} \\\\\n3 x+2 & -\\frac{2}{3}< x \\leq 0\n\\end{array}\\right. \\\\\nf(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}\n2-x & x \\leq-2 \\\\\n-3 x-2 & -2< x \\leq-\\frac{2}{3} \\\\\n3 x+2 & -\\frac{2}{3}< x \\leq 0 \\\\\n2-x & 0< x<2 \\\\\nx-2 & x \\geq 2\n\\end{array}\\right.\n\\end{gathered}$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Main 2025 (Online) 3rd April Evening Shift Mathematics - Application of Derivatives Question 13 English Explanation]\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { No. of maxima }=1 \\\\\n& \\text { No. of minima }=2 \\\\\n& m=2 \\\\\n& n=1 \\\\\n& m+n=3\n\\end{aligned}$$",
