      "qHtml": "<p>Let $$\\lambda$$$$^ * $$ be the largest value of $$\\lambda$$ for which the function $${f_\\lambda }(x) = 4\\lambda {x^3} - 36\\lambda {x^2} + 36x + 48$$ is increasing for all x $$\\in$$ R. Then $${f_{{\\lambda ^ * }}}(1) + {f_{{\\lambda ^ * }}}( - 1)$$ is equal to :</p>",
