      "qHtml": "Let ƒ : [0, 2] $$ \\to $$ R be a twice differentiable\nfunction such that ƒ''(x) &gt; 0, for all x $$ \\in $$ (0, 2).\nIf $$\\phi $$(x) = ƒ(x) + ƒ(2 – x), then $$\\phi $$ is :",
