      "qHtml": "A lizard, at an initial distance of 21 cm behind an insect moves from rest with an acceleration of $2 \\mathrm{~cm} / \\mathrm{s}^2$ and pursues the insect which is crawling uniformly along a straight line at a speed of $20 \\mathrm{~cm} / \\mathrm{s}$. Then the lizard will catch the insect after :",
