      "qHtml": "Let $f:[1, \\infty) \\rightarrow[2, \\infty)$ be a differentiable function. If $10 \\int_1^x f(\\mathrm{t}) \\mathrm{dt}=5 x f(x)-x^5-9$ for all $x \\geqslant 1$, then the value of $f(3)$ is :",
