      "s": "JEE Main 2023 (Online) 25th January Morning Shift. Correct option: B. $$\nf(x)=\\int_0^2 e^{|x-t|} d t\n$$\n\nFor $x>2$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\int_0^2 e^{x-t} d t=e^x\\left(1-e^{-2}\\right)\n$$\n\nFor $x 2$\n\n$$\n\\left.f(x)\\right|_{\\min =e^2-1}\n$$\n\nFor $\\mathrm{x}<0$\n\n$$\n\\left.f(x)\\right|_{\\min =e^2-1}\n$$\n\nFor $x \\in[0,2]$\n\n$$\n\\left.f(x)\\right|_{\\min }=2(e-1)\n$$",
