      "q": "Let f be a real valued continuous function on [0, 1] and $$f(x) = x + \\int\\limits_0^1 {(x - t)f(t)dt} $$.\n\nThen, which of the following points (x, y) lies on the curve y = f(x) ?",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let f be a real valued continuous function on [0, 1] and $$f(x) = x + \\int\\limits_0^1 {(x - t)f(t)dt} $$.</p>\n<p>Then, which of the following points (x, y) lies on the curve y = f(x) ?</p>",
