      "s": "JEE Main 2021 (Online) 16th March Evening Shift. Correct option: C. $$(x - 2)Q(x) + 5 = {x^2} + bx + c$$\n\nPut x = 2\n\n5 = 2b + c + 4 .... (1)\n\n$$\\int_0^1 {({x^2} + bx + c)dx} = 1$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow {1 \\over 3} + {b \\over 2} + c = 1$$\n\n$${b \\over 2} + c = {2 \\over 3}$$ .... (2)\n\nSolve (1) & (2)\n\n$$b = {2 \\over 9}$$\n\n$$c = {5 \\over 9}$$\n\n9(b + c) = 7",
