      "qHtml": "<p>The value of the integral $\\int\\limits_{-\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\left(\\frac{32 \\cos ^4 x}{1+e^{\\sin x}}\\right) d x$ is :</p>",
