      "qHtml": "<p>Let $f(x)=\\int \\frac{\\left(2-x^2\\right) \\cdot \\mathrm{e}^x}{(\\sqrt{1+x})(1-x)^{3 / 2}} \\mathrm{~d} x$. If $f(0)=0$, then $f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)$ is equal to:</p>",
