      "qHtml": "<p>Let y = y(x) be the solution of the differential equation $(x^2 + 1)y' - 2xy = (x^4 + 2x^2 + 1)\\cos x$,</p>\n<p>$y(0) = 1$. Then $ \\int\\limits_{-3}^{3} y(x) \\, dx $ is :</p>",
