      "qHtml": "<p>If a curve $y=y(x)$ passes through the point $\\left(1, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ and satisfies the differential equation $\\left(7 x^4 \\cot y-\\mathrm{e}^x \\operatorname{cosec} y\\right) \\frac{\\mathrm{d} x}{\\mathrm{~d} y}=x^5, x \\geq 1$, then at $x=2$, the value of $\\cos y$ is :</p>",
